arter Scholarship Foundation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Celebrities and other well-heeled folks don’t usually deign to engage in such hoi-polloi amusements as Whac-a-Mole. But the snaking lines for games at a carnival put on by Jay-Z to raise money for his Shawn Carter Scholarship Foundation on Thursday night were easily explained: Among the rows of stuffed-tiger prizes, things like Tory Burch bags poked out, along with gleaming Gibson guitars and a basketball signed by Magic Johnson. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/01/nyregion/nocturnalist1/nocturnalist1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 325, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/01/nyregion/nocturnalist1/nocturnalist1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 325}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/01/nyregion/nocturnalist1/nocturnalist1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/01/nyregion/nocturnalist1/nocturnalist1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/01/nyregion/nocturnalist1/nocturnalist1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Stepping Right Up for Jay-Z’s Carnival', 'kicker': 'Nocturnalist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Stepping Right Up For Jay-Z’s Carnival', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jay-Z', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stringer, Howard', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ph