ars removed from the stage, an occasional actor still suffers from a recurring occupational hazard.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/09/30/enough-with-the-agony-already/', 'snippet': 'Years removed from the stage, an occasional actor still suffers from a recurring occupational hazard.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every actor has had it. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Enough With the Agony, Already', 'kicker': 'Dick Cavett', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dreams', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-01T01:00:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dick Cavett', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cavett', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee1b5a2e-48f5-54ec-aa99-2af8d1c572bd', 'word_count': 1324, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee1b5a2e-48f5-54ec-aa99-2af8d1c572bd'}, {'abstract': 'Mythos, in Thornwood, has the laid-back atmosphere — warm and unhurried, communal — that one enjoys in similar neighborhood eating spots in sunny Greece.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/02/nyregion/mythos-in-thornwood-offers-authentic-greek-dishes.html', 'snippet': 'Mythos, in Thornwood, has the laid-back atmosphere — warm and unhurried, communal — that one enjoys in similar neighborhood eating spots in sunny Greece.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE large dining hall at Mythos, one of the latest additions to Thornwood’s roster of family-friendly restaurants, has the laid-back atmosphere — warm and unhurried, communal — that one might enjoy in similar neighborhood eating spots in sunny Greece, where families and other convivial groups enjoy lingering over their evening meal for hours. In fact, a large group near our table was doing just that — having a good time sharing a variety of dishes and washing them down with retsina or cloudy ouzo.', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/02/nyregion/02DINEWE1B/02DINEWE1B-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 980, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/02/nyregion/02DINEWE1B/02DINEWE1B-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/02/nyregion/02DINEWE1B/02DINEWE1B-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Warm and Communal, Like a Meal in Greece', 'kicker': 'Westchester Dining | Thornwood', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Warm and Communal, Like a Meal in Greece', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Westchester County (NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-01T01:05:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By M. H. Reed', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/9f14aaa5-05d8-529e-bda8-ba87aabbf471', 'word_count': 740, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f14aaa5-05d8-529e-bda8-ba87aabbf471'}, {'abstract': 'Mitt Romney has been knocking over one challenger after another in the G.O.P. presidential race. Is he responsible for the collapse of the Red Sox, too?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/01/o