tps://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/09/30/stokley-is-both-out-and-mum/', 'snippet': 'The Giants receiver will miss Sunday’s game, and could be out for longer than that.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Giants receiver Brandon Stokley left practice on Wednesday with what was described as a strained quadriceps, which will sideline him for at least Sunday’s game against the Cardinals in Arizona.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Stokley Is Both Out and Mum', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cruz, Victor', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stokley, Brandon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-01T01:08:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Viera', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Viera', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/47c33dd8-3957-5734-96d9-3e70d96bc3ec', 'word_count': 254, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47c33dd8-3957-5734-96d9-3e70d96bc3ec'}, {'abstract': 'Caracara Mexican Grill in Farmingdale offers friendly service in an attractive setting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/02/nyregion/caracara-mexican-grill-in-farmingdale-review.html', 'snippet': 'Caracara Mexican Grill in Farmingdale offers friendly service in an attractive setting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THERE’S a jolly fiesta atmosphere at Caracara Mexican Grill in Farmingdale. Diners entering the four-month-old restaurant on Main Street first encounter an attractive, popular bar, with a pressed-tin ceiling and Mexican tile floor. There, patrons nibble warm tortilla chips and sip the restaurant’s signature drink: a classic frozen margarita swirled with a pomegranate-hibiscus variation.', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/02/nyregion/02DINELI1A/02DINELI1A-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/02/nyregion/02DINELI1A/02DINELI1A-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Spirited Mexican Spot With a Pedigree', 'kicker': 'Long Island Dining | Farmingdale', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Spirited Mexican Spot With a Pedigree', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Long Island (NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-01T01:09:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanne Starkey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Starkey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a238a6f8-ba5b-5d5b-865b-312185bbfa39', 'word_count': 844, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a238a6f8-ba5b-5d5b-865b-312185bbfa39'}, {'abstract': 'In a magazine interview, Diana L. Taylor, the girlfriend of Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg, criticized President Obama, Senator Kirsten E. Gillibrand and the field of Republican presidential candidates.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/01/nyregion/diana-taylor-bloombergs-girlfriend-criticizes-obama-and-gillibrand.html', 'snippet': 'In a magazine interview, Diana L. Taylor, the girlfriend of Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg, criticized President Obama, Senator Kirsten E. Gillibrand and the field of Republican presidential candidates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As New York’s mayor, Michael R. Bloomberg is generally careful when discussing political leaders, measuring his words to avoid directly knocking anyone he might have to work with in representing the city’s interests. But his girlfriend, Diana L. Taylor, apparently feels no such constraints.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/01/nyregion/taylor/taylor-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/01/nyregion/taylor/taylor-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/01/nyregion/taylor/taylor-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Diana Taylor, Bloomberg’s Girlfriend, Criticizes Obama', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sharp Words by Bloomberg’s Girlfriend', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Taylor, Diana L', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gillibrand, Kirsten E', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-01T01:11:31+0000', 'd