nd black; a large strip of muscle near the hip no longer contracted. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/01/business/HIP-1/HIP-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/01/business/HIP-1/HIP-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/01/business/HIP-1/HIP-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 776, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/01/business/HIP-1/HIP-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/01/business/HIP-1/HIP-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Remedy Is Elusive as Metallic Hips Fail at a Fast Rate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Challenges Rise As Metallic Hips Fail at Fast Rate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hips', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Implants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medical Devices', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surgery and Surgeons', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Johnson & Johnson', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-01T02:05:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Barry Meier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Barry