 '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1a0ce477-910e-5851-8d35-c4825b25f8bf', 'word_count': 651, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a0ce477-910e-5851-8d35-c4825b25f8bf'}, {'abstract': 'This weekend, hundreds of ministers will speak up for presidential candidates they favor, flouting a law that prohibits tax-exempt organizations from campaigning on political issues.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/01/business/flouting-the-law-pastors-will-take-on-politics.html', 'snippet': 'This weekend, hundreds of ministers will speak up for presidential candidates they favor, flouting a law that prohibits tax-exempt organizations from campaigning on political issues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This weekend, hundreds of pastors, including some of the nation’s evangelical leaders, will climb into their pulpits to preach about American politics, flouting a decades-old law that prohibits tax-exempt churches and other charities from campaigning on election issues. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/01/business/CHURCH/CHURCH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/01/business/CHURCH/CHURCH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/01/business/CHURCH/CHURCH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 766, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/01/business/CHURCH/CHURCH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/01/business/CHURCH/CHURCH-thumbStandard.j