F.L. was the way to go.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/02/sports/football/businesslike-fitzpatrick-guides-bills-stirring-start.html', 'snippet': 'The Bills’ Ryan Fitzpatrick was thinking of a career on Wall Street before learning that maybe the N.F.L. was the way to go.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ORCHARD PARK, N.Y. — \xa0The groundwork for the predictable career on Wall Street had already been laid — the coursework in economics, the internship at a Boston hedge fund. Then Ryan Fitzpatrick’s college coach surprised him with a suggestion after his junior season: spend a long weekend that summer at the Manning family’s passing academy in Louisiana. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/02/sports/bills/bills-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 735, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/02/sports/bills/bills-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/02/sports/bills/bills-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Businesslike Quarterback Has Stirred the Bills', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Businesslike Quarterback Has Stirred the Bills', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Buffalo Bills', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-01T16:58:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judy Battista', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Battista', 'quali