wlaki.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SANA, Yemen — Yemeni officials provided more details on Saturday about their role in the tracking and killing of an American-born cleric, while a government spokesman said that the United States should show more appreciation to Yemen’s embattled president for his assistance in the case.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/02/world/02yemen/02yemen-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 978, 'width': 587, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/02/world/02yemen/02yemen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/02/world/02yemen/02yemen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Yemen Notes Its Own Role in U.S. Attack on Militant', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yemen Notes Its Own Role In U.S. Attack On Militant', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Awlaki, Anwar al-', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yemen', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Saleh, Ali Abdullah', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-01T17:17:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laura Kasinof', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laura', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kasinof', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9a504b8a-7b17-550f-9a5e-2ae522205791', 'word_count': 647, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9a504b8a-7b17-550f-9a5e-2ae522205791'}, {'abstract': 'When the American League division series resumed Saturday night, still Game 1, the rain that was forecast didn’t fall, and Ivan Nova provided superb relief of C.C. Sabathia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/02/sports/baseball/2011-al-division-series-forecast-for-saturday-night-something-will-happen.html', 'snippet': 'When the American League division series resumed Saturday night, still Game 1, the rain that was forecast didn’t fall, and Ivan Nova provided superb relief of C.C. Sabathia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When nothing happens, there is no better analyst to say pretty much nothing more eloquently than the tight-lipped Captain.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/02/sports/ARATON/ARATON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 670, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Showers Come and Go, Leaving Behind a Rainbow', 'kicker': 'Sports of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Showers Come and Go, Leaving Behind a Rainbow', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Tigers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Girardi, Joe', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nova, Ivan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sabathia, C C', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jeter, Derek', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-01T17: