d.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/02/opinion/sunday/antiterror-measures-at-home.html', 'snippet': 'Ten years after the 9/11 attacks, the F.B.I.’s terrorism watch list is still seriously flawed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the bitter lessons of the terrorist attacks of Sept. 11, 2001, was the need for better coordination and sharing of intelligence among the nation’s security agencies, to flag dangerous people entering the country. But there were also well-founded concerns about how well that system was working, and whether it was being abused.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Antiterror Measures at Home', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Antiterror Measures at Home: Ten years after the 9/11 attacks, the F.B.I.’s terrorism watch list is still seriously flawed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Airport Security', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-01T20:26:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/b0edb104-1ff5-56e0-b370-c17ef63e334a', 'word_count': 344, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b0edb104-1ff5-56e0-b370-c17ef63e334a'}, {'abstract': 'Commander Carmichael received the Navy Cross for his actions in helping to save the Bunker Hill after two kamikaze strikes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/02/us/joseph-r-carmichael-jr-hero-of-uss-bunker-hill-dies-at-96.html', 'snippet': 'Commander Carmichael received the Navy Cross for his actions in helping to save the Bunker Hill after two kamikaze strikes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was midmorning on May 11, 1945, near the Japanese island of Kyushu when the Bunker Hill, an aircraft carrier with dozens of planes and vast stores of fuel and ammunition on its flight deck, was struck by two kamikaze planes in suicide attacks within minutes of each other. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/02/us/dogCARMICHAEL1-obit/dogCARMICHAEL1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/02/us/dogCARMICHAEL1-obit/dogCARMICHAEL1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/02/us/dogCARMICHAEL1-obit/dogCARMICHAEL1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 628, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/02/us/dogCARMICHAEL1-obit/dogCARMICHAEL1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/02/us/dogCARMICHAEL1-obit/dogCARMICHAEL1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Joseph Carmichael Jr., a Carrier Hero, Dies at 96', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Joseph Carmichael Jr., 96, a Carrier Hero', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kyushu (Japan)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-01T20:27:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'sec