tos are also a mighty literary device.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/02/opinion/sunday/talking-about-doritos.html', 'snippet': 'Arch West built one of the mightiest pillars of a global snack-food empire. What many fans may not realize is that Doritos are also a mighty literary device.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Arch West, the father of Doritos, died Sept. 20 at age 97, knowing that he and his product-development team at Frito-Lay had built one of the mightiest pillars of a global snack-food empire. What many fans may not realize is that Doritos are also a mighty literary device.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Talking About Doritos', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Talking About Doritos', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'West, Arch', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Frito-Lay Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-01T20:29:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/c449614a-35c7-5a50-85ed-8faa17b4056c', 'word_count': 382, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c449614a-35c7-5a50-85ed-8faa17b4056c'}, {'abstract': 'Test your knowledge of recent events.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/02/opinion/sunday/wait-wait-dont-tell-me.html', 'snippet': 'Test your knowledge of recent events.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NPR’s “Wait Wait ... Don’t Tell Me!” is heard weekends on public radio stations across the country. (npr.org/waitwait)', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'typ