11/10/02/us/expenses-lender-games-and-illness-added-up.html', 'snippet': 'After Wanda Carter bought her first home on her own, she ran into unexpected repair needs, lender manipulation and her husband’s terminal illness. Now she is one more Chicago foreclosure statistic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In November 2004, Wanda Carter bought a home at 6548 South Morgan Street on the South Side and thought she got a good deal.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/02/us/02CNCFORCLOSED1/02CNCFORCLOSED1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/02/us/02CNCFORCLOSED1/02CNCFORCLOSED1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/02/us/02CNCFORCLOSED1/02CNCFORCLOSED1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/02/us/02CNCFORCLOSED1/02CNCFORCLOSED1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/02/us/02CNCFORCLOSED1/02CNCFORCLOSED1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Expenses, Lender Games and Illness Added Up', 'kicker': 'Chicago News Cooperative', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Expenses, Lender Games and Illness Added Up', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential