ge-football-5/', 'snippet': 'A look back at the day’s best from Week 5 in college football.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NATHAN SCHEELHAASE The Illinois quarterback passed for a career-high 391 yards, then scored on a 1-yard run with 13 seconds left to lead the No. 24 Illini to a 38-35 win over Northwestern. A. J. Jenkins caught 12 balls for a team-record 268 yards and 3 touchdowns.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Day’s Best in College Football', 'kicker': 'The Quad', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-02T04:57:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8c50dae2-88f9-5a53-a35d-347b8496c9b9', 'word_count': 571, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c50dae2-88f9-5a53-a35d-347b8496c9b9'}, {'abstract': 'A look back at the day in college football, from upsets at Baylor to blowouts in Wisconsin.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/10/01/sports/SPTSCOLLEGE1001.html', 'snippet': 'A look back at the day in college football, from upsets at Baylor to blowouts in Wisconsin.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A look back at the day in college football, from upsets at Baylor to blowouts in Wisconsin.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/01/sports/SPTSCOLLEGE1001-slide-N6ZL/SPTSCOLLEGE1001-slide-N6ZL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 997, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'ima