omic attacks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The last time an incumbent president faced re-election, George W. Bush exploited social and national security issues to offset his economic vulnerabilities.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Campaign Borrows From Bush ’04 Playbook', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-03T00:36:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Harwood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Harwood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d9316601-6c15-5c5b-8189-7230ae59532b', 'word_count': 799, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d9316601-6c15-5c5b-8189-7230ae59532b'}, {'abstract': 'Oracle’s technology for storing and managing data is at the heart of the modern business world, and its annual event draws 45,000 people, and their expense accounts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/03/technology/oracle-openworld-convention-engulfs-san-francisco.html', 'snippet': 'Oracle’s technology for storing and managing data is at the heart of the modern business world, and its annual event draws 45,000 people, and their expense accounts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — Commuters driving into this city on Monday morning will discover major downtown thoroughfares closed. More than 129,000 square feet of tents will have sprouted around the city’s convention center, where 4.25 miles of power cables, 300 miles of phone and Internet wires and enough beer trucks to sate 45,000 people are in place. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/03/business/ORACLE/ORACLE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 655, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/03/business/ORACLE/ORACLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/03/business/ORACLE/ORACLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Oracle Convention Engulfs San Francisco With a Party Atmosphere', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Oracle Convention Engulfs San Francisco With a Party Atmosphere', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trade Shows and Fairs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Francisco (Calif)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oracle Corp', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-03T00:36:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Quentin Hardy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Quentin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hardy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0c3d5457-6573-508a-a6c3-9fc1c3b039ac', 'word_count': 609, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c3d5457-6573-508a-a6c3-9fc1c3b039ac'}, {'abstract': 'Pittsburgh star Sidney Crosby, still recovering from a January concussion, has prompted discussion in the N.H.L. about head trauma in hockey.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/03/sports/hockey/a-changed-nhl-guards-against-shots-to-the-head.html', 'snippet': 'Pittsburgh star Sidney Crosby, still recovering from a January concussion, has prompted discussion in the N.H.L. about head trauma in hockey.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DETROIT — It has been said that the N.H.L. season beginning on Thursday is about Sidney Crosby. But it is also about ideas, about vast changes in perception and philosophy across the league, both among the people who run the game and those who play it. And that, too, is largely about Sidney Crosby.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/03/sports/YCROSBY/YCROSBY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/03/sports/YCROSBY/YCROSBY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/03/sports/YCROSBY/YCROSBY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/03/sports/YCROSBY/YCROSBY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/03/sports/YCROSBY/YCROSBY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Though Not Ready to Play, Crosby Shapes the Game', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Though Not Ready To Play, Crosby Shapes the Game', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 