 that fuse — and deepens our basic understanding of how we count.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You’ll never count the same after this week’s adventure, brought to us by Harold Reiter from the University of North Carolina at Charlotte. I met Professor Reiter at a Math Circle event over the summer and found him overflowing with curiosity and enthusiasm about anything math-related — including a number of terrific math puzzles. Fusing Dots is one of his favorites.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Numberplay: Fusing Dots', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (Secondary)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mathematics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Puzzles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of North Carolina', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-03T15:11:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gary Antonick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Antonick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c2fa329-0e51-5283-8f3e-4ddacb4aa8f9', 'word_count': 611, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c2fa329-0e51-5283-8f3e-4ddacb4aa8f9'}, {'abstract': 'Behind the scenes at the casting and fitting for today’s Giambattista Valli show at 1:30 p.m. in Paris.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/03/fashion-week-casting-giambattista-valli/', 'snippet': 'Behind the scenes at the casting and fitting for today’s Giambattista Valli show at 1:30 p.m. in Paris.', 'lead_paragraph': ' NYTD.fullScreenSlideShowFactory.createSlideshow("#590", 592, 400, true, chameleonData);Behind the scenes at the casting and fitting for today’s Giambattista Valli show at 1:30 p.m. in Paris.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fashion Week Casting | Giambattista Valli', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-03T15:15:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kava Gorna', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kava', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gorna', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/db3cf5f6-8d08-5eb4-8f0c-e8080d894ac8', 'word_count': 35, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db3cf5f6-8d08-5eb4-8f0c-e8080d894ac8'}, {'abstract': 'The running game for the New York Jets is now a matter of concern.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/03/can-mangold-get-the-jets-back-on-track/', 'snippet': 'The running game for the New York Jets is now a matter of concern.', 'lead_paragraph': 'How will the Jets recover from another beating heading into a crucial game in New England?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Can Mangold Get the Jets Back on Track?', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ducasse, Vlad', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mangold, Nick', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Rex', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Slauson, Matt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-03T15:19:08+0000', 'docum