ion American children that the Department of Agriculture estimates are “food insecure,” meaning their access to food is limited or uncertain.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Sesame Street’ Special on Hunger Introduces New Muppet Character', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-03T16:13:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b231eb5b-7c4a-5b38-9dd6-84c01c086820', 'word_count': 318, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b231eb5b-7c4a-5b38-9dd6-84c01c086820'}, {'abstract': 'The Moment blog premieres the music video for “Vessel,” by Zola Jesus, from her third album “Conatus,” out Tuesday, October 4.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/t-magazine/100000001087147/exclusive-music-video--zola-jesus.html', 'snippet': 'The Moment blog premieres the music video for “Vessel,” by Zola Jesus, from her third album “Conatus,” out Tuesday, October 4.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Moment blog premieres the music video for “Vessel,” by Zola Jesus, from her third album “Conatus,” out Tuesday, October 4.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/03/t-magazine/video-tmag-zolajesus/video-tmag-zolajesus-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/03/t-magazine/video-tmag-zolajesus/video-tmag-zolajesus-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'im