pse months before it did.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/04/us/politics/e-mails-reveal-white-house-concerns-over-solyndra.html', 'snippet': 'New e-mails provided to Congressional investigators show White House officials expressed concern that Solyndra might collapse months before it did.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Some White House officials were so concerned last year about the financial health of Solyndra, a solar equipment manufacturer that had received federal loans, that they warned that a presidential trip to the company’s California factory could prove a major embarrassment, newly disclosed e-mails show.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/us/SOLAR/SOLAR-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/04/us/SOLAR/SOLAR-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/us/SOLAR/SOLAR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/us/SOLAR/SOLAR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/04/us/SOLAR/SOLAR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'E-Mails Reveal Early White House Worries Over Solyndra', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Early White House Concerns Were Seen on Solyndra', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Solyndra Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unit