, tricky bond vigilantes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The invisible bond vigilantes continue to lure us into their invisible trap.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'One Point Seven Six', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-03T21:04:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a013830a-c6eb-5a5a-a918-2eec40aa8470', 'word_count': 100, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a013830a-c6eb-5a5a-a918-2eec40aa8470'}, {'abstract': 'David Beckham is in the final months of his five-year contract with the Los Angeles Galaxy and Major League Soccer.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/03/for-beckham-family-and-health-are-no-1-and-1a/', 'snippet': 'David Beckham is in the final months of his five-year contract with the Los Angeles Galaxy and Major League Soccer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOBOKEN, N.J. — David Beckham may be 36 years old and nearing the end of a storied professional soccer career, but his often intangible appeal is still strong enough to attract interest from Europe.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Beckham, Family and Health Are No. 1 and 1A', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beckham, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-03T21:04:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Bell'