l has focused attention on a vexing problem in earthquake-prone region: how to effectively communicate the risk of potential disaster.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/04/science/04quake.html', 'snippet': 'The trial of six seismologists and a government official has focused attention on a vexing problem in earthquake-prone region: how to effectively communicate the risk of potential disaster.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The manslaughter trial of six seismologists and a government official in the central Italian city of L’Aquila, stemming from what the authorities say was a failure to warn the population before a deadly 2009 earthquake, has outraged many scientists. Thousands have signed petitions protesting the prosecution as anti-science.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/science/04QUAK_SPAN/04QUAK_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/04/science/04QUAK_SPAN/04QUAK_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/science/04QUAK_SPAN/04QUAK_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/science/04QUAK_SPAN/04QUAK_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/04/science/04QUAK_SPAN/04QUAK_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Trial Over Earthquake in Italy Puts Focus on Probability and Panic', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trial Over Earthquake in Italy Puts Focus on Probability and Panic', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Earthquakes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': "L'Aquila (Italy)", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-03T21:25:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Henry Fountain', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Henry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fountain', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c388f7f0-270b-5b09-b496-8c2d134fde8c', 'word_count': 1020, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c388f7f0-270b-5b09-b496-8c2d134fde8c'}, {'abstract': 'In “Worm,” Mark Bowden describes the fight against the malware Conficker, which may lurk in your computer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/04/books/mark-bowdens-worm-about-conficker-review.html', 'snippet': 'In “Worm,” Mark Bowden describes the fight against the malware Conficker, which may lurk in your computer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mark Bowden’s “Worm” is about the potentially diabolical piece of computer malware known as Conficker and the efforts of cybersecurity experts to hunt it down. This book is also about its author’s efforts to tell the Conficker story in both technical terms and common parlance. The hype is easy: “Worm” can toss around alarmist terms like “Cybarmageddon” and “digital Pearl Harbor” to convey a sufficient sense of catastrophic threat. But “Worm” also needs chapters with titles like “MS08-067” and “Remote Thread Injection” to explain what the Conficker scare has really been about.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/arts/jp-book/jp-book-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 905, 's