l in court decisions, how to avoid boring case assignment and what it was like to work under five chief justices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Justice John Paul Stevens was always courtly, but he could be a little terse and wary in interviews while he was on the Supreme Court. Since his retirement last year, he has shed some of that reticence, and he was in an expansive and reflective mood the other day as he greeted a visitor to his chambers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/us/bar1/bar1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/04/us/bar1/bar1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/us/bar1/bar1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 702, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/us/bar1/bar1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/04/us/bar1/bar1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As Justices Get Back to Business, Old Pro Reveals Tricks of the Trade', 'kicker': 'Sidebar', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As Justices Get Back to Business, Old Pro Reveals Tricks of the Trade', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stevens, John Paul', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'sub