ack of a national consensus on what shape a reconciliation process and peace deal should take.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/04/world/asia/afghan-leaders-death-exposes-peace-process-in-disarray.html', 'snippet': 'The assassination of Burhanuddin Rabbani has laid bare the lack of a national consensus on what shape a reconciliation process and peace deal should take.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — In the two weeks since the leader of Afghanistan’s peace process was assassinated, an intense power struggle has opened among the nation’s ethnic groups — and within them — as well as among other powerful factions here, laying bare a crisis that is buffeting President Hamid Karzai from every side.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/world/asia/AFGHANISTAN/AFGHANISTAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/04/world/asia/AFGHANISTAN/AFGHANISTAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/world/asia/AFGHANISTAN/AFGHANISTAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/world/asia/AFGHANISTAN/AFGHANISTAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/04/world/asia/AFGHANISTAN/AFGHANISTAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Leader’s Death Exposes Disarray in the Afghan Peace Process', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Leader’s Dea