act': 'The restrictions on finning in several countries are a welcome step toward keeping the ocean in balance by leaving its top predator in place.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/04/opinion/a-growing-movement-to-save-sharks.html', 'snippet': 'The restrictions on finning in several countries are a welcome step toward keeping the ocean in balance by leaving its top predator in place.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Jaws,” an ode to humans’ fear of the sea, is still a cultural icon. Yet, slowly but surely, cultural attitudes toward sharks are changing, and changing thanks to a genuinely ecological view of their role in the ocean. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Growing Movement to Save Sharks', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Growing Movement to Save Sharks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sharks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endangered and Extinct Species', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-04T01:53:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/9fc85da5-a047-5d6c-80a7-c14f2f41990b', 'word_count': 303, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9fc85da5-a047-5d6c-80a7-c14f2f41990b'}, {'abstract': 'The Jets thought they had a few things figured out after losing to the Raiders, but then came Sunday’s loss to the Ravens.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/04/sports/football/jets-losses-turn-up-heat-under-ryans-collar.html', 'snippet': 'The Jets thought they had a few things figured out after losing to the Raiders, but then came Sunday’s loss to the Ravens.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLORHAM PARK, N.J. — When the Jets look around their complex — the locker room, the field house — they are reminded of their duty. They are reminded to play like a Jet, whatever that even means anymore. Their season-opening four-game stretch, dominated by offensive breakdowns and defensive volatility, has muddled the definition, creating a crisis of identity and personality.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/sports/Jets1/Jets1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/04/sports/Jets1/Jets1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/sports/Jets1/Jets1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/04/sports/Jets1/Jets1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/04/sports/Jets1/Jets1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Losses Turn Up Heat Under Ryan’s Collar', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Losses Turn Up Heat Under Ryan’s Collar', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanchez, Mark', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Rex', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-04T01:59:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname':