expects-modest-profit-despite-scandal/', 'snippet': 'The embattled Swiss bank UBS says it will post a third-quarter profit  despite a $2.3 billion loss from unauthorized trades discovered last month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The embattled Swiss bank UBS said on Tuesday that it would post a third-quarter profit despite a $2.3 billion loss from unauthorized trades discovered last month.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'UBS Expects ‘Modest’ Profit Despite Trading Scandal', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grubel, Oswald J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'UBS AG', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-04T07:42:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julia Werdigier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Werdigier', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a886efcd-b57a-5e94-8de8-bf419ddc197b', 'word_count': 427, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a886efcd-b57a-5e94-8de8-bf419ddc197b'}, {'abstract': 'Unidentified gunmen opened fire on a bus in southwest Pakistan on Tuesday, killing at least 13 Shiite Muslims and wounding another seven, officials said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/05/world/asia/gunmen-attack-shiites-in-southwest-pakistan.html', 'snippet': 'Unidentified gunmen opened fire on a bus in southwest Pakistan on Tuesday, killing at least 13 Shiite Muslims and wounding another seven, officials said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISLAMABAD, Pakistan — Gunmen opened fire on a bus in southwestern Pakistan on Tuesday, killing at least 13 Shiite Muslims and wounding seven, officials said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times'