s headquarters, where Timothy D. Cook is taking the stage to discuss what innovations the company has in mind for the iPhone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tech journalists descended upon Apple’s headquarters in Cupertino, Calif., on Tuesday for some iPhone-related announcements. Our updates from the event are below, with the most recent at the top.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Apple Unveils iPhone 4S With Voice-Recognition Features', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'iPhone', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cook, Timothy D', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Incorporated', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-04T16:17:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Grobart', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grobart', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ec7de9e-3e45-5acd-8c5a-19eeff7e57f4', 'word_count': 2861, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ec7de9e-3e45-5acd-8c5a-19eeff7e57f4'}, {'abstract': 'Once confined to a fat cat’s finger, today’s pinkie rings are dainty, pretty and made for a lady.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/04/this-little-pinkie/', 'snippet': 'Once confined to a fat cat’s finger, today’s pinkie rings are dainty, pretty and made for a lady.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Once confined to a fat cat’s finger, today’s pinkie rings are dainty, pretty and made for a lady. See more >>', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'This Little Pinkie', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2