address school bullying.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MONSTER HIGH, the line of fashion dolls from Mattel that features the teenage children of legendary monsters facing the awkward struggles of high school, is getting a social conscience.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/05/business/ADCO/ADCO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Being a Monster Doesn’t Mean Being a Bully, Too', 'kicker': 'Advertising', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Being a Monster Doesn’t Mean Being a Bully, Too', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Toys', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dolls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bullies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mattel Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-04T22:31:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gregory Schmidt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gregory', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schmidt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8281e8f3-c2d5-5970-9cba-59aff5926093', 'word_count': 688, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8281e8f3-c2d5-5970-9cba-59aff5926093'}, {'abstract': 'Reflecting on the evolution of Napa cabernets at a tasting of 20 old vintages of Charles Krug Vintage Selection cabernet sauvignons, from the 1961 to 1991.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/05/dining/enjoying-cabernet-of-a-certain-age.html', 'snippet': 'Reflecting on the evolution of Napa cabernets at a tasting of 20 old vintages of Charles Krug Vintage Selection cabernet sauvignons, from the 1961 to 1991.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE wine in my glass was a pale, rusty red, browning at the edges, as you’d expect in an older wine. The aroma, with its intimations of tobacco and graphite, suggested a good Pauillac, with an added touch of anise. It was lovely and graceful, tangy and deliciously fresh despite the years, and the flavors persisted in the mouth. Beautiful.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/05/dining/05POUR/05POUR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 747, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/05/dining/05POUR/05POUR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/05/dining/05POUR/05POUR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Enjoying Cabernet of a Certain Age', 'kicker': 'The Pour', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Enjoying Cabernet Of a Certain Age', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cabernet Sauvignon (Wine)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-04T22:31:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Asimov', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Asimov', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4cba3fe2-ec0f-5bc9-83bb-86ba328d142f', 'word_count': 1014, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4cba3fe2-ec0f-5bc9-83bb-86ba328d142f'}, {'abstract': 'The British soul singer says internal bleeding near her vocal chords has forced her to take an extended rest.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/04/for-2nd-time-adele-cancels-a-tour/', 'snippet': 'The British soul singer says internal bleeding near her vocal chords has forced her to take an extended rest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the second time this year, Adele has been forced to cancel a sold-out tour of several American cities because of health problems affecting her voice. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For 2nd Time, Adele Cancels a Tour', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adele (Singer)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-04T22:32:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7523447b-aa0d-5bfd-a5ff-4d03690f90bf', 'word_count': 382, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7523447b-aa0d-5bfd-a5ff-4d03690f90bf'}, {'abstract': 'A Virginia Republican questioned Grover Norquist’s role in the debate over tax reform and the deficit.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/04/republican-criticizes-norquist-for-paralyzing-congress/', 'snippet': 'A Virginia Republican questioned Grover Norquist’s role in the debate over tax reform and the deficit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Who is this Grover Norquist, anyhow? To hear Representative Frank Wolf tell it, the antitax activist is a questionable character with some “unsavory” connections who has too much influence over the political process.', 'sour