, 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cf37f4fe-11b3-5fc9-a270-37968f753606', 'word_count': 263, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cf37f4fe-11b3-5fc9-a270-37968f753606'}, {'abstract': 'Dr. Bruun’s 1966 layout for “Birds of North America,” which has sold in the millions, was a widely copied innovation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/05/us/bertel-bruun-birds-of-north-america-designer-dies-at-73.html', 'snippet': 'Dr. Bruun’s 1966 layout for “Birds of North America,” which has sold in the millions, was a widely copied innovation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bertel Bruun, a co-author and designer of a hugely successful guidebook that helped make bird-watching easier for millions of binocular-toting neophytes, died on Sept. 21 at his home in Remsenburg, on Long Island. He was 73.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/06/sports/06bruun/06bruun-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 871, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/06/sports/06bruun/06bruun-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/06/sports/06bruun/06bruun-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bertel Bruun, Guidebook Designer, Dies at 73', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bertel Bruun, Guidebook Designer, Dies at 73', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Birds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-05T02:44:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', '