an Jim Cordle from their practice squad as well as a free-agent cornerback, Justin Tryon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Giants signed offensive lineman Jim Cordle from their practice squad as well as a free-agent cornerback, Justin Tryon. Offensive linemen Selvish Capers was signed to the practice squad. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Giants Add Two to Roster', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Football', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Giants Add Two to Roster', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-05T04:40:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Borden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/0286f0b4-00f8-5ab1-98ba-d5651f4aee3e', 'word_count': 41, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0286f0b4-00f8-5ab1-98ba-d5651f4aee3e'}, {'abstract': 'Top stories on Wednesday.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/05/newswallah-in-the-english-language-press-wednesday-3/', 'snippet': 'Top stories on Wednesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anna Hazare threatens to go on an anti-Congress poll campaign, if his version of the Lokpal Bill is not passed in the winter session of the Parliament. Gujarat, Uttar Pradesh, Uttarakhand, Punjab and Manipur are slated for assembly polls next year. Mr. Hazare demanded a written commitment from the Congress Party on the issue before Thursday’s holiday of Dussehra. (Hindustan Times)Prime Minister Manmohan Singh and Afghanistan President Hamid Karzai signed their first-ever strategic partnership agreement on Tuesday in New Delhi. India has agreed to train the Afghan national security forces, and the two countries pledged trade and economic cooperation, from developing trade routes to exploring for minerals and hydrocarbons in Afghanistan. (The Hindu)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Newswallah: In the English-Language Press Wednesday', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hazare, Anna', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-05T04:41:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pamposh Raina', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pamposh', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Raina', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e99b1a8b-4233-5e1e-8a84-5cb1ab640efc', 'word_count': 282, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e99b1a8b-4233-5e1e-8a84-5cb1ab640efc'}, {'abstract': 'A mismatch between employers’ requirements and the skills and needs of the jobless has been a constant theme of this recessionary era, especially in farming.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/09/24/us/FARMER.html', 'snippet': 'A mismatch between employers’ requirements and the skills and needs of the jobless has been a constant theme of this recessionary era, especially in farming.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A mismatch between employers’ requirements and the skills and needs of the jobless has been a constant theme of this recessionary era, especially in farming.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None,