if)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-05T16:43:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Josie Garthwaite', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Josie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Garthwaite', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7e8a1d77-894a-5e5c-bda3-ae2a406ceffa', 'word_count': 682, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7e8a1d77-894a-5e5c-bda3-ae2a406ceffa'}, {'abstract': 'The makeup artist Tina Turnbow gives us the lowdown on her starring makeup looks for fall.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/05/facing-fall-the-olive-eye/', 'snippet': 'The makeup artist Tina Turnbow gives us the lowdown on her starring makeup looks for fall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The makeup artist Tina Turnbow gives us the lowdown on her starring makeup looks for fall.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Facing Fall | The Olive Eye', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-05T16:44:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tina Turnbow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Turnbow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5007b7c0-e906-570f-983a-b359b41a6d75', 'word_count': 131, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5007b7c0-e906-570f-983a-b359b41a6d75'}, {'abstract': 'A soldier who came back from Afghanistan in April 2007 has been out of the Army for 18 months, and homeless for 16 of them.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/05/back-home-and-homeless/', 'snippet': 'A soldier who came back from Afghanistan in April 2007 has been out of the Army for 18 months, and homeless for 16 of them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mid-June, 2011: I find myself alone in a dark wooded park tucked between million-dollar houses south of Stanford University, looking for a spot in the bushes to stash my bags. Until that morning I’d been living in a cheap weekly-rate motel in Palo Alto. Before checkout, knowing I couldn’t afford the $48 fee for another night, I laid out my stuff on the bed. Over the cigarette burns on threadbare sheets, I scrounged for quarters, dimes and nickels. There was enough for an extra value meal at Taco Bell. I divided everything else I had between three bags; an olive-drab backpack my brother used in the Army Rangers, a black duffel I bought at Goodwill and a satchel for my laptop. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Back Home, and Homeless', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homeless Persons', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shay, Jonathan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stallone, Sylvester', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Stanford University', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Army', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Veterans Administration', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Fort Drum (NY)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Palo Alto (Calif)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-05T16:48:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Farwell', 'perso