g equipment. By 2013, he predicted, there would be 140 Internet-connected devices per person.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/05/everyone-will-be-a-tv-station-soon/', 'snippet': 'The chief executive of Cisco sees an insatiable demand for video and that, to him, means more networking equipment. By 2013, he predicted, there would be 140 Internet-connected devices per person.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Everybody get your cameras and start filming something, pronto. Networking giant Cisco Systems is waiting.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Everyone Will Be a TV Station Soon', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Enterprise Computing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chambers, John T', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cisco Systems Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-05T17:30:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Quentin Hardy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Quentin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hardy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3548f810-5cc1-53db-afb3-200ef2073285', 'word_count': 446, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3548f810-5cc1-53db-afb3-200ef2073285'}, {'abstract': 'Our fall design issue’s twist on our trademark “T” comes courtesy of the bobo chic Parisian tableware company Astier de Villatte.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/05/our-kind-of-tea-party/', 'snippet': 'Our fall design issue’s twist on our trademark “T” comes courtesy of the bobo chic Parisian tableware company Astier de Villatte.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This issue’s twist on our trademark “T” comes courtesy of the bobo chic Parisian tableware company Astier de Villatte. It is comprised of more than 100 handmade ceramic cups, plates, teapots, flowers and tree branches. Little birds form the serifs. ‘‘The sparrows around the edge give a lightness to the shape, as if it’s about to fly,’’ says Ivan Pericoli, who designs the line with his partner Benoît Astier de Villatte. Below, the duo, whose shop near the Palais Royal was once home to Napoleon’s silversmith, answers our questionnaire.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Our Kind of Tea Party', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tea', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-05T17:30:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4a396b84-20f2-5ef6-a753-8366a5755e21', 'word_count': 216, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4a396b84-20f2-5ef6-a753-8366a5755e21'}, {'abstract': 'Mike Stewart will head global equities in a management shake-up following the unauthorized trading that resulted in a $2.3 billion loss.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/10/05/2-more-ubs-executives-quit-over-trading-loss/', 'snippet': 'Mike Stewart will head global equities in a management shake-up following the unauthorized trading that resulted in a $2.3 billion loss.', 'lead_paragraph': '7:51 p.m. | Updated ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '2 More Executives Quit UBS Over Trading Loss', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'sub