 run, never win later on.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Long Stagnation', 'kicker': 'Opinionator', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tea Party Movement', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greece', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ireland', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-05T19:29:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Brooks and Gail Collins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brooks', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Gail', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Collins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/117b4b99-b8dc-5e55-960e-d70829bf8cdc', 'word_count': 1062, 'uri': 'nyt://article/117b4b99-b8dc-5e55-960e-d70829bf8cdc'}, {'abstract': 'The model stands out in a sharp white tuxedo.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/05/look-of-the-moment-karolina-kurkova/', 'snippet': 'The model stands out in a sharp white tuxedo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Look: Frosted – a sharp white tuxedo gets a gothic spin with red lips and streaks of black hair.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Look of the Moment | Karolina Kurkova', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011