he design of cities. Although other films have surveyed the topic through a longer lens, Hustwit’s is about immediate problems — and some viable solutions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Graphic Content | ‘Urbanized’', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-05T20:00:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Heller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Heller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1dd4ca1f-7f89-5df3-81da-df4374f015c7', 'word_count': 582, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1dd4ca1f-7f89-5df3-81da-df4374f015c7'}, {'abstract': 'A collector’s personal booty becomes a fantasy hotel in Fez.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/10/16/t-magazine/16talk-fez.html', 'snippet': 'A collector’s personal booty becomes a fantasy hotel in Fez.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A collector’s personal booty becomes a fantasy hotel in Fez.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/t-magazine/16talk-fez-slide-GUX9/16talk-fez-slide-GUX9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 667, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pasha Fierce', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-05T20:06:26+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'T Magazine', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/c73630f8-90ca-5556-8905-8d7aaaa91e7f', 'word_count': 0, 'uri'