s. The tech headlines of the week include Microsoft’s official retiring of its Zune media player, a Hotmail overhaul, and a partnership between ABC and Yahoo.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/2011/10/05/technology/05techtalk_pod.html', 'snippet': 'Alan Yacavone of the News Technology office at The Times discusses the various product announcements made by Apple earlier this week, including the unveiling of the new iPhone 4s. Pedro Rafael Rosado explains the term “virtual personal assistant.”...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alan Yacavone of the News Technology office at The Times discusses the various product announcements made by Apple earlier this week, including the unveiling of the new iPhone 4s. Pedro Rafael Rosado explains the term “virtual personal assistant.” The Tip of the Week points out extra features offered by online map sites. The tech headlines of the week include Microsoft’s official retiring of its Zune media player, a Hotmail overhaul, and a partnership between ABC and Yahoo.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Apple’s fall product announcements; rumors vs. reality for the iPhone 4s; tech news', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-05T22:13:33+0000', 'document_type': 'audio', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': '', '_id': 'nyt://audio/571621a5-1ce9-5516-82b8-df8f80466955', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://audio/571621a5-1ce9-5516-82b8-df8f80466955'}, {'abstract': '“History of the World in Two Hours,” on History, looks at the big picture.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/06/arts/television/history-of-the-world-in-two-hours-review.html', 'snippet': '“History of the World in Two Hours,” on History, looks at the big picture.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s every high school student’s dream: Sit through one two-hour