ed on witnesses’ identification in an ex-policeman’s killing, is being brought to the Conviction Integrity Unit of District Attorney Cyrus Vance Jr.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the police picked up Jon-Adrian Velazquez more than a dozen years ago in the killing of a retired police officer, three witnesses identified him from a lineup as the gunman.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/06/nyregion/WRONGFUL/WRONGFUL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/06/nyregion/WRONGFUL/WRONGFUL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Manhattan D.A. Is Asked to Seek to Undo 1999 Murder Conviction', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Manhattan Prosecutors Are Asked to Undo a ’99 Murder Conviction', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lemus, David', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'False Arrests, Convictions and Imprisonments', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vance, Cyrus R Jr', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ward, Albert', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-05T22:51:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Eligon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eligon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1edeffb-7e47-5202-8654-d96c5a1e86a