 go up to report the news and how traffic isn’t moving. They carry time-sensitive documents to Wall Street. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/06/nyregion/CHOPPERS1/CHOPPERS1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Flying Chariot of the Wealthy, Noisy Bane of the Earthbound', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Flying Chariot of the Wealthy, Noisy Bane of the Earthbound', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Helicopters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Airplane Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-06T00:52:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By N. R. Kleinfield and Patrick McGeehan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'N.', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Kleinfield', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McGeehan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/95dc35d3-feef-5d74-88fd-47f62e42fadd', 'word_count': 1242, 'uri': 'nyt://article/95dc35d3-feef-5d74-88fd-47f62e42fadd'}, {'abstract': 'Former rebel forces used tanks and heavy artillery in an attack on Surt, the birthplace of Libya’s deposed leader, Col. Muammar el-Qaddafi; at Sidi Hamed cemetery in Tripoli, anti-Qaddafi fighters say they have found evidence of a mass grave.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/10/05/world/africa/20111006_libya.html', 'snippet': 'Former