': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/06/palins-impact-on-2012-remains-elusive/', 'snippet': 'In her announcement Wednesday evening, Sarah Palin said she still wants to play a central role in shaping American politics. But can she?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sarah Palin has ended speculation about her presidential intentions for 2012. But her impact on the election remains to be seen.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Palin’s Impact on 2012 Remains Elusive', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tea Party Movement', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Palin, Sarah', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-06T11:49:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0dbf3dc9-ea24-5b04-9652-4404cf4e40f7', 'word_count': 939, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0dbf3dc9-ea24-5b04-9652-4404cf4e40f7'}, {'abstract': 'Films like “Moneyball,” “The Ides of March,” “Contagion” and “Margin Call” cater to moviegoers’ appetite for exclusive, “inside baseball” information.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/09/movies/moneyball-ides-of-march-contain-inside-information.html', 'snippet': 'Films like “Moneyball,” “The Ides of March,” “Contagion” and “Margin Call” cater to moviegoers’ appetite for exclusive, “inside baseball” information.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN 1988 The New York Review of Books dispatched Joan Didion to report on the presidential election, an assignment that resulted in a classic essay on the modern way of campaigning titled “Insider Baseball.” Over the years that phrase — usually in a snappier, syntactically dubious variation, without the R — has become both a cliché and a cultural principle. “Inside baseball” could be the name of a multimedia genre, a mode of storytelling focused, above all, on that mysterious thing called process. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/arts/09JPSCOTT1_SPAN/09JPSCOTT1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/09/arts/09JPSCOTT1_SPAN/09JPSCOTT1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/arts/09JPSCOTT1_SPAN/09JPSCOTT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/arts/09JPSCOTT1_SPAN/09JPSCOTT1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/09/arts/09JPSCOTT1_SPAN/09JPSCOTT1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Inside Knowledge for All You Outsiders', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Inside Knowledge For All You Outsiders', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pitt, Brad', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beane, Billy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clooney, George', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Miller, Bennett', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Soderbergh, Steven', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-06T11:58:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc5ae834-c9f4-5357-aca2-05ff1b78a7c7', 'word_count': 1739, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc5ae834-c9f4-5357-aca2-05ff1b78a7c7'}, {'abstract': 'The abdominally flawless Zuzana Light, 29, has become something of a fitness fetish.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/06/rocking-away-the-rolls/', 'snippet': 'The abdominally flawless Zuzana Light, 29, has become something of a fitness fetish.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Through her Web site, bodyrock.tv, the abdominally flawless Zuzana Light, 29, has become something of a fitness fetish. Her calorie-clobbering workouts are watched on YouTube by about 25 million visitors each month. Yet just five years ago, she was emotionally adrift in her native Prague, earning her keep as a nude model. “It was an incredibly humiliating situation,” she said. On vacation, she met her future husband and partner, Frederick Light, who brought her back to Ontario, where the couple worked at a flower shop and filmed exercise videos in their free time. Light’s workout relies on “short, intense” exercises that riff on the burpee, a suicide sequence of squats, push-ups and jumping that’s catching on at gyms across the country.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rocking Away the Rolls', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords':