ike many people, ready to completely ignore the National League until it finished crowning the Phillies as its inevitable World Series participant, you might be surprised to know that both N.L. division series have now reached a fifth game. And they have done so in highly entertaining fashion. St. Louis is apparently employing a resourceful squirrel to mess with the Phillies’ juju, and the still anonymous Diamondbacks are clubbing the ball as if they are the 1927 Yankees, while the Brewers play the role of piñata. And so there will be two Game 5s on Friday night to decide things.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leading Off: National League Makes a Play', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Burnett, A J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jobs, Steven P', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Napoli, Mike', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nova, Ivan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oswalt, Roy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pujols, Albert', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN LEAGUE', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ARIZONA DIAMONDBACKS', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Tigers', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Milwaukee Brewers', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Minnesota Lynx', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Basketball Assn', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National League', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Philadelphia Phillies', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'