impending lawsuit by relatives of a woman who was shot to death.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/06/complaints-of-belligerence-and-notice-of-a-lawsuit/', 'snippet': 'One Police Plaza: Complaints about police behavior, and notification to the city of an impending lawsuit by relatives of a woman who was shot to death.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To Councilwoman Gale A. Brewer, an “attitude of unwarranted belligerence” has been taking hold among New York City police officers assigned to work with crowds.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Complaints of ‘Belligerence’ and Notice of a Lawsuit', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brewer, Gale A', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gay, Denise', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Occupy Wall Street', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-06T16:25:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Al Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Al', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea579bd3-a42d-5fc5-9474-17e1807f36c9', 'word_count': 859, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea579bd3-a42d-5fc5-9474-17e1807f36c9'}, {'abstract': 'Schohaja’s Paris fashion week photo diary.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/06/photos-of-the-moment-miu-miu-2/', 'snippet': 'Schohaja’s Paris fashion week photo diary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'var data;function jsonSlideshowCallba