s to its amenities list.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/06/beyond-room-service-flash-mobs-available-upon-request/', 'snippet': 'The Marco Island Marriott Beach Resort in Florida adds flash mob services to its amenities list.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Flash mobs — brief group assemblies usually for some whimsical purpose like dancing or pillow fighting — go commercial at the Marco Island Marriott Beach Resort near Naples, Fla. The hotel will assemble your very own flash mob to energize a sales convention or punctuate an engagement proposal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Beyond Room Service: Flash Mobs Available Upon Request', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Naples (Fla)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-06T16:58:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elaine Glusac', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elaine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Glusac', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/67aa4bfa-78ee-554b-8de6-4a1ce9abd110', 'word_count': 194, 'uri': 'nyt://article/67aa4bfa-78ee-554b-8de6-4a1ce9abd110'}, {'abstract': 'Larry Rohter on three core members of James Brown’s band – Fred Wesley, Pee Wee Ellis and Maceo Parker. And Jody Rosen discusses Fishbone and “Everyday Sunshine,” the new documentary film that tracks the band’s rise and fall.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/06/popcast-architects-of-the-james-brown-sound-reunite/', 'snippet': 'Larry Rohter on three core members of James Brown’s band – Fred Wesley, Pee Wee Ellis and Maceo Parker. And Jody Rosen discusses Fishbone and “Ev