ilm Festival on Monday evening for a screening of the film “Paradise Lost 3: Purgatory,” a non-fiction feature directed by Joe Berlinger and Bruce Sinofsky, the Film Society of Lincoln Center said. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'West Memphis Three Will Attend New York Film Festival', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baldwin, Jason', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berlinger, Joe', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Echols, Damien', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Misskelley, Jessie Jr', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sinofsky, Bruce', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Film Society of Lincoln Center', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Home Box Office', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-06T17:17:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/faa5de5a-583c-5d91-b383-ca6103ea9883', 'word_count': 351, 'uri': 'nyt://article/faa5de5a-583c-5d91-b383-ca6103ea9883'}, {'abstract': 'YouTube’s new politics channel will try to capture unscripted moments from the campaign trail.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/06/youtube-launches-new-politics-channel/', 'snippet': 'YouTube’s new politics channel will