670'}, {'abstract': 'Mitt Romney’s presidential campaign has lassoed a few big Wall Street supporters, The New York Times reports.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/10/06/romneys-wall-street-team-expands/', 'snippet': 'Mitt Romney’s presidential campaign has lassoed a few big Wall Street supporters, The New York Times reports.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mitt Romney’s presidential campaign has lassoed a few big Wall Street supporters, The New York Times reports. Among them are James B. Lee, Jr., the marquee J.P. Morgan banker, and several prominent hedge fund managers, including Paul Singer, Clifford S. Asness and Daniel S. Loeb. Read more »', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney’s Wall Street Team Expands', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-06T17:20:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kevin Roose', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kevin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roose', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9ffe4c4c-b730-5ae1-bd73-8b0fc96fea64', 'word_count': 48, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9ffe4c4c-b730-5ae1-bd73-8b0fc96fea64'}, {'abstract': 'Treasury Secretary Timothy Geithner’s comments today that there is “absolutely” no chance that another U.S. financial institution would fail was music to Morgan Stanley and other bank stocks.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/10/06/bank-stocks-get-a-boost-from-geithner/', 'snippet': 'Treasury Secretary Timothy Geithner’s comments today that there is “absolutely” no chance that another U.S. financial institution would fail was music to Morgan Stanley and other bank stocks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Treasury Secretary Timothy Geithner’s comments on Thursday that there 