station, the advance of deadly pine beetles, the limits of reseeding trees and the sins of the newspaper industry.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/06/q-and-a-forests-and-climate/', 'snippet': 'A reporter takes questions on personal actions to combat deforestation, the advance of deadly pine beetles, the limits of reseeding trees and the sins of the newspaper industry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Readers responded to my recent article on forests and climate change with a flood of comments and questions. Here, I’m going to tackle a selected number with a bit of help from the scientists I interviewed for the piece. (Note that some questions have been shortened or recast slightly for clarity.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Q and A: Forests and Climate', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Carbon Dioxide', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forest and Brush Fires', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forests and Forestry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greenhouse Gas Emissions', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Insects', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sustainable Living', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trees and Shrubs', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Running, Steven W', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Forest Stewardship Council', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Natural Resources Defense Council', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Western States (US)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-06T17:31:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sci