nt': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/5153ca31-20ae-577d-b141-e6937b7b9ca9'}, {'abstract': 'A news report stirs controversy over whether Mitt Romney lobbied for an earlier caucus date.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/06/was-there-a-nudge-to-move-up-nevadas-caucus/', 'snippet': 'A news report stirs controversy over whether Mitt Romney lobbied for an earlier caucus date.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Did the Romney campaign try to alter the primary schedule by lobbying Nevada Republicans to move the state’s caucuses up a month, to January? That’s what former Gov. Robert List, the Republican national committeeman on the state party’s executive board, told The Las Vegas Review-Journal in an article Wednesday. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Did Romney Nudge Nevada to Move Its Caucuses?', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nevada', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-06T18:09:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susan Saulny', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Saulny', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62fb122d-8886-57f3-b8e3-cb1298bf6c27', 'word_count': 447, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62fb122d-8886-57f3-b8e3-cb1298bf6c27'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama said his administration was concerned about Pakistan’s commitment to American interests, citing ties between anti-American militants and Pakistan’s intelligence agents.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/07/world/asia/obama-obliquely-warns-pakistan-about-long-term-relations.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama said his administration was concerned about Pakistan’s commitment to American interests, citing ties between anti-American militants and Pakistan’s intelligence agents.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Obama cast some doubt on the long-term relationship between the United States and Pakistan on Thursday, saying his administration was concerned about the Pakistani government’s commitment to American interests because of ties between anti-American militants in Afghanistan and Pakistan’s own intelligence service.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/07/world/07prexy/07prexy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/07/world/07prexy/07prexy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/07/world/07prexy/07prexy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama Warns Pakistanis on Militants', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Obama Warns Pakistanis On Militants', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Haqqani Network', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'v