cent of home buyers are either denied or drop out of the application process.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/09/realestate/mortgages-triggers-for-rejection.html', 'snippet': 'The Mortgage Bankers Association estimates that about half of those who try to refinance and 30 percent of home buyers are either denied or drop out of the application process.', 'lead_paragraph': '“WE regret to inform you...” Nobody applying for a new mortgage or a refinancing wants to see or hear these words. But last year more than two million people were turned down for home loans, according to federal data, often because they didn’t meet certain lender requirements or because their applications were incomplete or otherwise problematic. ', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/realestate/09mort-graphic/09mort-graphic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 308, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/09/realestate/09mort-graphic/09mort-graphic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 308}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/realestate/09mort-graphic/09mort-graphic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/09/realestate/09mort-graphic/09mort-graphic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Triggers for Rejection', 'kicker': 'Mortgages', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Triggers for Rejection', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011