ae1094a2-8866-5279-8c7f-2736b019ed44', 'word_count': 851, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ae1094a2-8866-5279-8c7f-2736b019ed44'}, {'abstract': 'Various other Web sites that may offer clues to what is being built near you.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/09/realestate/helpful-sites.html', 'snippet': 'Various other Web sites that may offer clues to what is being built near you.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN the windows of the building across the street get boarded up, chances are good that the building has been sold and plans are being hatched to replace it with something new, and maybe bigger. The building permit posted on the wall may not tell you as much as you would like to know, but your local community board can be a great resource; check its Web site regularly or sign up for regular e-mail updates. Various other Web sites may also offer clues. Here are a few:', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Helpful Sites', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Little Birdie Told Me', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Building (Construction)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-06T23:31:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ec959742-79e6-5482-9634-fd0b7fb83564', 'word_count': 259, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec959742-79e6-5482-9634-fd0b7fb83564'}, {'abstract': 'As health care costs rise, some providers are experimenting with new payment and care delivery systems, striving to be efficient and to keep patients well.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/07/us/trying-out-new-ways-to-deliver-health-care.html', 'snippet': 'As health care costs rise, some providers are experimenting with new payment and care delivery systems, striving to be efficient and to keep patients well.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PLANO, Tex. — At Village Health Partners, patients receive a year’s worth of wellness exams in a single visit; get their e-mails answered 24 hours a day, 7 days a week; and have their mammogram and M.R.I. results logged into their electronic medical records by the time they pull out of the parking lot.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/07/us/07TTHEALTHCARE3/07TTHEALTHCARE3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/07/us/07TTHEALTHCARE3/07TTHEALTHCARE3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/07/us/07TTHEALTHCARE3/07TTHEALTHCARE3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Trying Out New Ways to Deliver Health Care', 'kicker': 'The Texas Tribune', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trying Out New Ways To Deliver Health Care', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-06T23:32:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.