h ago. The National Investigation Agency tasked with finding the perpetrators detained another suspect from the Kishtwar area of Jammu and Kashmir – their third arrest in the case. (Indian Express) Officials say the third suspect, identified only as Wasim, is one of the key conspirators and hatched the plot after being lured by the Harkat-ul-Jehadi Islami in Bangladesh. Jammu and Kashmir Chief Minister Omar Abdullah on Thursday once again dismissed a demand from the main state opposition party that he step down from office after the death of a party worker stoked controversy. (The Hindu) The People’s Democratic Party says Mr. Abdullah may “influence” the judicial inquiry into the death, which he denies.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Newswallah: What’s in the English-Language Press Friday', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chidambaram, Palaniappan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Times of India', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kashmir and Jammu (India)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-07T04:12:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sruthi Gottipati', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sruthi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gottipati', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8671a87-a154-5604-882c-e24aa69dfb20', 'word_count': 239, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8671a87-a154-5604-882c-e24aa69dfb20'}, {'abstract': 'The father of Manchester United striker Wayne Rooney was one of nine men arrested as part of an investigation into suspicious bets placed on a Scottish league match in December.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/07/sports/soccer/rooneys-father-arrested.html', 'snippet': 'The father of Manchester United striker Wayne Rooney was one of nine men arrested as part of an investigation into suspicious bets placed on a Scottish league match in December.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The father of Manchester United striker Wayne Rooney was one of nine men arrested as part of an investigation into suspicious bets placed on a Scottish league match in December. Rooney’s father, also named Wayne, was arrested at his home in Liverpool. The younger Rooney was not implicated, the police said. The charges stem from the Motherwell-Hearts Scottish Premier League match last Dec. 14. One of those detained was Motherwell midfielder Steve Jennings, who played in the match and was given a straight red card with eight minutes remaining for disputing a penalty decision. It has been reported that several bets were placed on there being a red card in the match. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rooney’s Father Arrested', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Soccer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rooney’s Father Arrested', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manchester United (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gambling', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rooney, Wayne', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-07T04:22:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Das', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Das', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported'