’ ace pitcher, can opt out of his contract this off-season with four years and $92 million remaining.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/08/sports/baseball/retaining-sabathia-should-be-yankees-top-priority.html', 'snippet': 'C.C. Sabathia, the Yankees’ ace pitcher, can opt out of his contract this off-season with four years and $92 million remaining.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Yankees often react to postseason failure by spending a lot of money on the best available player they can find. It is the equivalent of running to Tiffany’s to buy something shiny to fix a damaged relationship. The gift will solve none of the underlying problems, but it’s sparkly and pleasantly distracting, for a while.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/08/sports/08kepner1/08kepner1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 714, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/08/sports/08kepner1/08kepner1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/08/sports/08kepner1/08kepner1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Why the Yankees Can’t Afford to Lose Sabathia', 'kicker': 'On Baseball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Why Yanks Should Make Sabathia Top Priority', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sabathia, C C', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cashman, Brian', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-07T14:54:40+0000', 'document_type