r, can be found partly in the jaw-dropping twists and hang-ups of classic weepies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The DNA of “The Skin I Live In,” like any film by Pedro Almodóvar, can be found partly in the jaw-dropping twists and hang-ups of classic weepies.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/arts/09SKIN-SS-slide-GTQO/09SKIN-SS-slide-GTQO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/arts/09SKIN-SS-slide-GTQO/09SKIN-SS-slide-GTQO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/09/arts/09SKIN-SS-slide-GTQO/09SKIN-SS-slide-GTQO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Formula of Melodrama', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALMODOVAR, PEDRO', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-07T16:21:42+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Movies', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By NICOLAS RAPOLD', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicolas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'RAPOLD', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/f5ab2a25-822b-5049-a3e2-46c09235f3ce', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/f5ab2a25-822b-5049-a3e2-46c09235f3ce'}, {'abstract': 'Pedro Almodóvar’s latest release, “The Skin I Live In,” might be his most nightmarish take yet on the melodramas of Hollywood’s golden age.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/09/movies/pedro-almodovars-the-skin-i-live-in-and-golden-age-melodrama.html', 'snippet': 'Pedro Almodóvar’s latest release, “The Skin I Live In,” might be his most nightmarish take yet on the melodramas of Hollywood’s golden age.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Pedro Almodóvar’s latest release, “The Skin I Live In” (opening Friday), Antonio Banderas stars as a plastic surgeon who, apparently haunted by his long-lost wife, embarks upon a mysterious skin experiment on an immaculately beautiful woman. He keeps her captive in his mansion, and soon an outlandish, lurid back story to his obsession emerges.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/arts/09SKIN-SS-slide-GTQO/09SKIN-SS-slide-GTQO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/arts/09SKIN-SS-slide-GTQO/09SKIN-SS-slide-GTQO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/09/arts/09SKIN-SS-slide-GTQO/09SKIN-SS-slide-GTQO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Within Beats a Heart of Pure Melodrama', 'kicker': 'Film', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Within Beats a Heart Of Pure Melodrama', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Banderas, Antonio', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALMODOVAR, PEDRO', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-07T16:22:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicolas Rapold', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicolas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rapold', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ddc0110f-6265-5096-972e-dcba6a027b05', 'word_count': 581, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ddc0110f-6265-5096-972e-dcba6a027b05'}, {'abstract': 'The automaker will export a car built in India for the first time, as rising costs in Japan force automakers to seek other bases for production.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/07/toyotas-india-announcement-belies-a-greater-shift-for-japanese-automakers/', 'snippet': 'The automaker will export a car built in India for the first time, as rising costs in Japan force automakers to seek other bases for production.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Toyota said Thursday that it would begin selling the Etios, a compact sedan and hatchback developed and produced in India, to customers in South Africa, marking the first time that the brand’s India division would export a car to another market.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Toyota’s India Announcement Belies a Greater Shift for Japanese Automakers', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Cars (Compact, Subcompact and Microcars)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Honda Motor Co Ltd', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mazda Motor Corp', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nissan Motor Co', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Renault SA', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Toyota Motor Corp', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name':