ss, and the romance blossomed from there.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/09/fashion/weddings/alison-berkley-and-ryan-margo-vows.html', 'snippet': 'The couple met at a bar on New Year’s Eve and had an after-midnight kiss, and the romance blossomed from there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ASPEN, Colo., is a competitive town. It is not uncommon to hear people talking about how fast they made it up a peak at 6 a.m. In a snowstorm. On a unicycle. With weights. Alison Berkley, who is 41 and has lived in Aspen almost 10 years, just rolls her eyes. She prefers to sleep late. She’s a princess, after all.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/fashion/weddings/VOWS-2/VOWS-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 345, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/09/fashion/weddings/VOWS-2/VOWS-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 345}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/fashion/weddings/VOWS-2/VOWS-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Alison Berkley and Ryan Margo', 'kicker': 'Vows', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Alison Berkley and Ryan Margo', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vows (Times Column)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-07T19:43:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lois Smith Brady', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lois', 'middlename': 'Smith', 'lastname': 'Brady', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'r