Grissom, Willows and the other forensic celebrities of the “CSI” TV franchise.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/08/arts/design/csi-the-experience-at-discovery-times-square-review.html', 'snippet': '“CSI: The Experience,” a new exhibition at Discovery Times Square, lets you step into the shoes of Grissom, Willows and the other forensic celebrities of the “CSI” TV franchise.', 'lead_paragraph': '“CSI: The Experience,” the new exhibition at Discovery Times Square, is based on the very sensible premise that fans of the “CSI” television series and its clones, “CSI: Miami” and “CSI: NY,” are by now so familiar with blood-splatter analysis, corpse lividity, latent print technology, firearms identification, dental records and the lifespan of blowflies that they’re capable of conducting an investigation on their own. And so visitors are issued a pencil, a clipboard and an evidence sheet — but, sadly, not a pair of blue latex gloves — and are dispatched to one of three crime scenes.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/08/arts/CSI/CSI-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/08/arts/CSI/CSI-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/08/arts/CSI/CSI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 577, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/08/arts/CSI/CSI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/08/arts/CSI/CSI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'hea