rrived in Paris for the final shows of the spring 2012 collections, carrying luggage filled with autumn clothes. Paris suffered a heat wave, and the guests stripped down.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/fashion/100000001100021/bill-cunningham--paris.html', 'snippet': 'The caravan arrived in Paris for the final shows of the spring 2012 collections, carrying luggage filled with autumn clothes. Paris suffered a heat wave, and the guests stripped down.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The caravan arrived in Paris for the final shows of the spring 2012 collections, carrying luggage filled with autumn clothes. Paris suffered a heat wave, and the guests stripped down.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/07/fashion/video-1009billonthestreetfix/video-1009billonthestreetfix-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/07/fashion/video-1009billonthestreetfix/video-1009billonthestreetfix-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/07/fashion/video-1009billonthestreetfix/video-1009billonthestreetfix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/07/fashion/video-1009billonthestreetfix/video-1009billonthestreetfix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Cunningham | Paris', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-08T00:54:56+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'Simone S. Oliver and Joanna Nikas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Simone',