riter, says he powers through the day after working late Saturday night or flying back into New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/09/nyregion/for-cosmo-baker-sundays-are-for-decompressing.html', 'snippet': 'Cosmo Baker, a D.J., music producer and writer, says he powers through the day after working late Saturday night or flying back into New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Cosmo Baker, a D.J., music producer and writer, Sundays are a chance to wind down from traveling — coming trips include ones to South Africa and Dubai — and late-night Saturdays, while relaxing and exploring the city. Mr. Baker, 37, lives with his wife, Sydney Peck, a lawyer, in Fort Greene, Brooklyn. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/nyregion/09ROUTINE_SPAN/09ROUTINE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 352, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/09/nyregion/09ROUTINE_SPAN/09ROUTINE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 352}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/nyregion/09ROUTINE_SPAN/09ROUTINE_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/nyregion/09ROUTINE_SPAN/09ROUTINE_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/09/nyregion/09ROUTINE_SPAN/09ROUTINE_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Night Owl Explores by Day', 'kicker': 'Sunday Routine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Night Owl Explores by Day', 'name': None, 'seo': Non