ts-of-layoffs-effect-from-the-newly-unemployed.html', 'snippet': 'These are four of the 672 school workers who were let go on Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The last school bell on Friday was the beginning of unemployment for 672 employees in roughly 350 city schools — school aides, parent coordinators, health aides and other support staff members. These are four of the school workers who were let go. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Snapshots of Layoffs’ Effect, From the Newly Unemployed', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Snapshots of Layoffs’ Effect, From the Newly Unemployed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Layoffs and Job Reductions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Education Department (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-08T02:25:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Fernanda Santos and Chelsia Rose Marcius', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Fernanda', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Santos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Chelsia', 'middlename': 'Rose', 'lastname': 'Marcius', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/61ea6dc6-1a81-573d-ac49-5620bd938cae', 'word_count': 602, 'uri': 'nyt://article/61ea6dc6-1a81-573d-ac49-5620bd938cae'}, {'abstract': 'Denard Robinson, Michigan’s speedy quarterback, has led the No. 12 Wolverines to a 5-0 record for the second consecutive year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/08/sports/ncaafootball/michigans-robinson-says-his-game-has-matured.html', 'snippet': 'Denard Robinson, Michigan’s speedy quarterback, has led the No. 12 Wolverines to a 5-0 record for the second consecutive year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ANN ARBOR, Mich. — When Denard Robinson arrived at Michigan three years ago, he spoke so fast that his offensive linemen could not understand him. He also delivered every check-down pass like Justin Verlander. And Robinson’s feet gyrated so quickly during his cameos in the pocket that he looked more like a tap dancer than a quarterback. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/08/sports/yMICHIGAN/yMICHIGAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/08/sports/yMICHIGAN/yMICHIGAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/08/sports/yMICHIGAN/yMICHIGAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 580, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/08/sports/yMICHIGAN/yMICHIGAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/08/sports/yMICHIGAN/yMICHIGAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Michigan Star Says His Game Has Matured', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Michigan Star Says His Game Has Matured', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hoke, Brady', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Robinson, Denard', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'val