 has a menu of innovative and traditional Indian dishes in meat and vegetarian categories.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AT Delhi 6 in East Windsor, it’s tempting to begin a meal with dessert when the dessert in question is house-made paan ice cream, every bite a hint of exotica, every flavor an invitation to plan an extended trip to India.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/nyregion/09DINENJ2/09DINENJ2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 714, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/nyregion/09DINENJ2/09DINENJ2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/09/nyregion/09DINENJ2/09DINENJ2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At Delhi 6, Cooking From Scratch', 'kicker': 'New Jersey Dining | East Windsor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At Delhi 6, Cooking From Scratch', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-08T17:10:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karla Cook', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karla', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cook', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3cde5fb1-0ef0-5d55-b3cc-24748efce695', 'word_count': 828, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3cde5fb1-0ef0-5d55-b3cc-24748efce695'}, {'abstract': 'There is classical music and a bookish vibe, but at Terra at the Isabel Rose, the ambience is laid-back.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/09/nyregion/terra-at-the-isabel-rose-in-montclair.html', 'snippet': 'There is classical music and a bookish vibe, but at Terra at the Isabel Rose, the ambience is laid-back.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s hard not to feel virtuous having tea at Terra at the Isabel Rose in Montclair, even if you’ve tipped your blood glucose level into the danger zone with an apricot-ginger scone or a slice of apple-blackberry-raspberry pie. The owner, Grace Chow Grund, says a great majority of ingredients in the baked goods, sandwiches, wraps and salads she sells at the tearoom are organic and from local farms. Teas and coffees are fair trade, and most are organic. ', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'No Itty Bitty Tea Shoppe Here', 'kicker': 'Quick Bite | Montclair', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'No Itty Bitty Tea Shoppe Here', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tea', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-08T17:10:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julia Lawlor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lawlor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7324f232-d279-56c8-be3c-518d5e543dc2', 'word_count': 328, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7324f232-d279-56c8-be3c-518d5e543dc2'}, {'abstract': 'Immigrants fight in Brooklyn for the mos