bership manager for an arts organization, and the bridegroom, a violinist, are to be marred in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tiffany Pak and Thomas Kim Carney are to be married Sunday. The Rev. Scott Sauls, a Presbyterian minister, is to perform the ceremony at the Unitarian Church of All Souls in New York.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tiffany Pak, Thomas Carney', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tiffany Pak, Thomas Carney', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-08T18:24:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e996a638-e844-5cf5-87c1-31c985e1159c', 'word_count': 222, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e996a638-e844-5cf5-87c1-31c985e1159c'}, {'abstract': 'The couple — a kindergarten teacher and a lawyer — met when they were 16, and it took more than 10 years for the bride to be impressed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/09/fashion/weddings/yael-seidel-evan-van-leer-greenberg-weddings.html', 'snippet': 'The couple — a kindergarten teacher and a lawyer — met when they were 16, and it took more than 10 years for the bride to be impressed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Yael Seidel, a daughter of Regina Seidel and Eric S. Seidel of Manhattan, is to be married Sunday to Evan Dana Van Leer-Greenberg, a son of Valerie I. Van Leer-Greenberg and Howard B. Greenberg of Rockaway, Queens. Rabbi Heidi R. Hoover is to officiate at the Sands Beach Club in Atlantic Beach, N.Y.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Yael Seidel, Evan Van Leer-Greenberg', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker'