s/', 'snippet': 'Delmon Young, who set a Detroit Tigers playoff series record with three home runs against the Yankees in the first round, was left off the roster for the American League Championship Series after straining an oblique muscle in his left side.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Delmon Young, who set a Detroit Tigers playoff series record with three home runs against the Yankees in the first round, was left off the roster for the American League Championship Series after straining an oblique muscle in his left side.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tigers’ Young Is Out for A.L.C.S.', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Young, Delmon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Detroit Tigers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-08T22:44:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4259eaa1-6db5-5b00-b406-d492946d7e0c', 'word_count': 535, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4259eaa1-6db5-5b00-b406-d492946d7e0c'}, {'abstract': 'Some people say that top-level returns over many years show that a mutual fund manager is among the most skilled in the field. Others aren’t so sure.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/09/business/mutfund/in-mutual-fund-returns-skill-or-just-luck.html', 'snippet': 'Some people say that top-level returns over many years show that a mutual fund manager is among the most skilled in the field. Others aren’t so sure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN sports, the lessons of long-term performance seem obvious. Edwin Moses, the hurdler, wins 122 races over nearly a decade. Roger Federer, the tennis player, reaches the semifinals in 23 consecutive Grand Slam tournaments. Jeannie Longo, the cyclist, makes seven French Olympic teams. Implied in their feats is the message that doing something so challenging for so long proves enduring excellence.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Master’s Skill, or Just Luck?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Master’s Touch, Or Just Luck?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mutual Funds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Luck', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Longevity', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-08T22:46:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NAT', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Mutual Funds', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Gray', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gray', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/85c7ec83-dbfe-530c-9acc-5c6fa649b003', 'word_count': 1164, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85c7ec83-dbfe-530c-9acc-5c6fa649b003'}, {'abstract': 'When the family finances are low, muses John Schwartz, you could try turning your children into best-selling authors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/09/business/mutfund/getting-out-of-debt-its-childs-play.html', 'snippet': 'When the family finances are low, muses John Schwartz, you could try turning your children into best-selling authors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’M always looking for new ways to improve my family’s financial situation, which is slightly less promising than the economy of Greece.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': 