-b458-ba7f78291446'}, {'abstract': 'While doubts about the economies of the United States and Europe have made gold more expensive, they have also hurt stock prices — including those of some mining companies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/09/business/mutfund/mining-shares-lag-behind-the-high-price-of-gold.html', 'snippet': 'While doubts about the economies of the United States and Europe have made gold more expensive, they have also hurt stock prices — including those of some mining companies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IF you bought a precious-metals fund at the start of this year because you expected stock market turbulence and thought gold would be a refuge, your foresight was impressive. Your returns? Not as much.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/business/09-MF-GOLD/09-MF-GOLD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 806, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/business/09-MF-GOLD/09-MF-GOLD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/09/business/09-MF-GOLD/09-MF-GOLD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'No Coattail Effect in Gold’s Surge', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'No Coattail Effect In Gold’s Surge', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gold', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mutual Funds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-08T22:56:58+0000', 'document_ty