The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Muni Bonds Are Stars, for Now', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Muni Bonds Are Stars, for Now', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Municipal Bonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Local Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mutual Funds', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-08T23:10:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NAT', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Mutual Funds', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jan M. Rosen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/54441017-277c-566c-813a-81bd1d9c77b3', 'word_count': 842, 'uri': 'nyt://article/54441017-277c-566c-813a-81bd1d9c77b3'}, {'abstract': 'Many investors suffered in the last quarter’s sell-off, but losses in large-cap stock funds weren’t as bad as those for riskier, small-cap portfolios.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/09/business/mutfund/large-cap-funds-fared-better-in-quarter-relatively-speaking.html', 'snippet': 'Many investors suffered in the last quarter’s sell-off, but losses in large-cap stock funds weren’t as bad as those for riskier, small-cap portfolios.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SINCE the start of the financial crisis, many money managers have been predicting that investors would gravitate to shares of large, industry-leading companies. Yet since the start of 2008, large-capitalization stocks have lagged riskier small-company shares, belying their reputation as ports in an economic storm. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/