www.nytimes.com/2011/10/10/world/middleeast/ali-abdullah-saleh-of-yemen-clinging-to-power.html', 'snippet': 'New signs that the embattled president, Ali Abdullah Saleh, is not leaving anytime soon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — Amid all the chaos and conflict that have engulfed Yemen, one fact seems immutable: President Ali Abdullah Saleh will not voluntarily leave office any time soon. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/10/world/middleeast/Yemen/Yemen-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 920, 'width': 828, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/10/world/middleeast/Yemen/Yemen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/10/world/middleeast/Yemen/Yemen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After New Pledge to Leave, Signs of Yemeni President’s Resolve to Linger', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After New Pledge to Leave, Signs of Yemeni President’s Resolve to Linger', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Saleh, Ali Abdullah', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yemen', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-09T21:32:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laura Kasinof', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laura', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kasinof', 'qualifier': No