weekend travelers.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/09/drawbridge-in-connecticut-becomes-stuck-disrupting-metro-north-and-amtrak/', 'snippet': 'A one-train trip becomes a two-train one for many weekend travelers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The failure of a 100-year-old drawbridge over the Norwalk River in Norwalk, Conn., disrupted service on Sunday afternoon for hundreds of rail travelers who were forced take shuttle buses when more than six trains could not cross the river. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Drawbridge in Connecticut Becomes Stuck, Disrupting Metro-North and Amtrak', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMTRAK', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metro-North Commuter Railroad', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Connecticut', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Haven (Conn)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Norwalk (Conn)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-09T23:22:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Maslin Nir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': 'Maslin', 'lastname': 'Nir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8379f641-7f65-5ff2-8367-e04a517542f7', 'word_count': 189, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8379f641-7f65-5ff2-8367-e04a517542f7'}, {'abstract': 'At least 24 people were killed Sunday when a protest by Egyptian Christians over the burning of a church escalated into rioting against military rule.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/10/09/world/middleeast/20101010-EGYPT.html', 'snippet': 'At least 24 people were killed Sunday when 