ans-mourn-owner-al-davis.html', 'snippet': 'For followers of the team in Oakland and Los Angeles, its former home, any relationship with Al Davis tended to be complicated.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OAKLAND, Calif. — In the hours after Al Davis’s death was announced Saturday, a makeshift memorial sprouted at the Oakland Raiders’ practice facility: a collage of flowers and Raiders shirts, stuffed animals and homemade cards and posters with personal messages. One note, written on lined yellow paper, seemed to encompass the complicated relationship that Raiders fans had with Davis, their team’s maverick owner: ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/10/sports/raiders/raiders-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/10/sports/raiders/raiders-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/10/sports/raiders/raiders-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/10/sports/raiders/raiders-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/10/sports/raiders/raiders-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Raiders Fans Mourn an Owner Loved and Otherwise', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Raiders Fans Mourn an Owner Loved and Otherwise', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 