ee’s papers. Among the more than 160 boxes and filing cabinets of material are family photographs, business correspondence, recordings of interviews, notebooks and early manuscripts for his novels and his autobiography. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'University of Texas Acquires Coetzee’s Papers', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Libraries and Librarians', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coetzee, J M', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Texas at Austin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Africa', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-10T16:38:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patricia Cohen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patricia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cohen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3f74c0a7-8d46-510f-ad48-299d4e685dc3', 'word_count': 248, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3f74c0a7-8d46-510f-ad48-299d4e685dc3'}, {'abstract': 'I miss the old, unglamorous Duane Reade, where you could find shampoo without having to wander through a maze of sandwiches, yogurt parfaits and frozen pizza. Still, stick with it and you can find a few things worthy of navigating the aisles.', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/10/my-three-favorite-things-to-buy-at-duane-reade/', 'snippet': 'I miss the old, unglamorous Duane Reade, where you could find shampoo without having to wander through a maze of sandwiches, yogurt parfaits and frozen pizza. Still, stick with it and you can find a few things worthy of navigating the aisles.'