he does to designing clothing for her label.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Cyprus-born, London-based beauty applies the same principles to home décor and personal style as she does to designing clothing, accessories and store interiors for her label, Caramel Baby & Child. “I like things to be casual and comfortable, but also elegant and chic,” she says. “Informal formality, so to speak.” Her closet, filled with pieces by Prada, Marni and Rochas, reflects a penchant for pops of color, lush fabrics, refined prints and clean tailoring — the same attributes that separate Caramel from other kiddie companies. See more >>', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Profile in Style | Eva Karayiannis', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-10T17:27:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sandra Ballentine', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sandra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ballentine', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe7ecc25-93d5-5f50-9b3a-71cbd75780bd', 'word_count': 89, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe7ecc25-93d5-5f50-9b3a-71cbd75780bd'}, {'abstract': 'It offers archival materials, images, film and video clips.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/10/virtually-warhol-a-new-app/', 'snippet': 'It offers archival materials, images, film and video clips.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andy Warhol has always had wide appeal, and now a new app for iPhones, iPod Touch, iPads and Androids will give art lovers in-depth archival materials, images, film and video clips spanning his entire career. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Virtually Warhol: A New App', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'prin