}, {'abstract': 'François Hollande will face off against Martine Aubry for the nod to oppose President Nicolas Sarkozy next year. It was the strength of the next runner up that was unexpected.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/11/world/europe/primary-yields-runoff-for-french-socialists-and-a-surprise.html', 'snippet': 'François Hollande will face off against Martine Aubry for the nod to oppose President Nicolas Sarkozy next year. It was the strength of the next runner up that was unexpected.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — François Hollande, a centrist, took the lead in the first round of the Socialist primary this weekend, beginning the battle to see who will oppose President Nicolas Sarkozy in the general election next year. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Primary Yields Runoff for French Socialists — and a Surprise', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Primary Yields Runoff for French Socialists — and a Surprise', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hollande, Francois', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Royal, Segolene', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Aubry, Martine', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-10T21:31:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicola Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicola', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d8abfc1c-9171-5a64-be6e-b6422eb99411', 'word_count': 918, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8abfc1c-9171-5a64-be6e-b6422eb99411'}, {'abstract': 'Librado Romero has spent the past few weeks staking out New York after dark, producing a series of images imbued with a depth of emotion known only to a true lover of the city’s streets.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/10/round-midnight-with-librado-romero/', 'snippet': 'Librado Romero has spent the past few weeks staking out New York after dark, producing a series of images imbued with a depth of emotion known only to a true lover of the city’s streets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is a certain tender melancholy in the air, cloaked in shadows and soft light, as the city winds down. Revelers squeezing the last thrills from a night on the town. Lovers walking slowly hand in hand, before they kiss, part and vanish home. A solitary figure in a subway car as it rattles uptown.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Round Midnight with Librado Romero', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-10T21:32:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Gonzalez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gonzalez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ad173016-77a9-544d-81e1-8a99b0a183cf', 'word_count': 125, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ad173016-77a9-544d-81e1-8a99b0a183cf'}, {'abstract': 'The 1930 Tudor sedan and its owner were celebrated at the collector car show and auctions in Hershey, Penn., last weekend.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/10/1930-model-a-ford-wraps-a-year-on-the-road/', 'snippet': 'The 1930 Tudor sedan and its owner were celebrated at the collector car show and auctions in Hershey, Penn., last weekend.', 'lead_pa