oreographer finds similarities in Beyonce’s dance moves and costumes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Several of the dance moves in the new music video by Beyoncé for her song “Countdown” bear a striking resemblance to the work of the Belgian choreographer Anne Teresa De Keersmaeker, who told a radio station in Antwerp on Monday she believed Beyoncé had stolen her ideas.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Beyoncé Accused of Plagiarism Over Video', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-10T21:50:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0a8e432a-e1b3-5730-aa14-e48d358a0169', 'word_count': 506, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0a8e432a-e1b3-5730-aa14-e48d358a0169'}, {'abstract': 'The Hilton Garden Inn lodging chain is starting to use airline gate information displays as a marketing vehicle.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/10/an-ad-campaign-fit-for-the-jet-set/', 'snippet': 'The Hilton Garden Inn lodging chain is starting to use airline gate information displays as a marketing vehicle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The new ABC series “Pan Am” is reviving memories about the “jet age” and how much different flying was then. One difference that is still to be pointed out: There was a lot less advertising in airports back then.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Ad Campaign Fit for the Jet Set', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKET