y.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/11/us/army-leaders-warn-against-excessive-troop-cuts.html', 'snippet': 'The secretary of the Army and its chief of staff cautioned that reducing ground forces below a certain point would require rethinking America’s defense strategy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Army’s two top leaders argued Monday against shrinking their service too much, warning that the nation may have to rethink its defense strategy if the ground forces become too small.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/11/us/subARMY/subARMY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/11/us/subARMY/subARMY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/11/us/subARMY/subARMY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Army Leaders Warn Against Shrinking Forces Too Much', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Army Leaders Warn Against Shrinking Forces Too Much', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Army', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McHugh, John M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Odierno, Raymond T', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Layoffs and Job Reductions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-10T23:53:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thom Shanker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shanker', 'qualifier': None, '