 caused by a pancreatic tumor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/11/business/steve-jobss-cause-of-death-is-released-by-coroner.html', 'snippet': 'The death certificate for Steven P. Jobs says he died at home of respiratory arrest caused by a pancreatic tumor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Steven P. Jobs died at home in Palo Alto, Calif., of respiratory arrest caused by a pancreatic tumor at about 3 p.m. on Wednesday, according to his death certificate.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jobs’s Cause of Death Is Released by Coroner', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Coroner Gives Cause of Death For Steve Jobs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jobs, Steven P', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Incorporated', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-11T00:03:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bloomberg News', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bloomberg', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'News', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/54a2f2a8-9666-55b8-adb0-09e43b1e5eb1', 'word_count': 241, 'uri': 'nyt://article/54a2f2a8-9666-55b8-adb0-09e43b1e5eb1'}, {'abstract': 'U.S. striker Jozy Altidore is getting regular chances to play for his club, and that can only mean more chances for him to score.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/10/for-altidore-playing-time-is-positive-development/', 'snippet': 'U.S. striker Jozy Altidore is getting regular chances to play for his club, and that can only mean more chances for him to score.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HARRISON, N.J. — There is something oddly elliptical about a coach, in this case Jurgen Klinsmann, who says something t