u', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Humala, Ollanta', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bribery and Kickbacks', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-11T01:42:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Simon Romero', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Simon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Romero', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2759e458-3a67-5947-acff-e5490155703e', 'word_count': 370, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2759e458-3a67-5947-acff-e5490155703e'}, {'abstract': 'The record haul is a victory for the company’s general manager, Peter Gelb, but major financial problems remain.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/11/arts/music/metropolitan-operas-donations-hit-a-record-182-million.html', 'snippet': 'The record haul is a victory for the company’s general manager, Peter Gelb, but major financial problems remain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Velvet costumes evoked Tudor opulence at Donizetti’s “Anna Bolena” during last month’s opening night at the Metropolitan Opera. The red carpet was out; celebrities lent pop culture pizazz; and the audience had a genuine star, Anna Netrebko, to cheer for, which it did, lustily.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/11/arts/OPERA1/OPERA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/11/arts/OPERA1/OPERA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391