_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Iran: Airline Banned on Ticket System', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | MIDDLE EAST', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Iran: Airline Banned on Ticket System', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Economic Sanctions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-11T03:09:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicola Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicola', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/1916c205-0edf-5a64-86ab-a36a6cd6b934', 'word_count': 86, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1916c205-0edf-5a64-86ab-a36a6cd6b934'}, {'abstract': 'Foreign Minister Yang Jiechi of China and his counterpart from Myanmar, U Wunna Maung Lwin, agreed to “properly settle matters” after Myanmar suspended construction of the Myitsone hydroelectric dam.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/11/world/asia/china-and-myanmar-to-settle-on-myitsone-dam.html', 'snippet': 'Foreign Minister Yang Jiechi of China and his counterpart from Myanmar, U Wunna Maung Lwin, agreed to “properly settle matters” after Myanmar suspended construction of the Myitsone hydroelectric dam.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Foreign Minister Yang Jiechi of China and his counterpart from Myanmar, U Wunna Maung Lwin, agreed to “properly settle matters” after Myanmar suspended construction of the large Myitsone hydroelectric dam that was being financed and led by a state-controlled Chinese company, China’s official Xinhua news agency said Monday. The report did not say whether China was demanding financial compensation for work done on the project before Myanmar backed out. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'China and Myanmar to ‘Settle’ on Myitsone Dam', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | ASIA', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'China and Myanmar to &#8216;Settle&#8217; on Dam', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Levees and Dams', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Myanmar', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yang Jiechi', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hydroelectric Power', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-11T03:09:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Keith Bradsher', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Keith', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bradsher', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/0f1c6b1c-b84c-530d-a309-f7a2715f215d', 'word_count': 70, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0f1c6b1c-b84c-530d-a309-f7a2715f215d'}, {'abstract': 'A series(!) of problems about infinite regress, and a numerological tribute to Steve Jobs.', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/10/numberplay-turtles-all-the-way-down/', 'snippet': 'A series(!) of problems about infinite regress, and a numerological tribute to Steve Jobs.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Stephen Hawking’s 1988 book “A Brief History of Time” begins with the following famous anecdote.', 'source': 'The New