ght All Her Own', 'kicker': 'Arts & Leisure', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Olsen Sister Finds a Spotlight All Her Own', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Martha Marcy May Marlene (Movie)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Olsen, Mary-Kate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Olsen, Elizabeth (1989- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Olsen, Ashley', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-11T15:14:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Leah Rozen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Leah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rozen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dbceb1a7-764b-51f4-8dc4-b5d9770335c1', 'word_count': 1340, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dbceb1a7-764b-51f4-8dc4-b5d9770335c1'}, {'abstract': 'Using his connections, Coach Kurt Russell has built a juggernaut at Western Oklahoma State College, often with overlooked Latino players from the Northeast.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/12/sports/baseball/for-latino-baseball-players-in-northeast-an-opportunity-in-oklahoma.html', 'snippet': 'Using his connections, Coach Kurt Russell has built a juggernaut at Western Oklahoma State College, often with overlooked Latino players from the Northeast.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than 1,500 miles from his home campus in Altus, Okla., a junior-college baseball coach might have seemed out of place recently at a rundown diamond in Brooklyn. But that is how he likes it. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarg