nk': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3f3de42d-0c27-5922-9d96-0662bf1f836b', 'word_count': 1559, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3f3de42d-0c27-5922-9d96-0662bf1f836b'}, {'abstract': 'The Brooklyn artist Kenneth E. Parris III is on tour with members of the Merce Cunningham Dance Company, documenting their two-year Legacy Tour.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/11/drawing-dance-the-cunningham-company-in-london/', 'snippet': 'The Brooklyn artist Kenneth E. Parris III is on tour with members of the Merce Cunningham Dance Company, documenting their two-year Legacy Tour.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Brooklyn artist Kenneth E. Parris III is on tour with members of the Merce Cunningham Dance Company, documenting, through a series of drawings and paintings, their two-year Legacy Tour. After 58 years the company is scheduled to disband on New Year’s Day 2012. This is the 15th in a series of graphite drawings Mr. Parris plans to create from the road, providing a front-row seat to the final weeks of the company’s journey. This week’s entry is from London.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Drawing Dance: The Cunningham Company in London', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mitchell, Rashaun', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cunningham, Merce, Dance Co', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-11T16:06:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/480db3f5-8bd5-5da9-8594-327e7d2c5482', 'word_count': 141, 'uri': 'nyt://article/480db3f5-8bd5-5da9-8594-327e7d2c5482'}, {'abstract': 'Transatlantic Holdings has signed a confidentiality agreement with yet anothe