 bond.” “Footnote” is screening at the New York Film Festival this week and in this video, Mr. Cedar discusses elements of the film and some of the research he did to put it together.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Joseph Cedar Discusses ‘Footnote’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Film Festival', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cedar, Joseph', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-11T19:54:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b4686f1-1be2-5305-86c8-ab678cabc80c', 'word_count': 117, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b4686f1-1be2-5305-86c8-ab678cabc80c'}, {'abstract': "President Obama's jobs bill faces a tough first vote in the Senate.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/politics/100000001104969/timescast--jobs-bill-faces-senate-vote.html', 'snippet': "President Obama's jobs bill faces a tough first vote in the Senate.", 'lead_paragraph': "President Obama's jobs bill faces a tough first vote in the Senate.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/11/multimedia/video-tc-111011-jobsbill/video-tc-111011-jobsbill-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/11/multimedia/video-tc-111011-jobsbill/video-tc-111011-jobsbill-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}