 browsing for over two days.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'BlackBerry Points to Equipment Failure', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'BlackBerry Points to Equipment Failure', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'BlackBerry (Handheld Device)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Research In Motion Ltd', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-12T00:53:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian Austen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Austen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c545553-03d1-52a6-b6a9-429dfed3a1ac', 'word_count': 397, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c545553-03d1-52a6-b6a9-429dfed3a1ac'}, {'abstract': 'What’s behind all the social protests erupting from Tunisia to Wall Street? Some call it The Great Disruption. Others call it The Big Shift. You decide.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/12/opinion/theres-something-happening-here.html', 'snippet': 'What’s behind all the social protests erupting from Tunisia to Wall Street? Some call it The Great Disruption. Others call it The Big Shift. You decide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When you see spontaneous social protests erupting from Tunisia to Tel Aviv to Wall Street, it’s clear that something is happening globally that needs defining. There are two unified theories out there that intrigue me. One says this is the start of “The Great Disruption.” The other says that this is all part of “The Big Shift.” You decide.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subt