ubstances.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jimmy Kennedy, a reserve defensive tackle for the Giants, was suspended for four games by the N.F.L. on Tuesday for violating the league’s policy on performance-enhancing substances. The suspension, which is without pay, begins immediately and will end after the Giants’ game against San Francisco Nov. 13.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Giants’ Jimmy Kennedy Suspended', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Giants’ Kennedy Suspended', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doping (Sports)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suspensions, Dismissals and Resignations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kennedy, Jimmy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-12T02:32:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Borden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02f23084-a2c5-5f1d-8f79-e6e1c68bbd35', 'word_count': 160, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02f23084-a2c5-5f1d-8f79-e6e1c68bbd35'}, {'abstract': 'Why does a cable modem suddenly start dropping its connection after working perfectly fine for years?', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/11/qa-networking-with-the-cable-guy/', 'snippet': 'Why does a cable modem suddenly start dropping its connection after working perfectly fine for years?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Q&A: