: 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/12/sports/baseball/for-yankees-offseason-again-turns-to-hunt-for-pitching.html', 'snippet': 'Joe Girardi defended his players after an early playoff exit, talked about the losses to the starting rotation and said that filling those holes would be the focus in the off-season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the  pain of an abrupt ending still stinging five days after the fall, Yankees Manager Joe Girardi met with reporters at Yankee Stadium on Tuesday to discuss the team’s failure to get past the first round of the playoffs and what lies ahead for next year.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/12/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/12/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/12/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pitching Still Priority in Yankees’ Off-Season', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yankees’ Off-Season Again Focuses on Hunt For Front-Line Pitching', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Girardi, Joe', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sabathia, C C', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Swisher, Nick', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-12T02:47:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4d16e413-7e2e-5472-a6df-e37eca050ed4', 'word_count': 889, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d16e413-7e2e-5472-a6df-e37eca050ed4'}, {'abstract': 'Experts found it baffling and uncharacteristic that Iran’s Quds Force would risk linking itself so publicly to plotting a terrorist attack on American soil.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/12/world/middleeast/new-plot-is-odd-twist-for-irans-elite-quds-force.html', 'snippet': 'Experts found it baffling and uncharacteristic that Iran’s Quds Force would risk linking itself so publicly to plotting a terrorist attack on American soil.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David H. Petraeus sometimes tells the story about the time when the chief of Iran’s Quds Force of the Revolutionary Guards sent him a message about the bloody insurgency ripping Iraq apart.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Odd Twist for Elite Unit Guiding Iran’s Proxy Wars', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Odd Twist for Elite Unit Guiding Iran’s Proxy Wars', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shakuri, Gholam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Saudi Arabia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Arbabsiar, Mansour J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic Revolutionary Guards Corps', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jubeir, Adel al-', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], '