eb_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/11/debate-web-stream-does-not-flow-smoothly-for-all/', 'snippet': 'Bloomberg anticipated a surge of Web traffic for the debate and monitored it accordingly, but some viewers were frustrated with the performance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s the last word one wants to read when trying to load a Web video: buffering.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Debate Web Stream Does Not Flow Smoothly for All', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Debates (Political)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bloomberg Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-12T02:55:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/615a46a2-a6d3-5879-9df7-bfc6b45c9d06', 'word_count': 372, 'uri': 'nyt://article/615a46a2-a6d3-5879-9df7-bfc6b45c9d06'}, {'abstract': 'Since March, there have been 12 sexual attacks on women that police say are part of a pattern of groping by three suspects in Brooklyn neighborhoods.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/12/nyregion/facing-wave-of-attacks-brooklyn-neighborhoods-rally.html', 'snippet': 'Since March, there have been 12 sexual attacks on women that police say are part of a pattern of groping by three suspects in Brooklyn neighborhoods.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The police sketches and the accompanying alerts are affixed to the doors of bodegas and the windows of check-cashing stores, the glassy-eyed faces