 to help clients evade taxes on more than $600 million hidden in offshore accounts.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/10/12/u-s-tax-evasion-case-touches-julius-baer/', 'snippet': 'A tax evasion investigation in the United States has ensnared Julius Baer, a spokesman for the Swiss lender confirmed Wednesday, a day after the government charged two of the bank’s advisers with conspiring to help clients evade taxes on more than...', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — A tax evasion investigation in the United States has reached Julius Baer, a spokesman for the Swiss lender confirmed Wednesday, a day after the government charged two advisers with conspiring to help clients evade United States taxes on more than $600 million hidden in offshore accounts. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Tax Evasion Case Touches Julius Baer', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bharara, Preet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Credit Suisse Group AG', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Internal Revenue Service', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Julius Baer Holding AG', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'UBS AG', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-12T13:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Jolly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jolly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a6877b23-930f-5e8d-ab36-a0afa14fdef9', 'word_count': 403, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6877b23-930f-5e8d-ab36-a0afa14fdef9'}, {'abstract': 'South Korea’s president, Lee Myung-bak, is among a small number of global leaders who seem to have pierced President Obama’s reserve. Mr. Lee arrives Wednesday for a state visit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/13/world/asia/south-korean-state-visit-highlights-bond-between-obama-and-lee-myung-bak.html', 'snippet': 'South Korea’s president, Lee Myung-bak, is among a small number of global leaders who seem to have pierced President Obama’s reserve. Mr. Lee arrives Wednesday for a state visit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — During the state visit of South Korea’s president, Lee Myung-bak, which began on Wednesday, he will be feted at a White House state dinner, invited to speak to a joint session of Congress, and treated to a road trip to Detroit with President Obama, where the two leaders plan to tour a General Motors factory together.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/world/asia/13memo/13memo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/world/asia/13memo/13memo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/13/world/asia/13memo/13memo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'S. Korean State Visit Highlights Bond Between 2 Leaders', 'kicker': 'White House Memo', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bond Informs Visit by South Korean Leader', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee Myung-bak', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'va