ons. And while it is much faster than other travel search engines, it does not display fares from all the airlines that serve a particular route.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/travel/16PRAC/16PRAC-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 890, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/travel/16PRAC/16PRAC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/16/travel/16PRAC/16PRAC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fine-Tuning Your Flight Search', 'kicker': 'Practical Traveler', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fine-Tuning Your Flight Search', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kayak.com', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Search Engines', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ITA Software', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Microsoft Corporation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reservations (Airlines, Hotels, Etc.)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-12T16:09:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susan Stellin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susan', 'middlename': None, 'lastna