necessary danger or risk.” [ABC News]', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On Our Radar: Charges in New Zealand Oil Spill', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-12T18:30:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/796c7743-9fa0-5e80-929e-beded0672865', 'word_count': 192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/796c7743-9fa0-5e80-929e-beded0672865'}, {'abstract': 'Gary Lincoff, author of the Audubon Society’s “Field Guide to North American Mushrooms,” is fielding questions about local fungi and, perhaps, identifying that weird, spiky blob you photographed.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/12/want-to-know-about-that-mushroom-just-ask/', 'snippet': 'Gary Lincoff, author of the Audubon Society’s “Field Guide to North American Mushrooms,” is fielding questions about local fungi and, perhaps, identifying that weird, spiky blob you photographed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Oct. 17: Please note: we are no longer accepting photos for this feature. Too many mushrooms already! Thanks to those who sent in the 300 or so pix we have received. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Want to Know About That Mushroom? Just Ask', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fungi', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mushrooms', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-12T18:38:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/26560056-53db-5a8a-b284-0bdf1e69b8dc', 'word_count': 225, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26560056-53db-5a8a-b284-0bdf1e69b8dc'}, {'abstract': 'Officials with the Red Sox said they expected their general manager, Theo Epstein, to reach a deal to take over baseball operations with the Chicago Cubs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/13/sports/baseball/Theo-Epstein-Red-Sox-Cubs-General-Manager.html', 'snippet': 'Officials with the Red Sox said they expected their general manager, Theo Epstein, to reach a deal to take over baseball operations with the Chicago Cubs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For sheer futility in professional sports, the Chicago Cubs are the standard. They have not won the World Series in 103 years. They have not won a pennant since 1945. Their history is pocked with excruciating near misses — a billy goat, a black cat, fateful errors on the field and in the stands.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/sports/13epstein1/13epstein1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/sports/13epstein1/13epstein1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/13/sports/13epstein1/13epstein1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New Team, Older Curse', 'kicker': 'On Baseball', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Team, Older Curse', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Red Sox', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago Cubs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'nam