ww.nytimes.com/2011/10/13/garden/a-sergio-rodrigues-shop-opens-in-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'The Brazilian designer is opening his first United States store in more than 40 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sergio Rodrigues is in the enviable position of amassing a cult following while still alive. And at 84, the Brazilian designer shows no signs of stopping. Next week, he has a new store opening in New York, his first in this country in more than 40 years. (His previous store, OCA, in Carmel, Calif., closed in 1968.)', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13OPEN/13CURR5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 977, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13OPEN/13CURR5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13OPEN/13CURR5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Sergio Rodrigues Shop Opens in New York', 'kicker': 'Currents | Open', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At 84, a Brazilian Designer Still Sells', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'TriBeCa (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-12T22:46:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rima Suqi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rima', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Suqi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e8ec1b7f-e212-54e1-81e7-dd215883ed64', 'word_count': 159, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e8ec1b7f-e212-54e1-81e7-dd215883ed64'}, {'abstract': 'Discounts on bedding, linens, lighting, furniture and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/13/garden/sales-on-pratesi-alvar-aalto-and-more-deals.html', 'snippet': 'Discounts on bedding, linens, lighting, furniture and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Discontinued Alvar Aalto lighting and furniture will be on sale at Artek  from Friday to Sunday (the A338 Bilberry light in chrome, originally $320, will be $160); 199 Lafayette Street (Kenmare Street), (212) 219-0589.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13DEALS/13CURR4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 933, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13DEALS/13CURR4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13DEALS/13CURR4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sales on Pratesi, Alvar Aalto and More', 'kicker': 'Currents | Deals', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lamps, Linens and Furniture', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-12T22:46:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rima Suqi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rima', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Suqi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f941623e-b4c8-521f-97ac-c371ad5586a7', 'word_count': 277, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f941623e-b4c8-521f-97ac-c371ad5586a7'}, {'abstract': 'After moving to Brooklyn from a town outside Copenhagen, David Obel Rosenkvist of the furniture company Fritz Hansen figures out how to store his family’s outdoor equipment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/13/garden/storage-solutions-for-athletic-gear-shopping-with-david-rosenkvist.html', 'snippet': 'After moving to Brooklyn from a town outside Copenhagen, David Obel Rosenkvist of the furniture company Fritz Hansen figures out how to store his family’s outdoor equipment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN David Obel Rosenkvist moved his family to Cobble Hill, Brooklyn, from a town outside Copenhagen in August, he discovered a problem most New Yorkers will be familiar with: a lack of storage space. For Mr. Rosenkvist, the vice president for North America of Fritz Hansen, a Danish furniture company, the situation was especially problematic, as he, his wife and his two children are all outdoors enthusiasts.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13SHOP_SPAN/13SHOP_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13SHOP_SPAN/13SHOP_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13SHOP_SPAN/13SHOP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13SHOP_SPAN/13SHOP_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13SHOP_SPAN/13SHOP_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Storage Solutions for Athletic Gear', 'kicker': 'Shopping With David Obel Rosenkvist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Room to Stretch', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Storage', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-12T22:46:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim McKeough', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McKeough', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/247d7904-5389-5775-ace4-2a1f3b7c9a17', 'word_count': 482, 'uri': 'nyt://article/247d7904-5389-5775-ace4-2a1f3b7c9a17'}, {'abstract': 'Molly Jane Quinn and Jenna Talbott, the creators of the Unhappy Hipsters blog, on their new book, “It’s Lonely in the Modern World.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/13/garden/the-unhappy-hipsters-on-their-new-book-qa.html', 'snippet': 'Molly Jane Quinn and Jenna Talbott, the creators of the Unhappy Hipsters blog, on their new book, “It’s Lonely in the Modern World.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was early in 2010, and Molly Jane Quinn, a writer, and Jenna Talbott, a graphic designer, were working, none too happily, at Design New England, a regional magazine. They cheered each other up one chilly January evening by making a tumblr blog with a simple, hilarious engine: marrying photos from Dwell magazine with deadpan captions parodying the magazine’s signature hipster anomie. “His sartorial attempt to blend in with the concrete did little to assuage the tension,” read one early post.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13QNA1_SPAN/13QNA1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13QNA1_SPAN/13QNA1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13QNA1_SPAN/13QNA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13QNA1_SPAN/13QNA1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/13/garden/13QNA1_SPAN/13QNA1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Unhappy Hipsters', 'kicker': 'Currents | Q&A', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Unhappy Hipsters Dare to Find Solace and Success', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blogs and Blogging (Internet)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-12T22:46:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Penelope Green', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Penelope', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Green', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://artic