ract': 'David Raskin, Christopher J. Morvillo and Edward C. O’Callaghan, all alumni of the United States attorney’s office in Manhattan, will soon become litigation partners in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/10/13/former-prosecutors-join-clifford-chance/', 'snippet': 'David Raskin, Christopher J. Morvillo and Edward C. O’Callaghan, all alumni of the United States attorney’s office in Manhattan, will soon become litigation partners in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Three former federal prosecutors from New York are reuniting in private practice, agreeing to join the law firm Clifford Chance, the firm said on Thursday. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Clifford Chance Hires 3 Ex-Prosecutors', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legal Profession', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Clifford Chance', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-13T14:40:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Protess', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Protess', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5f4f1df7-8aca-5481-b9ee-9d8730d4dd0c', 'word_count': 332, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5f4f1df7-8aca-5481-b9ee-9d8730d4dd0c'}, {'abstract': 'As a green, yet bombastic second lieutenant, I was confident I could pick out the soldiers who could be counted on when that time came. Sometimes battle teaches you that you may have overlooked some of your best soldiers.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/13/in-battle-a-soldiers-heart-is-revealed/', 'snippet': 'As a green, yet bombastic second lieutenant, I was confident I could pick out the soldiers who could be counted on when that time came. Sometimes battle teaches you that you may have overlooked some of your best soldiers.', 'lead_paragraph': ' It is a theme that has been delivered over and over — war brings out the best and worst in people. Watch any old war movie starring Lee Marvin, or read the papers from the early days of the Iraq war, and you will see deeds of valor peppered with foolish and disgraceful acts of cowardice. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Battle, a Soldier’s Heart Is Revealed', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Improvised Explosive Devices', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Army', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ramadi (Iraq)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-13T14:41:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steve Griffin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Griffin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9fd41f6a-a942-5b69-9c4c-247eccdd215b', 'word_count': 1571, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9fd41f6a-a942-5b69-9c4c-247eccdd215b'}, {'abstract': 'A growing number of cities and towns are choosing to stop adding fluoride to their water, driven by tight budgets and inconclusive findings on its benefits.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/14/us/more-places-change-course-on-fluoride-in-water.html', 'snippet': 'A growing number of cities and towns are choosing to stop adding fluoride to their water, driven by tight budgets and inconclusive findings on its benefits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — A growing number of communities are choosing to stop adding fluoride to their water systems, even though the federal government and federal health officials maintain their full support for a measure they say provides a 25 percent reduction in tooth decay nationwide. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Looking to Save Money, More Places Decide to Stop Fluoridating the Water', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Looking to Save Money, More Places Decide to Stop Fluoridating the Water', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fluorides', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Water', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teeth and Dentistry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Preventive Medicine', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-13T14:43:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lizette Alvarez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lizette', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alvarez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c89d1654-374b-5b35-a1e0-50611c5dc3f6', 'word_count': 1166, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c89d1654-374b-5b35-a1e0-50611c5dc3f6'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Baldwin’s podcast, called “Here’s the Thing,” will make its debut on Oct. 24 with an interview with Michael Douglas.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/13/does-he-have-your-attention-alec-baldwin-to-host-podcast-for-wnyc/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Baldwin’s podcast, called “Here