developed island, is a destination for celebrities and A-listers from the mainland.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/13/guess-where-this-is-36/', 'snippet': 'A national park spans this archipelago, which is home to a series of mostly underdeveloped islands. The exception, one overdeveloped island, is a destination for celebrities and A-listers from the mainland.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s time again for our weekly contest: guess the location of the photograph above.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Guess Where This Is', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-13T15:59:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/57737ec0-038b-5491-81c8-df95c9884e19', 'word_count': 75, 'uri': 'nyt://article/57737ec0-038b-5491-81c8-df95c9884e19'}, {'abstract': 'The bride is a marketing director; the bridegroom is a guitarist and bassist in a rock band.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/09/fashion/weddings/larisa-heilner-james-canty-weddings.html', 'snippet': 'The bride is a marketing director; the bridegroom is a guitarist and bassist in a rock band.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Larisa Justine Heilner and James Donald Canty were married Saturday evening in an outdoor ceremony at the Silver Buttons Farm in Carversville, Pa. Dennis V. Canty, a brother of the bridegroom who became a Universal Life minister for the event, officiated. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/09/fashion/weddings/09HEILNERjpg/09HEILNERjpg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo