s season, on and off Broadway, is turning into an especially good one for the monsters Mom and Dad.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There they go again, stealing the spotlight from their cowed and embittered progeny, the unforgivable but unforgettable monsters Mom and Dad. These Freudian demons have been showing up all over the place for ages, in recurring nightmares, best-selling memoirs and novels and, perhaps most deliciously, on the stage.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Theater Talkback: Don’t Worry About Me … but Get Out of My Spotlight', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lavin, Linda', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rattigan, Terence', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Silver, Nicky', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-13T17:00:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Brantley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brantley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/40174c25-3497-55b5-b1a6-157c996b5300', 'word_count': 1242, 'uri': 'nyt://article/40174c25-3497-55b5-b1a6-157c996b5300'}, {'abstract': 'Iran’s government called American allegations that it had tried to assassinate the Saudi ambassador so ludicrous that even U.S. politicians were expressing skepticism about such a scheme.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/14/world/middleeast/iran-broadens-counter-rhetoric-on-alleged-plot-calling-it-a-joke.html', 'snippet': 'Iran’s government called American allegations that it had tried to assassinate the Saudi ambassador so ludicrous that even U.S. politicians were expressing skepticism about such a scheme.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The government of Iran on Thursday escalated its rebuttal of American criminal charges that it was behind a murder conspiracy in Washington, calling the claims that Iranian agents had plotted to kill the Saudi ambassador with the help of a Mexican drug gang so ludicrous that even politicians and press in the United States were expressing skepticism about such a scheme.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/14/world/middleeast/14iran/14iran-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 353, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/14/world/middleeast/14iran/14iran-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 353}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/14/world/middleeast/14iran/14iran-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/14/world/middleeast/14iran/14iran-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/14/world/middleeast/14iran/14iran-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Iran Scoffs at U.S. Account of Alleged Assassination Plot', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Iran Broadens Counter-Rhetoric on Alleged Plot, Calling It a Joke', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diplomatic Service, Embassies and Consulates', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Saudi Arabia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Islamic Revolutionary Guards Corps', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Faisal, Saud al-', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shakuri, Gholam', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Arbabsiar, Mansour J', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khamenei, Ali', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salehi, Ali Akbar', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-13T17:01:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0e2daa69-08d4-5a2a-9893-bbd90bc2ed51', 'word_count': 851, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0e2daa69-08d4-5a2a-9893-bbd90bc2ed51'}, {'abstract': 'Time Warner’s Warner Brothers Television Group and the CBS Corporation have reached a four-year deal with Netflix, giving it the rights to stream shows from the CW network.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/13/deal-with-time-warner-brings-the-cw-to-netflix/', 'snippet': 'Time Warner’s Warner Brothers Television Group and the CBS Corporation have reached a four-year deal with Netflix, giving it the rights to stream shows from the CW network.', 'lead_paragraph': '2:01 p.m. | Updated Once a Netflix skeptic, Time Warner has struck its biggest deal yet to allow the online service to license its television content.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Deal With Time Warner Brings the CW to Netflix', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bewkes, Jeffrey L', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corp', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CW Television Network', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Netflix Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Time Warner Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Warner Brothers', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-13T17:05:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amy Chozick and Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chozick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62e634e9-8aeb-5558-af08-cc48f9893770', 'word_count': 629, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62e634e9-8aeb-5558-af08-cc48f9893770'}, {'abstract': 'An obsessive plastic surgeon keeps a beautiful young woman imprisoned in his home in this hybrid of thriller, melodrama and horror film.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/14/movies/the-skin-i-live-in-directed-by-pedro-almodovar-review.html', 'snippet': 'An obsessive plastic surgeon keeps a beautiful young woman imprisoned in his home in this hybrid of thriller, melodrama and horror film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s an early decisive moment in Pedro Almodóvar’s exhilarating film “The Skin I Live In,” when Robert Ledgard, a plastic surgeon and madman played with soul weariness by Antonio Banderas, gazes at the image of a woman on the wall of his bedroom. She’s bigger than life, this woman, and more beautiful. He calls her Vera (Elena Anaya), and she’s stretched out in the classic recumbent pose of the odalisque: that exotic Turkish harem dweller and Orientalist fantasy painted by the likes of Goya, Ingres and  Manet, and given opulent new life and reverberant meaning by Mr. Almodóvar, a master of his art.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/movies/skin-span/skin-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/13/movies/skin-span/skin-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/movies/skin-span/skin-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/13/movies/skin-span/skin-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/13/movies/skin-span/skin-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Beautiful Prisoner Lost in Almodóvar’s Labyrinth', 'kicker': "Movie Review | 'The Skin I Live In'", 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Beautiful Prisoner, Lost In Almodóvar’s Labyrinth', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALMODOVAR, PEDRO', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N