ood businesses like Ben and Jerry’s, Liberatos Pizza and Sixpoint Craft Ales have donated food to the protesters. More should get on board.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More on #OccupyWallStreet', 'kicker': 'Mark Bittman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Occupy Wall Street', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Financial District (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-13T19:18:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Bittman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bittman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/63c325c5-4a20-545f-9b3e-d0142b3b8f11', 'word_count': 270, 'uri': 'nyt://article/63c325c5-4a20-545f-9b3e-d0142b3b8f11'}, {'abstract': 'A vintage style consultant and pinup expert on how to get the Bettie Page look.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/13/spotted-on-the-street-bettina-may/', 'snippet': 'A vintage style consultant and pinup expert on how to get the Bettie Page look.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this new column, the makeup artist Tina Turnbow runs into real beauty on the streets of New York City.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spotted on the Street | Bettina May', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-13T19:26:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tina Turnbow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Turnbow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization':