'abstract': 'Mr. Stein, 56, is a commercial real estate lawyer who specializes in financing and land leases and has also written five books on commercial real estate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/16/realestate/the-30-minute-interview-with-joshua-stein.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Stein, 56, is a commercial real estate lawyer who specializes in financing and land leases and has also written five books on commercial real estate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mr. Stein, 56, is a commercial real estate lawyer and the sole proprietor of the law firm that bears his name. Before starting the firm over a year ago, he was a partner in the Real Estate Practice Group in the New York office of Latham & Watkins. ', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/realestate/16SQFT/sq--ft-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/realestate/16SQFT/sq--ft-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/16/realestate/16SQFT/sq--ft-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Joshua Stein', 'kicker': 'Square Feet | The 30-Minute Interview', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Joshua Stein', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Renting and Leasing (Real Estate)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate (Commercial)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stein, Joshua', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-13T21:47:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'orig