attracted some bigger names than usual, with mixed results.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/14/theater/familiar-names-dot-new-york-musical-theater-festival.html', 'snippet': 'The New York Musical Theater Festival has attracted some bigger names than usual, with mixed results.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than a handful of names have been made at the New York Musical Theater Festival. The impish “[title of show]” duo Jeff Bowen and Hunter Bell, the Pulitzer Prize-winning “Next to Normal” team of Tom Kitt and Brian Yorkey, and the pastiche-happy “Altar Boyz” writers Gary Adler, Michael Patrick Walker and Kevin Del Aguila all rode the wave of festival hype to acclaim.\xa0', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/14/arts/Sub-NYMF-1/Sub-NYMF-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 778, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/14/arts/Sub-NYMF-1/Sub-NYMF-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/14/arts/Sub-NYMF-1/Sub-NYMF-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sometimes Old-Guard Talent Must Lean on New', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sometimes Old-Guard Talent Must Lean on New', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York Musical Theater Festival', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-13T22:04:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Grode', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': No