 and wooed them to his lot with balloons, refreshments and a free toolkit. Salesmen from as far away as Texas were on hand to escort customers to a packed office.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/14/automobiles/MEESESALES2/MEESESALES2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/14/automobiles/MEESESALES2/MEESESALES2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/14/automobiles/MEESESALES2/MEESESALES2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 658, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Used-Car Dealers Have a Deal for You. No Kidding.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Used-Car Dealers Have a Deal for You. No Kidding.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric and Hybrid Vehicles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Japan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Cars (Compact, Subcompact and Microcars)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recession and Depression', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Used Cars', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-13T23:28:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mickey Meece', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mickey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Meece', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ffca0249-df24-5894-86f7-ac8b99d6d113', 'word_count': 895, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ffca0249-df24-5894-86f7-ac8b99d6d113'}, {'abstract': 'Under the hood, automakers are applying technology to meet stiff future mileage standards, but they’re staying mindful of Americans’ love of size and power in their vehicles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/14/automobiles/automakers-aim-to-meet-mileage-standards-without-big-sacrifices.html', 'snippet': 'Under the hood, automakers are applying technology to meet stiff future mileage standards, but they’re staying mindful of Americans’ love of size and power in their vehicles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE formula for better fuel economy in cars has long been a simple equation: the smaller the vehicle, the farther it goes on a gallon of gas.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/14/automobiles/14CARS_SPAN/14CARS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/14/automobiles/14CARS_SPAN/14CARS_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/14/automobiles/14CARS_SPAN/14CARS_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 538, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/14/automobiles/14CARS_SPAN/14CARS_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/14/automobiles/14CARS_SPAN/14CARS_SPAN-