uy, Mayor Jean Quan called a news conference at Otaez, the popular restaurant in the city’s Fruitvale neighborhood where Mr. Campos was gunned down. She offered her solution to violence in the area: surveillance cameras. The installation of cameras and extra police patrols in the district had already caused crime to drop, she said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/12/us/12QUAN2/12QUAN2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/12/us/12QUAN2/12QUAN2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/12/us/12QUAN2/12QUAN2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mayor’s Efforts on Oakland’s Crime Problem Are Questioned', 'kicker': 'The Bay Citizen', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mayor’s Efforts on Oakland’s Crime Problem Are Questioned', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crime Rates', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quan, Jean', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oakland (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-14T00:08:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shoshana Walter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shoshana', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Walter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material