lls to Limit Pentagon Cuts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In and From Congress, Calls to Limit Pentagon Cuts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Joint Chiefs of Staff', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Panetta, Leon E', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-14T01:52:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thom Shanker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shanker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b96c586a-a573-5650-870d-16f7385d6511', 'word_count': 686, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b96c586a-a573-5650-870d-16f7385d6511'}, {'abstract': 'Tuesday’s Republican debate opened the door on a fantasy world where nothing looks or behaves the way it does in real life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/14/opinion/rabbit-hole-economics.html', 'snippet': 'Tuesday’s Republican debate opened the door on a fantasy world where nothing looks or behaves the way it does in real life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Reading the transcript of Tuesday’s Republican debate on the economy is, for anyone who has actually been following economic events these past few years, like falling down a rabbit hole. Suddenly, you find yourself in a fantasy world where nothing looks or behaves the way it does in real life.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '31', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia':