uCredit, which was sued by three customers in federal court for deceptive practices under the 1996 Credit Repair Organizations Act. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Consumers’ Right to Sue', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Consumers&#8217; Right to Sue', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit Card Accountability, Responsibility and Disclosure Act (2009)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARBITRATION, CONCILIATION AND MEDIATION', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CompuCredit Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-14T02:03:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/13acfd85-4ba3-50f8-b10c-40a95e1b3a2e', 'word_count': 359, 'uri': 'nyt://article/13acfd85-4ba3-50f8-b10c-40a95e1b3a2e'}, {'abstract': 'N.F.L. Commissioner Roger Goodell and representatives of the players’ union are meeting Friday with a House committee seeking a testing program for human growth hormone.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/14/sports/football/nfl-football-roundup.html', 'snippet': 'N.F.L. Commissioner Roger Goodell and representatives of the players’ union are meeting Friday with a House committee seeking a testing program for human growth hormone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Representatives of the N.F.L., including Commissioner Roger Goodell, and the players union will meet with members of Congress on Friday in Washington to discuss the holdup in starting a blood-t