e-here-the-land-of-milk-and-honey.html', 'snippet': 'Just as everyone who moves to San Diego considers learning how to surf, nobody comes to Hong Kong without considering some entrepreneurial endeavor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fredy Harianto was one of 30 or so people who congregated at the headquarters of Boot HK, an incubator for Internet start-ups in Wan Chai, one of Hong Kong’s many business districts, to hear a lecture on how to create a punchy, likable corporate blog voice. The attendees were mostly young; each had sharp clothes and impeccable posture. Only two were born in Hong Kong.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/magazine/16here_span/16here_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 388, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/16/magazine/16here_span/16here_span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 388}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/magazine/16here_span/16here_span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/magazine/16here_span/16here_span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/16/magazine/16here_span/16here_span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Land of Milk and Money', 'kicker': 'You Are Here', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Land of Milk and Money', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hong K