abstract': '‘Dawn of the Jedi’ is set a really long time ago.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/14/picture-this-new-star-wars-comics-and-graphic-novels-of-stieg-larssons-trilogy/', 'snippet': '‘Dawn of the Jedi’ is set a really long time ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When moviegoers were first introduced to “Star Wars” in 1977 they were promised a story that took place a long time ago, in a galaxy far, far away. At the New York Comic Con on Friday, Dark Horse is revealing a new comic book series, “Dawn of the Jedi,” that explores the Jedi myth long before Luke Skywalker took his first step.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Picture This: New ‘Star Wars’ Comics, and Graphic Novels of Stieg Larsson’s Trilogy', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comic Books and Strips', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Graphic Novels', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Golden, Christopher', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harris, Charlaine', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Larsson, Stieg', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DC Comics', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-14T15:00:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By George Gene Gustines', 'person': [{'firstname': 'George', 'middlename': 'Gene', 'lastname': 'Gustines', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f56e4e87-fb32-5505-83fc-e414765fe032', 'word_count': 280, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f56e4e87-fb32-5505-83fc-e414765fe032'}, {'abstract': 'In a culture obsessed with dogs, dog whisperers and domestic pets of all kinds, religious groups are paying attention, too, with many megachurches sponsoring groups for pet lovers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/15/us/pet-ministries-are-growing-in-churches.html', 'snippet': 'In a culture obsessed with dogs, dog whisperers and domestic pets of all kinds, religious groups are paying attention, too, with many megachurches sponsoring groups for pet lovers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a boy in San Antonio, Paul Flotron helped his family raise miniature schnauzers. He was there for the dogs’ births, and his family showed the dogs at competitions all over Texas. When he was 10, his family moved to St. Louis, where he accumulated “the Flotron Miniature Zoo,” including “dwarf crocodiles, African pancake tortoises, birds, boa constrictors, hermit crabs, fish, and always dogs.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/15/us/15beliefs_cnd/15beliefs_cnd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/15/us/15beliefs_cnd/15beliefs_cnd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/15/us/15beliefs_cnd/15beliefs_cnd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/15/us/15beliefs_cnd/15beliefs_cnd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/15/us/15beliefs_cnd/15beliefs_cnd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Churches Take Steps to Show Their Love for Animals', 'kicker': 'Beliefs', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Churches Take Steps to Show Their Love for Animals', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christians and Christianity', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Religion and Belief', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dogs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-14T15:02:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Oppenheimer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Oppenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/65e78667-b325-561f-b38c-6a728e845779', 'word_count': 1021, 'uri': 'nyt://article/65e78667-b325-561f-b38c-6a728e845779'}, {'abstract': 'Even with a primary vote on Sunday, only a few voters are passionate about their choices.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/15/world/europe/for-dispirited-french-voters-none-of-the-above-seems-best.html', 'snippet': 'Even with a primary vote on Sunday, only a few voters are passionate about their choices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — This is a grumpy French presidential campaign, with only a few voters passionate about their choices.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/world/16francespan/16francespan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/16/world/16francespan/16francespan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': Non