 you. But you’re a serious artist; how do you deepen and expand your career beyond this commercial megahit? Do you abandon your tradition? Fuse it with something else?', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/arts/dance/16DUNNE_SPAN/16DUNNE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/16/arts/dance/16DUNNE_SPAN/16DUNNE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/arts/dance/16DUNNE_SPAN/16DUNNE_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/arts/dance/16DUNNE_SPAN/16DUNNE_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/16/arts/dance/16DUNNE_SPAN/16DUNNE_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Untraditional, but Still an Irish Tradition', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Untraditional, but Still an Irish Tradition', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baryshnikov Arts Center', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dunne, Colin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Riverdance', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-14T16:38:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claudia La Ro