nd a profile of the musician, and photographer, by A.O. Scott.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/14/now-online-t-magazine-winter-womens-fashion-2011/', 'snippet': 'The winter fashion issue starts with our cover star Patti Smith and a profile of the musician, and photographer, by A.O. Scott.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The winter fashion issue starts with our cover star, the musician and photographer\xa0Patti Smith, and a profile of her by A.O. Scott. Inside, the actress Kirsten Dunst talks about awards, playing dress up and Hitchcock; the Arctic Monkeys show what life on the road is like; and Henry Louis Gates Jr. discusses black culture in America. And don’t miss news of a Norell sale, Suzy Menkes on why old clothes move museum tickets, an article that explores whether acupuncture can really get rid of wrinkles and a look at the two women who are the real lovers behind a West Village sculpture. See all stories from the issue >>', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Now Online | T Magazine Winter Women’s Fashion 2011', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dunst, Kirsten', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gates, Henry Louis Jr', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Menkes, Suzy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Patti', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Arctic Monkeys', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-14T23:30:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0dc19e7e-569d-52e9-96a5-419168660194', 'word_count': 109, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0dc19e7e-569d-52e9-96a5-419168660194'}, {'abstract': 'The three-bedroom apartment at 15 Central Park West had sold for just $6.8 million three years ago.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/14/big-ticket-sold-for-17000000/', 'snippet': 'The three-bedroom apartment at 15 Central Park West had sold for just $6.8 million three years ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The three-bedroom condominium at 15 Central Park West that sold for $17 million — after last trading hands in 2008 for $6.8 million and thus generating nearly $10 million profit in just three years — was the highest sale of the week, according to city property records.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Big Ticket | Sold for $17,000,000', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Brown Harris Stevens', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'CENTRAL PARK (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Upper West Side (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-14T23:31:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marc Santora', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marc', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Santora', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3be06019-456c-50fc-821c-25761d5aa1de', 'word_count': 189, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3be06019-456c-50fc-821c-25761d5