e seeking a stay in state court on Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The day after being barred from racing in New York for 10 years, the trainer Richard Dutrow Jr. won the feature race at Belmont Park on Thursday with a filly named Tiz the Argument. He has three more horses entered at Belmont on Saturday, an afternoon that, if New York authorities get their way, will be his last as a horseman in good standing until 2021.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/15/sports/sub-drape/sub-drape-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/15/sports/sub-drape/sub-drape-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/15/sports/sub-drape/sub-drape-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'With Business Already Down, Dutrow Awaits Ruling on 10-Year Suspension', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Business Already Down, Dutrow Awaits Ruling on 10-Year Suspension', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suspensions, Dismissals and Resignations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dutrow, Richard E Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-15T00:19:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Drape', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Drape', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_o