homa-states-weeden-is-heisman-contender.html', 'snippet': 'Teammates tease Oklahoma State’s Brandon Weeden, a leading candidate for the Heisman Trophy, for being older than half the starting quarterbacks in the N.F.L.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The age jokes have become, well, old. Brandon Weeden, the senior quarterback for the Oklahoma State Cowboys, certainly does not look or feel a day over 28, which is what he will be Saturday when he takes the field at Royal-Memorial Stadium to face the Texas Longhorns. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/15/sports/y-cowboys/y-cowboys-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/15/sports/y-cowboys/y-cowboys-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/15/sports/y-cowboys/y-cowboys-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 603, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/15/sports/y-cowboys/y-cowboys-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/15/sports/y-cowboys/y-cowboys-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Top Quarterback Teased for Being 28', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Top Quarterback Teased for Being 28', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oklahoma State University', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Texas at Austin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value'