, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c98808fe-4c40-5925-bd96-db58f5bf633b', 'word_count': 1880, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c98808fe-4c40-5925-bd96-db58f5bf633b'}, {'abstract': 'Three decades ago, Jerry Hairston Jr. had the nerve to tell Tony La Russa to give his father more playing time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/15/sports/baseball/hairston-jr-of-brewers-haunting-la-russa-his-fathers-manager.html', 'snippet': 'Three decades ago, Jerry Hairston Jr. had the nerve to tell Tony La Russa to give his father more playing time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ST. LOUIS — It was a little gift from one family to another, a miniature pull-cart holding a flower arrangement. Tony La Russa and his wife, Elaine, sent it to Jerry Hairston and his wife, Esperanza, after the birth of their son Jerry Jr., in 1976, when La Russa and Hairston were teammates on Class AAA Iowa in the Chicago White Sox farm system.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/15/sports/sub-y-brewers/sub-y-brewers-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 723, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/15/sports/sub-y-brewers/sub-y-brewers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/15/sports/sub-y-brewers/sub-y-brewers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Brewers’ Hairston Haunts La Russa, His Father’s Favorite Manager', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Brewers&#8217; Hairston Haunts La Russa, His Father&#8217;s Favorite Manager', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywo