ing against type; when the mood struck, he would jokingly threaten to clear the wee-hour revelers from his living room by digging into Aaron Copland’s gnarly Piano Variations. So said his daughter, Jamie Bernstein, as she narrated “Late Night With Leonard Bernstein,” a look at the after-hours maestro, which opened the 2011-12 season in the Copland House concert series last month. ', 'print_section': 'WE', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/nyregion/16MUSICWE_SPAN/16MUSICWE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/16/nyregion/16MUSICWE_SPAN/16MUSICWE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/nyregion/16MUSICWE_SPAN/16MUSICWE-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/nyregion/16MUSICWE_SPAN/16MUSICWE_SPAN-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/16/nyregion/16MUSICWE_SPAN/16MUSICWE_SPAN-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Glimpse Into a Maestro’s Salon, After Hours', 'kicker': 'Arts | Westchester', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Glimpse Into a Maestro’s Salon, After Hours', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mount Kisco (NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Copland, Aaron', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 