www.nytimes.com/2011/10/16/sports/football/two-guys-with-super-bowl-rings-to-join-jets-ring-of-honor.html', 'snippet': 'The Jets will induct Larry Grantham, Gerry Philbin, Freeman McNeil and Al Toon into their Ring of Honor. They are pillars not only of Jets history, but also of pro football history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Side by side, they are pillars not only of Jets history, but also of pro football history.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ring of Honor Inductees Set Example Beyond the Jets', 'kicker': 'Sports of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ring of Honor Inductees Set Example Beyond the Jets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Philbin, Gerry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-15T12:22:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Anderson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Anderson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1cbd663b-d89f-5802-9a2d-2b57ac22cbc5', 'word_count': 838, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1cbd663b-d89f-5802-9a2d-2b57ac22cbc5'}, {'abstract': 'A New Yorker, for no explicable reason, has been a lifelong fan of the Minnesota Vikings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/16/sports/football/greenwich-village-to-the-metrodome-a-serious-man-a-serious-fan.html', 'snippet': 'A New Yorker, for no explicable reason, has been a lifelong fan of the Minnesota Vikings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’m a Minnesota Vikings fan. This fact will invariably come up in conversation within a half-hour of our meeting. My life story usually unfolds in this order: I’m a New Yorker, I don’t own an iPhone — by choice — and my lifelong allegiance to a snakebitten N.F.L. franchise that plays its home games 1,020 miles away from my Greenwich Village apartment imbued in me an existential crisis long before I could correctly spell either word. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/sports/vikings/vikings-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 725, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/sports/vikings/vikings-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/16/sports/vikings/vikings-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Serious Man, a Serious Fan on His Own Viking Quest', 'kicker': 'Cheering Section', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Serious Man, a Serious Fan On His Own Viking Quest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Minnesota Vikings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-15T12:30:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tony Gervino', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tony', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gervino', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 't