44f-845b-583a-87db-bcfb4b10f223'}, {'abstract': 'In a blistering political climate, cooler heads don’t prevail.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/16/opinion/sunday/bruni-huntsman-a-nice-guy-finishing-last.html', 'snippet': 'In a blistering political climate, cooler heads don’t prevail.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PEPPERONI and flatulence. That’s what Jon Huntsman was reduced to. Groveling for attention at the Republican debate last week, he fired off one joke, a tasty one, about 9-9-9 sounding more like the price of a pizza than the contours of a tax plan. He fired off another joke, less savory, about Washington as a font of natural gas. He meant bloated and meaningless rhetoric — at least I think he did — but still. Some metaphors just aren’t worth it.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/frank-bruni/frank-bruni-articleLarge.png', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/frank-bruni/frank-bruni-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/frank-bruni/frank-bruni-jumbo.png', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/frank-bruni/frank-bruni-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/frank-bruni/frank-bruni-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail':