, '_id': 'nyt://article/314c1ba6-8ec1-59dc-b148-06cd32bb1f3a', 'word_count': 756, 'uri': 'nyt://article/314c1ba6-8ec1-59dc-b148-06cd32bb1f3a'}, {'abstract': 'Texas’ sputtering football program has been unable to back up its boardroom leverage, branding power and market reach.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/16/sports/ncaafootball/oklahoma-state-makes-texas-an-extra-in-seasons-drama.html', 'snippet': 'Texas’ sputtering football program has been unable to back up its boardroom leverage, branding power and market reach.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AUSTIN, Tex. — It has been a season rich in bizarre anomalies in college football. Consider that Missouri, with its long history of athletic irrelevance, has emerged as the key figure in conference realignment. Then there’s Boise State, which could be a member of the Big East by the end of this week. And don’t forget once-mighty Texas, less than two years removed from an appearance in the national title game, proving once again that its sputtering football program can’t back up its boardroom leverage, branding power and market reach. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/sports/YLONGHORNS/YLONGHORNS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 314, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/16/sports/YLONGHORNS/YLONGHORNS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 314}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/sports/YLONGHORNS/YLONGHORNS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 535, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/16/sports/YLONGHORNS/YLONGHORNS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/16/sports/YLONGHORNS/YLONGHORNS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Texas in Middle of Everything but the Title Race', 'kicker': 'Oklahoma State 38, Texas 26', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Texas in Middle of Everything but the Title Race', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Texas at Austin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oklahoma State University', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Mack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Big 12 Conference', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-16T00:29:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pete Thamel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pete', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thamel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/af08651c-ce4f-5693-847f-bf617677f418', 'word_count': 883, 'uri': 'nyt://article/af08651c-ce4f-5693-847f-bf617677f418'}, {'abstract': 'With tax increment financing not having had the desired effect in some of Chicago’s poorest neighborhoods, there are calls for more development in those areas to give the program a boost.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/16/us/tif-may-need-a-boost-in-poor-neighborhoods.html', 'snippet': 'With tax increment financing not having had the desired effect in some of Chicago’s poorest neighborhoods, there are calls for more develo