om/2011/10/17/business/invincible-goldman-loses-stride-briefly.html', 'snippet': 'Given last week’s trading, Goldman’s ability to generate returns above the cost of financing itself is not being taken for granted by shareholders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The exceptionalism of Goldman Sachs has taken another knock. For a brief period last week, shares of the company, led by Lloyd C. Blankfein, traded at a bigger discount to book value — or assets minus liabilities — than those of its rival JPMorgan Chase. This rarely happens and suggests that investors fear that Goldman Sach’s franchise as a trader of securities and adviser to corporations and governments may be somehow damaged.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/17/business/sub-views/sub-views-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 476, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/17/business/sub-views/sub-views-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/17/business/sub-views/sub-views-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Invincible Goldman Loses Stride, Briefly', 'kicker': 'Reuters Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Goldman Loses Stride, Briefly', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Deutsche Bank AG', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-17T05:08:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Busines