ulti-billion dollar business, but some analysts wonder whether cellphone users will ever click on ads the same way the do on computers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Google’s earnings report Thursday highlighted its mobile business’s growing contribution to revenue. But can mobile ever be as big a business as desktop search? ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Can Mobile Search Be as Big for Google as Desktop Search?', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wireless Communications', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-17T14:38:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claire Cain Miller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Claire', 'middlename': 'Cain', 'lastname': 'Miller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d43d2d61-748c-51e6-8a5b-e711a01034a0', 'word_count': 548, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d43d2d61-748c-51e6-8a5b-e711a01034a0'}, {'abstract': 'Apple’s first weekend sales for the iPhone 4S broke company records.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/17/new-iphones-first-weekend-sales-best-ever/', 'snippet': 'Apple’s first weekend sales for the iPhone 4S broke company records.', 'lead_paragraph': 'People were O.K., it turns out, with an evolutionary iPhone.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More Than 4 Million iPhone 4S’s Sold Over First Weekend', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'iPhone', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'n