Book Foundation mistakenly includes Lauren Myracle’s young-adult novel “Shine” on the shortlist and says it can stay in competition, it asks the author to withdraw and she agrees.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/17/she-coulda-been-a-contender-national-book-award-finalist-withdraws-after-mistake/', 'snippet': 'After the National Book Foundation mistakenly includes Lauren Myracle’s young-adult novel “Shine” on the shortlist and says it can stay in competition, it asks the author to withdraw and she agrees.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In case there was any doubt that the annual announcements of literary prizes can yield high drama, a finalist for the National Book Awards curtly withdrew from the shortlist on Monday, five days after she was mistakenly named a finalist by the National Book Foundation. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'She Coulda Been a Contender: National Book Award Finalist Withdraws After Mistake', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lithgow, John', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shepard, Matthew', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Book Foundation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-17T16:32:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Bosman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bosman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e9d52a52-3f0f-5bf6-968f-a1