r-n-f-l-passing-barrage/', 'snippet': 'For weeks, we have been told that the N.F.L. has turned into a passing league, that the pinball-machine passing and scoring numbers were the new norm. Then Week 6 arrived.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For weeks, we have been told that the N.F.L. has turned into a passing league. That the pinball-machine passing and scoring numbers were the new norm. That all the rules changes over the past three decades had left us with a game that looked more like the Arena Football League. \xa0Then Week 6 came.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Correction Has Arrived for N.F.L. Passing Barrage', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-18T10:00:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chase Stuart', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chase', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stuart', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0e7d2e1f-2cb8-532f-b31c-b3fdee57a86d', 'word_count': 1098, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0e7d2e1f-2cb8-532f-b31c-b3fdee57a86d'}, {'abstract': 'The latest political news from today’s Times and around the Web, plus a look at what’s happening in Washington.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/18/the-early-word-rolling/', 'snippet': 'The latest political news from today’s Times and around the Web, plus a look at what’s happening in Washington.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Today’s Times:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Early Word: Rolling', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [