 'Mike Tanier’s less-than-important developments during the baseball playoffs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All through the baseball playoffs, Mike Tanier will provide the Bats blog with daily updates on less-than-important developments from around the league.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Before the World Series, a Refresher on Ticket Scams', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berkman, Lance', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Jerry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Nolan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'St Louis Cardinals', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Texas Rangers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-18T15:40:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Tanier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tanier', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/08c67207-8cb6-5e4d-83a7-08de6458c807', 'word_count': 865, 'uri': 'nyt://article/08c67207-8cb6-5e4d-83a7-08de6458c807'}, {'abstract': 'Video screen time provides no educational benefits for children under age 2 and leaves less room for activities that do, pediatricians say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/19/health/19babies.html', 'snippet': 'Video screen time provides no educational benefits for children under age 2 and leaves less room for activities that do, pediatricians say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Parents of infants and toddlers should limit the time their children spend in front of televisions, computers, self-described educational games and even grown-up shows playing in the background, the American Academy of Pediatrics warned on Tuesday. Video screen time provides no educational benefits for children under age 2 and leaves less room for activities that do, like interacting with other people and playing, the group said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/19/us/SUB-BABIES/SUB-BABIES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 314, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/19/us/SUB-BABIES/SUB-BABIES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 314}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/19/us/SUB-BABIES/SUB-BABIES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 535, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/19/us/SUB-BABIES/SUB-BABIES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/19/us/SUB-BABIES/SUB-BABIES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Parents Urged Again to Limit TV for Youngest', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Parents Urged Again To Limit TV For Youngest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Babies and Infants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN ACADEMY OF PEDIATRICS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subj