SALSA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Old Havana, Souped Up and Sexy', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Old Havana, Souped Up and Sexy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Salsa Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lehman Center for the Performing Arts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chavez, Roclan Gonzalez', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-18T20:50:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Seibert', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Seibert', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/e37751ba-9c8e-57dd-9b24-6fa9888ac7b2', 'word_count': 496, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e37751ba-9c8e-57dd-9b24-6fa9888ac7b2'}, {'abstract': 'Quarterback Carson Palmer, who had threatened to retire rather than play again for the Bengals, was dealt to the Raiders for draft picks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/19/sports/football/raiders-acquire-carson-palmer-from-bengals-trade-deadline.html', 'snippet': 'Quarterback Carson Palmer, who had threatened to retire rather than play again for the Bengals, was dealt to the Raiders for draft picks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The N.F.L. trade deadline is normally a somnolent affair, just a few moves involving disgruntled and mostly forgotten players. But the Cincinnati Bengals and the Oakland Raiders rocked the league Tuesday with quarterback Carson Palmer, who had threatened to retire rather than play again for the Bengals, moving to the Raiders in exchange for a first-round draft pick and another pick that could become a first-rounder. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/19/sports/football/19palmer-pic/19palmer-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/19/sports/football/19palmer-pic/19palmer-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/19/sports/football/19palmer-pic/19palmer-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 747, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/19/sports/football/19palmer-pic/19palmer-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/19/sports/football/19palmer-pic/19palmer-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Disgruntled Palmer Is Traded at Deadline', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bengals Trade Disgruntled Palmer at Deadline', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Draft and Recruitment (Sports)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cincinnati Bengals', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oakland Raiders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Palmer, Carson', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trades (Sports)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-18T20:53:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pr