 the airwaves with songs about dancing, not the worries of working people.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/19/arts/music/occupy-wall-street-protest-lacks-an-anthem.html', 'snippet': 'The Occupy Wall Street protests may be spreading, but musicians continue to fill the airwaves with songs about dancing, not the worries of working people.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Every successful movement has a soundtrack,” the songwriter Tom Morello told reporters after he had tried to fire up the crowd at the Occupy Wall Street Protest last week with a Woody Guthrie tune and one of his own labor songs. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/19/arts/jump-2-protest/jump-2-protest-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/19/arts/jump-2-protest/jump-2-protest-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/19/arts/jump-2-protest/jump-2-protest-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At the Protests, the Message Lacks a Melody', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At the Protests, The Message Lacks a Melody', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Occupy Wall Street', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-18T22:24:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts',