ersonality (the plain vinegar flavor was less appealing). The beets are convenient for hors d’oeuvres, salads, side dishes or for slicing into sandwiches. They are sold refrigerated in a resealable package. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/19/dining/19STUFF_BEETS/19STUFF_BEETS-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 837, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/19/dining/19STUFF_BEETS/19STUFF_BEETS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/19/dining/19STUFF_BEETS/19STUFF_BEETS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Baby Beets: Cute, Sweet and Handy', 'kicker': 'Food Stuff', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Baby Beets: Cute, Sweet and Handy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-18T22:44:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/059bc73d-31c9-5c01-ba8a-4c08dce4d997', 'word_count': 78, 'uri': 'nyt://article/059bc73d-31c9-5c01-ba8a-4c08dce4d997'}, {'abstract': '“Secret Millionaires Club” is holding meetings again, and Warren E. Buffett tells DealBook about his financial advice for kids and why he is getting help from t