'word_count': 1174, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a8072afc-b14e-57f2-99e3-a1bc8f83179b'}, {'abstract': 'A bank bailout proposal may be good for European governments but not for investors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/19/business/european-bailout-plan-may-not-satisfy-markets.html', 'snippet': 'A bank bailout proposal may be good for European governments but not for investors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bailing out Europe’s banks may be less expensive than governments feared and investors hoped. European Union officials are discussing a plan that would require lenders to hit a demanding core Tier 1 capital ratio of 9 percent, but would not require them to factor in the effects of a deep recession. A lower-than-expected bill is good for the finances of euro zone governments, but may not be enough to win back the market’s confidence.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/19/business/Views/Views-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 974, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/19/business/Views/Views-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/19/business/Views/Views-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'European Bailout Plan May Not Satisfy Markets', 'kicker': 'Reuters Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Markets May Find Bailout Lacking', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gross Domestic Product', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'ma