 gun and burglarize his apartment in Inwood, Jason B. Holt faced a question: Should he leave the building?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Officer Guilty in a Strange Hunt for Treasure', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Officer Guilty in a Strange Hunt for Treasure', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holt, Jason B', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality and Misconduct', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-19T02:01:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Al Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Al', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eada32d2-de89-5539-ac08-44fe63549607', 'word_count': 398, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eada32d2-de89-5539-ac08-44fe63549607'}, {'abstract': 'A deportation program has led disproportionately to the removal of Latino immigrants and to arrests by immigration authorities of hundreds of United States citizens, a new report says.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/19/us/latinos-said-to-bear-weight-of-deportation-program.html', 'snippet': 'A deportation program has led disproportionately to the removal of Latino immigrants and to arrests by immigration authorities of hundreds of United States citizens, a new report says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A deportation program that is central to the Obam