2011/10/19/us/politics/three-lawmakers-propose-cutting-contractor-wages.html', 'snippet': 'Two senators and a congressman have asked the debt-reduction committee to curb the federal wages paid to top employees of government contractors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Already facing the prospect of losing billions of dollars in revenue from cuts in government spending, federal contractors could also see limits on how much they can be paid in salary with federal funds. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Three Lawmakers Propose Cutting Contractor Wages', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Three Lawmakers Propose Cutting Contractor Wages', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boxer, Barbara', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Government Procurement', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Joint Select Committee on Deficit Reduction', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grassley, Charles E', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Government Employees', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wages and Salaries', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-19T04:06:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ron Nixon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nixon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c027badb-4c3e-5c1f-b261-3cb70df5bb83', 'word_count': 540, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c027badb-4c3e-5c1f-b261-3cb70df5bb83'}, {'abstract': 'The following is a transcript of the Republican presidential deb