 a dilapidated garage into a functional, designer studio apartment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/20/greathomesanddestinations/on-location-in-bordeaux-a-garage-converted-to-a-bachelor-pad.html', 'snippet': 'A freelance photographer on a tight budget turned a dilapidated garage into a functional, designer studio apartment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BORDEAUX, France —Jérémie Buchholtz, a freelance photographer, thought the choice would be an easy one when it came to finding an apartment to suit his lifestyle and budget. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/20/greathomesanddestinations/20gh-location/20gh-location-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/20/greathomesanddestinations/20gh-location/20gh-location-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/20/greathomesanddestinations/20gh-location/20gh-location-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 900, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/20/greathomesanddestinations/20gh-location/20gh-location-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/20/greathomesanddestinations/20gh-location/20gh-location-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Garage Converted to a Bachelor Pad', 'kicker': 'On Location', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Garage Converted to a Bachelor Pad', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bordeaux (France)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'nam