rg’s older sister has left Facebook, the company he co-founded, to follow an agenda of her own.', 'lead_paragraph': '“WHO wants a tequila shot?” Randi Zuckerberg shouted over the thump of “Baby One More Time,” Britney Spears’s breakup anthem.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/20/fashion/20ZUCKERBERG4_SPAN/20ZUCKERBERG4_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/20/fashion/20ZUCKERBERG4_SPAN/20ZUCKERBERG4_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/20/fashion/20ZUCKERBERG4_SPAN/20ZUCKERBERG4_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/20/fashion/20ZUCKERBERG4_SPAN/20ZUCKERBERG4_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/20/fashion/20ZUCKERBERG4_SPAN/20ZUCKERBERG4_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Other Zuckerberg', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Other Zuckerberg', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'R to Z Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zuckerberg, Mark E', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-19T22:07:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'secti