nd-instrument repertory at Alice Tully Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chamber works for wind instruments aren’t exactly rare, yet even the best of the lot turn up infrequently outside concerts mounted by dedicated wind ensembles. Among most chamber-music presenters the care and feeding of string players can seem to be paramount. Hearing any one of the four strong pieces the Chamber Music Society of Lincoln Center presented at Alice Tully Hall on Tuesday evening would have been a treat for wind fanciers; hearing them all was a feast.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/20/arts/chamber/chamber-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 839, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Putting the Winds in the Spotlight', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Putting the Winds in the Spotlight', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chamber Music Society of Lincoln Center', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-19T22:40:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steve Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/ffe5b8c9-ca87-56bc-94b3-d99884c767d0', 'word_count': 372, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ffe5b8c9-ca87-56bc-94b3-d99884c767d0'}, {'abstract': 'Eve Ashcraft helps clients experiencing paint paralysis navigate thousands of tints.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/20/garden/eve-ashcraft-the-paint-doctor-is-in.html', 'snippet': 'Eve Ashcraft helps clients experiencing paint paralysis navigate thousands of tints.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IT begins simply enough. The living room needs a new coat of paint, perhaps a fresh start for both of you. But what about something different this time? No more off-white. Maybe a color that is bold and creative, but also educated, witty and ironic.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/20/garden/20COLOR_395/20COLOR1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 804, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/20/garden/20COLOR_395/20COLOR_395-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/20/garden/20COLOR_395/20COLOR_395-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Paint Doctor Is In', 'kicker': 'Design Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Paint Doctor Is In', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ashcraft, Eve', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paint', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-19T22:40:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Penelope Green', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Penelope', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Green', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/660d72c3-394a-55d9-bb73-40b93891a3cf', 'word_count': 2662, 'uri': 'nyt://article/660d72c3-394a-55d9-bb73-40b93891a3cf'}, {'abstract': 'In an already hot election cycle, a spate of political movies has advocates and issues-oriented filmmakers looking for ways to exploit movies for electoral advantage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/20/movies/hollywood-revs-up-partisan-films-a-year-ahead-of-election.html', 'snippet': 'In an already hot election cycle, a spate of political movies has advocates and issues-oriented filmmakers looking for ways to exploit movies for electoral advantage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — At a film festival in Toronto last month, the Hollywood mogul Harvey Weinstein tried to bait Michele Bachmann, the Republican presidential contender, into joining him for an Iowa premiere of “Butter,” in which the conservative lead character looks suspiciously like a parody of Ms. Bachmann.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/20/arts/movie/movie-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/20/arts/movie/movie-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/20/arts/movie/movie-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 954, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/20/arts/movie/movie-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/20/arts/movie/movie-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Sniping of Partisans, This Time on the Screen', 'kicker': Non