tball/nba-lockout-creating-uncertainty-for-us-olympic-team.html', 'snippet': 'Mike Krzyzewski, the Team USA coach, said that if the lockout continued, it would have a significant impact on preparations for the 2012 Games.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. — If the N.B.A. lockout continues, it will have a significant impact on preparations for the 2012 Olympics, Mike Krzyzewski said Wednesday. Krzyzewski, the United States national team coach, and Jerry Colangelo, the USA Basketball chairman, have discussed the matter, he said, although the uncertainty is making it impossible to plan ahead.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'N.B.A. Lockout Creating Uncertainty for U.S. Olympic Team', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'N.B.A. Lockout Creating Uncertainty for U.S. Olympic Team', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lockouts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'USA Basketball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Krzyzewski, Mike', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-19T22:50:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Viv Bernstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Viv', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bernstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e4a572ad-0890-58a6-881c-4cd77b3542aa', 'word_count': 230, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e4a572ad-0890-58a6-881c-4cd77b3542aa'}, {'abstract': 'Classic men’s fragrances from the ’60s “left very long-lasting impacts on how people develop perfumes,” one perfumer says, and are still popular today.', 'web_url