wered the risk of recurrence over the following 10 to 15 years, researchers said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Radiation treatment after surgery for breast cancer significantly lowers the risk that the disease will recur in the breast or spread lethally to other parts of the body over the next 10 to 15 years, researchers say.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Benefit in Radiation After Breast Cancer Surgery', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Radiation Therapy After Breast Cancer Surgery Cuts Recurrence, Study Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lancet, The (Journal)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radiation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Breast Cancer', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oxford University', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-19T23:52:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'subsection_name': 'Research', 'byline': {'original': 'By Denise Grady', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Denise', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grady', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c80a8e70-baf7-54ac-be8a-8516d31599a2', 'word_count': 822, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c80a8e70-baf7-54ac-be8a-8516d31599a2'}, {'abstract': 'After 11 of the 21 rounds at the Veldhoven, the Netherlands on Wednesday, five of the six American teams are in the top eight in their event.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/20/crosswords/bridge/americans-move-on-at-world-championships-bridge.html', 'snippet': 'After 11 of the 21 rounds at the Veldhoven, the Netherlands on Wednesday, five of the six American teams are in the top eight in their event.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VELDHOVEN, the Netherlands — After 11 of the 21 rounds here Wednesday, five of the six American teams are in the top eight in their event. The last team, U.S.A-1 in the d’Orsi Senior Bowl, is ninth, only 3.5 victory points behind eighth. In each event — Venice Cup, Bermuda Bowl and d’Orsi Senior Bowl — the top eight qualify for the quarterfinals, starting Sunday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/19/arts/card1/card1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Championship Uppercut', 'kicker': 'Bridge', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Championship Uppercut', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bridge (Card Game)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cards and Card Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-19T23:53:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'subsection_name': 'Bridge', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phillip Alder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phillip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/61a6edba-a85c-5ee0-8add-c8520eabffa8', 'word_count': 386, 'uri': 'nyt://article/61a6edba-a85c-5ee0-8add-c8520eabffa8'}, {'abstract': 'Charlyne Yi and Odette Annable star as new doctors on House’s team.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/arts/100000001123417/excerpt-house.html', 'snippet': 'Charlyne Yi and Odette Annable star as new doctors on House’s team.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Charlyne Yi and Odette Annable star as new doctors on House’s team.', 'source': 'The New Yo