ealing their Social Security checks, as a participant in the crime.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/20/us/in-pennsylvania-second-woman-arrested-in-case-of-mentally-disabled-captives.html', 'snippet': 'Authorities charged the daughter of Linda Weston, the woman arrested and accused of holding four mentally disabled adults captive and stealing their Social Security checks, as a participant in the crime.', 'lead_paragraph': ' The Philadelphia District Attorney’s Office said it had charged the daughter of Linda Weston, the woman arrested and accused of holding four mentally disabled adults captive and stealing their Social Security checks, as a participant in the crime. The daughter, Jean McIntosh, 32, lived in the building where the four people were found over the weekend, and is being charged by prosecutors as a co-conspirator in the kidnapping and imprisonment. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pennsylvania: Second Woman Arrested in Case of Mentally Disabled Captives', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | MID-ATLANTIC', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pennsylvania: Second Woman Arrested In Case of Mentally Disabled Captives', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disabilities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Abuse of the Disabled', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kidnapping', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Philadelphia (Pa)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Robberies and Thefts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McIntosh, Jean', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Identity Fraud', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weston, Linda', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pennsylvania', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'S