Republicans released a video trying to use Representative Steve Israel’s support of the “Occupy Wall Street” movement against him.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/20/democrat-is-attacked-for-supporting-protesters/', 'snippet': 'Republicans released a video trying to use Representative Steve Israel’s support of the “Occupy Wall Street” movement against him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s the time of year for candy corn and horror flicks, so mistaking a new web advertisement attacking Representative Steve Israel for a film trailer about socialist zombies would be understandable.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Democrat Is Attacked for Supporting Protesters', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-20T20:14:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emmarie Huetteman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emmarie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Huetteman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/64fd8265-59c8-5deb-9963-7fb37a3a6d2e', 'word_count': 298, 'uri': 'nyt://article/64fd8265-59c8-5deb-9963-7fb37a3a6d2e'}, {'abstract': 'The videos, which Mr.  Newsome composed in collaboration with musicians, will be on view at the  Marlborough Gallery in Chelsea, where Mr. Newsome’s  show  runs,  through  Dec. 3. Or you can watch them exclusively here.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/20/swag-the-mix-tape-exclusive-video-from-rashaad-newsome/', 'snippet': 'The videos, which Mr.  Newsome composed in collaboration with musicians, will be on view at the  Marlborough Gallery in Chelsea, where Mr. Newsome’s  show  runs,  through  Dec. 3. Or you can watch them exclusively here.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For his debut solo exhibition at the Marlborough Gallery in Chelsea, “Herald,” the artist Rashaad Newsome didn’t stop with framed works. Mr. Newsome, 31, a multimedia artist whose work blends contemporary hip-hop culture with the rules and designs of centuries-old heraldry, created a series of music videos – his contemporary coats of arms come to life.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Swag the Mix Tape,’ Exclusive Video From Rashaad Newsome', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-20T20:15:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/70b7f62a-c6fc-56b3-91bf-23b59ae9a6da', 'word_count': 194, 'uri': 'nyt://article/70b7f62a-c6fc-56b3-91bf-23b59ae9a6da'}, {'abstract': 'The capture of Col. Muammar el-Qaddafi in Libya on Thursday is reminiscent of Saddam Hussein’s capture in Iraq in 2003, with one key difference: Colonel Qaddafi was killed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/africa/100000001125046/timescast--qaddafi-and-hussein.html', 'snippet': 'The capture of Col. Muammar el-Qaddafi in Libya on Thursday is reminiscent of Saddam Hussein’s capture in Iraq in 2003, with one key difference: Colonel Qaddafi was killed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The capture of Col. Muammar el-Qaddafi in Libya on Thursday is reminiscent of Saddam Hussein’s capture in Iraq in 2003, with one key difference: Colonel Qaddafi was killed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/20/world/video-tc-0111020-burns/video-tc-011102