days before Mr. Draghi is to take over as president of the European Central Bank.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/21/business/global/berlusconi-makes-surprise-pick-for-bank-of-italy.html', 'snippet': 'Ignazio Visco, currently the No. 3 official at the bank, was nominated to replace Mario Draghi as bank governor, just days before Mr. Draghi is to take over as president of the European Central Bank.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — Prime Minister Silvio Berlusconi made a surprise choice Thursday to take over as governor of the Bank of Italy next month, ending a prolonged impasse.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/21/business/Italybank/Italybank-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 708, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/21/business/Italybank/Italybank-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/21/business/Italybank/Italybank-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Appointment Ends Impasse on Bank of Italy Leadership', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Appointment Ends Impasse On Bank of Italy Leadership', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berlusconi, Silvio', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Central Bank', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Draghi, Mario', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-20T20:37:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day',