ey/islanders-top-line-earning-points-if-not-yet-nickname.html', 'snippet': 'John Tavares, along with his wingmen, P. A. Parenteau and Matt Moulson, are off to hot starts for the Islanders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'UNIONDALE, N.Y. — It would help if the Islanders’ top line had a catchy name. Then more people would take notice that not just John Tavares, but also his wingmen, P. A. Parenteau and Matt Moulson, are off to hot starts this season.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/21/sports/hockey/21islanders-pic2/21islanders-pic2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/21/sports/hockey/21islanders-pic2/21islanders-pic2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/21/sports/hockey/21islanders-pic2/21islanders-pic2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/21/sports/hockey/21islanders-pic2/21islanders-pic2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/21/sports/hockey/21islanders-pic2/21islanders-pic2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Earning Points, if Not Yet a Nickname', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Earning Points, if Not Yet a Nickname', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Islanders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tavares, John', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons