eading goal-scorer, Thierry Henry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HARRISON, N.J. — On a cool autumn night, the Red Bulls were at their most crisp and intense when anything less would have been unacceptable.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/21/sports/REDBULLS-FLOATER/REDBULLS-FLOATER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/21/sports/REDBULLS-FLOATER/REDBULLS-FLOATER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/21/sports/REDBULLS-FLOATER/REDBULLS-FLOATER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Red Bulls Bring Home Final Spot in Playoffs', 'kicker': 'Red Bulls 1, Union 0', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Red Bulls Bring Home Final Spot In Playoffs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Henry, Thierry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Philadelphia Union', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Red Bulls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-21T03:41:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Bell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0fd30bdd-02b1-57b3