costs and reviving the economy. But opponents say the environmental impact will be too great.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/22/us/puerto-ricos-plan-for-gas-pipeline-has-many-critics.html', 'snippet': 'Officials say a proposed natural gas pipeline is crucial to reducing energy costs and reviving the economy. But opponents say the environmental impact will be too great.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PORTUGUES, P.R. — It is his retirement refuge, a tiny house in the Central Mountain Chain, surrounded by banana and orange trees, coffee bushes and the melody of coquí frogs.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/22/us/22puerto-span/22puerto-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/22/us/22puerto-span/22puerto-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/22/us/22puerto-span/22puerto-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/22/us/22puerto-span/22puerto-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/22/us/22puerto-span/22puerto-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Puerto Rico’s Plan for Gas Pipeline Has Many Critics', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Puerto Rico’s Plan For Gas Pipeline Has Many Critics', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pipelines', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocation