{'abstract': 'The plug-in hybrid luxury sports sedan received the rating from the E.P.A. this week, a reflection of the vehicle’s estimated fuel economy when its gasoline generator was engaged.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/21/the-fisker-karmas-20-m-p-g-conundrum/', 'snippet': 'The plug-in hybrid luxury sports sedan received the rating from the E.P.A. this week, a reflection of the vehicle’s estimated fuel economy when its gasoline generator was engaged.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With its range-extender gasoline engine engaged, the Fisker Karma plug-in hybrid was rated this week by the Environmental Protection Agency at just 20 miles per gallon. The E.P.A. figure was first reported by the blog GreenCarReports.com.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Fisker Karma’s 20 M.P.G. Sticker: A Scarlet Letter?', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric and Hybrid Vehicles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'California Air Resources Board', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Energy Department', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Environmental Protection Agency', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fisker Automotive', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nissan Motor Co', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Solyndra Inc', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-21T14:57:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Motavalli', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Motavalli', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organizati