sterity class.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I visited Zuccotti Park yesterday. Michael Moore gave a short speech, transmitted by the human microphone. I gather that right-wingers are claiming that OWS is anti-Semitic; someone forgot to tell the excellent Klezmer band.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trying To Unwarp The Debate', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-21T15:08:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3192b608-5784-587c-85df-660d6d9366a9', 'word_count': 420, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3192b608-5784-587c-85df-660d6d9366a9'}, {'abstract': 'The Association of National Advertisers is looking to set another record for attendance at its annual conference.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/21/full-house-for-annual-advertisers-conference/', 'snippet': 'The Association of National Advertisers is looking to set another record for attendance at its annual conference.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Association of National Advertisers, whose members are the chief marketers of the nation’s leading companies, is looking to set another record for attendance at its annual conference.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Full House for Annual Advertisers Conference', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Assn of National Advertisers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N