arel prices, which fell rapidly early in this century and then stabilized, have begun to rise. The top two charts show consumer prices for apparel compared with late-1991 levels, and annual changes in the index. The fall in prices came as the balance of payments deficit became extremely large, as shown in the bottom chart.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2011/10/21/business/economy/Off-the-Charts-In-Apparel-Inflation-Is-Back.html', 'snippet': 'American apparel prices, which fell rapidly early in this century and then stabilized, have begun to rise. The top two charts show consumer prices for apparel compared with late-1991 levels, and annual changes in the index. The fall in prices came...', 'lead_paragraph': 'American apparel prices, which fell rapidly early in this century and then stabilized, have begun to rise. The top two charts show consumer prices for apparel compared with late-1991 levels, and annual changes in the index. The fall in prices came as the balance of payments deficit became extremely large, as shown in the bottom chart.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Off the Charts: In Apparel, Inflation Is Back', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-21T16:29:44+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Business Day', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/ccc84111-fcde-5a3f-a861-db610bbef55b', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/ccc84111-fcde-5a3f-a861-db610bbef55b'}, {'abstract': 'Apparel prices, which fell in the last 10 years and then stabilized, have begun to increase.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/22/business/signs-that-the-era-of-cheap-chinese-imports-is-ending.html', 'snippet': 'Apparel prices, which fell in