e learned. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/22/your-money/401ks-and-similar-plans/22money/22money-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/22/your-money/401ks-and-similar-plans/22money/22money-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/22/your-money/401ks-and-similar-plans/22money/22money-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Retirement Funds Built for Skittish Times', 'kicker': 'Your Money', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Retirement Funds Built for Skittish Times', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': '401(k), 403(b) and 457 Plans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pensions and Retirement Plans', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Retirement', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'PIMCO (Pacific Investment Management Company)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-21T18:26:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'subsection_name': "401(k)'s and Similar Plans", 'byline': {'original': 'By Ron Lieber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lieber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1de619e-da4b-5ded-9d71-bf362b41e93b', 'word_count': 1473, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1de619e-da4b-5ded-9d71-bf362b41e93b'}, {'abstract': 'You might expect that someone who spends his time watching, writing about, living and breathing theater 52 weeks a year would prefer to turn to other subjects when it comes to the pastime of leisure reading', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/21/theater-talkback-i-could-read-a-book/', 'snippet': 'You might expect that someone who spends his time watching, writing about, living and breathing theater 52 weeks a year would prefer to turn to other subjects when it comes to the pastime of leisure reading', 'lead_paragraph': 'You might expect that someone who spends his time watching, writing about, living and breathing theater 52 weeks a year would prefer to turn to other subjects when it comes to the pastime of leisure reading. Perhaps some molecular biology? And it’s true that for sheer diversion, or post-season recovery, I do try to avoid books that feel like homework. My new discovery – and obsession – is the British writer Angela Thirkell, who wrote more than a dozen frothy light comedies about English country life, many set in Anthony Trollope’s fictional Barsetshire.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Theater Talkback: I Could Read a Book', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-21T18:29:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charles Isherwood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charles', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Isherwood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3d1099ef-8638-57de-8ab8-6ae93d8edb95', 'word_count': 774, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3d1099ef-8638-57de-8ab8-6ae93d8edb95'}, {'abstract': 'The actress is electric in a zebra and citrus look by Proenza Schouler.', 'web_url': 'https://