ina Kohler, in “the One,” a dance production about love from a female perspective.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Judging by her new work, which explores what it means to be a woman in love — its cheeky title is simply “the One” — it just wouldn’t do to describe Lyndsey Karr as the romantic type. As a pair of women, more often naked than not, takes the audience on a trip to three sites within the Chocolate Factory, Ms. Karr, with deadpan whimsy, both demonstrates and ridicules archetypes of the besotted. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Women in Love, Leaping Into Elevator Shafts', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Women in Love, Leaping Into Elevator Shafts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-22T02:04:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gia Kourlas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kourlas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/716a4a22-208d-5f20-913a-07eb8cde391c', 'word_count': 413, 'uri': 'nyt://article/716a4a22-208d-5f20-913a-07eb8cde391c'}, {'abstract': 'Since being signed by the Jets for a second time late last month, Aaron Maybin has forced three fumbles in the last games.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/22/sports/football/given-second-chance-jets-linebacker-maybin-thrives.html', 'snippet': 'Since being signed by the Jets for a second time late last month, Aaron Maybin has forced three fumbles in the last games.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLORHAM PARK, N.J. — Twenty-four days after the Jets cut him, Aaron Maybin returned to the team Sept. 28 as pretty much the same player: a relentless and boisterous pass-rushing outside