istakes in France, Greece, Japan and Zimbabwe could presage a sad future for the United States economy — if we’re not careful.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/23/business/financial-lessons-from-four-nations.html', 'snippet': 'Recent financial mistakes in France, Greece, Japan and Zimbabwe could presage a sad future for the United States economy — if we’re not careful.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AS the economy languishes, politicians and pundits are debating what to do next. When we look around the world, it’s hard to find positive role models. But as we search for answers, it is useful to keep in mind those fates that we would like to avoid. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/23/business/23-VIEW/23-VIEW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 741, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Four Nations, Four Lessons', 'kicker': 'Economic View', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Four Nations, Four Lessons', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bernanke, Ben S', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greece', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Japan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Zimbabwe', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-22T15:49:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NAT', 'section_name': 'Busine