major-league play. The results included robust numbers on the mound and a decrease in home runs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TOKYO — Unlike Major League Baseball, for whom Rawlings has been the official supplier of baseballs since 1977, Japan’s top league has long used multiple manufacturers.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/23/sports/YJAPANBALL/YJAPANBALL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/23/sports/YJAPANBALL/YJAPANBALL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/23/sports/YJAPANBALL/YJAPANBALL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/23/sports/YJAPANBALL/YJAPANBALL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/23/sports/YJAPANBALL/YJAPANBALL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Japan’s Standardized Baseballs Are Popular With Pitchers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Japan, One Ball, Many Ramifications', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Japan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sporting Goods', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-22T19:09:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brad Lefton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lefton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dddfaab3-eb6e-5fb8-ac92-3fac94402da0', 'word_count': 1110, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dddfaab3-eb6e-5fb8-ac92-3fac94402da0'}, {'abstract': 'A victory in the giant slalom makes Vonn one of only five women to win a race in each of the five World Cup disciplines.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/23/sports/skiing/lindsey-vonn-wins-giant-slalom-and-completes-sweep.html', 'snippet': 'A victory in the giant slalom makes Vonn one of only five women to win a race in each of the five World Cup disciplines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For all the races, titles and medals Lindsey Vonn has won in her ski racing career, she had never won a World Cup giant slalom. But with a daring and aggressive finish Saturday in Sölden, Austria, Vonn won the season-opening giant slalom and became the fifth woman to win a race in all five World Cup disciplines.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/23/sports/VONN/VONN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 621, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/23/sports/VONN/VONN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/23/sports/VONN/VONN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lindsey Vonn Wins Giant Slalom and Completes Sweep', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Vonn Now A Winner In Every Aspect', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value'