8-5a47-bfad-fe5739c7bfcd'}, {'abstract': 'A plague of mice has attracted migrating California owls, forcing the government to consider eradication methods.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/23/us/voracious-mice-scramble-food-chain-on-farallon-islands.html', 'snippet': 'A plague of mice has attracted migrating California owls, forcing the government to consider eradication methods.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Winter after winter, burrowing owls have been overstaying their traditional migratory visit to the storm-swept Farallon Islands, dining on the petrels that have returned to breed. The attacks have taken a heavy toll on the petrels, a native bird that breeds slowly on the small, rocky islands.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/23/us/23BCMICE_span/23BCMICE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/23/us/23BCMICE_span/23BCMICE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/23/us/23BCMICE_span/23BCMICE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 602, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/23/us/23BCMICE_span/23BCMICE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/23/us/23BCMICE_span/23BCMICE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Voracious Mice Scramble Food Chain on California’s Farallon Islands', 'kicker': 'The Bay Citizen', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'On the Farallon Islands, Hungry Mice Scramble a Food Chain', 'n