.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/24/us/personal-eco-concierges-ease-challenges-of-going-green.html', 'snippet': 'More personal environmental concierges have sprung up in recent years to help time-starved consumers find eco-friendly services.', 'lead_paragraph': 'They will run your errands by bicycle, recommend a spa that gives vegan manicures or buy organic clothes for you and your dog. They will even book you a dream vacation and buy the appropriate carbon offsets. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/23/us/CONCIEGE-1/CONCIEGE-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/23/us/CONCIEGE-1/CONCIEGE-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/23/us/CONCIEGE-1/CONCIEGE-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 702, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/23/us/CONCIEGE-1/CONCIEGE-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/23/us/CONCIEGE-1/CONCIEGE-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Personal Eco-Concierges Ease Transition to Green', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Personal Eco-Concierges Ease Transition to Green', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sustainable Living', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Eco-Concierge NYC', 'rank': 3, 'major