n point-afters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Brian Robison’s cheap shot on Packers guard T.J. Lang on Sunday exposed two flaws in the N.F.L. rule book.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Robison’s Cheap Shot Requires a Rethinking of the Rules', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-24T10:00:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andy Benoit', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Benoit', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/468f4035-f2d6-52cc-8e26-8d03e8f3b797', 'word_count': 244, 'uri': 'nyt://article/468f4035-f2d6-52cc-8e26-8d03e8f3b797'}, {'abstract': 'What have you learned from journeys you’ve taken?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/24/what-journey-do-you-most-want-to-make/', 'snippet': 'What have you learned from journeys you’ve taken?', 'lead_paragraph': '“It’s not the destination–it’s the journey.” We’ve probably all heard this before. What does it mean to you? There are literal journeys, like road trips or hikes, but there are other kinds, too, like learning and then mastering a skill, or doing in-depth research about something. What are your journeys? What did they teach you about yourself?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Journey Do You Most Want to Make?', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-24T10:09:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By 