}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/730eede9-0e28-5f29-8d8c-d35d074196b1', 'word_count': 372, 'uri': 'nyt://article/730eede9-0e28-5f29-8d8c-d35d074196b1'}, {'abstract': 'A smartphone application called I’m Getting Arrested allows a person to send mass text messages moments before the handcuffs go on.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/24/occupywallst-roundup-day-38/', 'snippet': 'A smartphone application called I’m Getting Arrested allows a person to send mass text messages moments before the handcuffs go on.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s an app for … getting arrested. A software developer named Jason Van Anden created I’m Getting Arrested, a smartphone application that allows you to send mass text messages before your hands go into cuffs. [Brooklyn Paper]', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '#OccupyWallSt Roundup, Day 38', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Occupy Wall Street', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Zuccotti Park (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-24T16:24:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jillian Dunham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jillian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dunham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/03f69cc0-3fa0-5139-b227-85c02fcb0c9e', 'word_count': 327, 'uri': 'nyt://article/03f69cc0-3fa0-5139-b227-85c02fcb0c9e'}, {'abstract': 'Whether they add heft to a salad, top a deep green bruschetta or play a starring role supported by a zesty tomato sauce, poached eggs are an easy and satisfying way to dine solo.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/24/health/nutrition/24recipehealth.html', 'snippet': 'Whether they add heft to a salad, top a deep green bruschetta or play a starring role supported by a zesty tomato sauce, poached eggs are an easy and satisfying way to dine solo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dinner for one can be a conundrum. If you never know when you’re going to be home it’s difficult to plan. If you’ve been cooking for a family for years and now your children are out of the house, you may be flummoxed by the idea of preparing a meal for just one person. Or say you’re divorced, and some nights your children are with their other parent. How do you plan a dinner for yourself?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/25/science/24recipehealth/24recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/25/science/24recipehealth/24recipehealth-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/25/science/24recipehealth/24recipehealth-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/25/science/24recipehealth/24recipehealth-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/25/science/24recipehealth/24recipehealth-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/25/science/24recipehealth/24recipehealth-thumbStandard-v2.jp