e fulfilled, for Ambassador James Jeffrey it was an encouraging sign, for the Iraqi politician Ahmad Chalabi it was expected.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAGHDAD — In the years before coming to Iraq to cover the American withdrawal, I was a sports reporter and several times covered games in which players, managers and coaches experienced stunning defeats.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Iraq, Diplomatic Perspectives on a Deal Not Made', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chalabi, Ahmad', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jeffrey, James F', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pollack, Kenneth M', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Iraqi National Alliance', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Department', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-24T17:14:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael S. Schmidt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'S.', 'lastname': 'Schmidt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8767116-db82-57a5-849f-57abc3ea53e7', 'word_count': 963, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8767116-db82-57a5-849f-57abc3ea53e7'}, {'abstract': 'An e-book weighs something in principle, but the amount is effectively unmeasurable, a computer science professor says.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nyti