he New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Viewers Embrace ABC’s ‘Once Upon a Time’', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fairy Tales', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC INC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Walt Disney Company', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-24T17:40:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/85fc1a9f-3df6-573f-8a4e-16e49e97adef', 'word_count': 336, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85fc1a9f-3df6-573f-8a4e-16e49e97adef'}, {'abstract': 'Two critics from The Times pick some promising shows at Performa 11, the visual art performance biennial.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/22/arts/whats-performing-at-performa.html', 'snippet': 'Two critics from The Times pick some promising shows at Performa 11, the visual art performance biennial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even online, Performa 11, the visual art performance biennial, overwhelms. When a festival gets this absurdly overgrown, it no longer makes sense to try to see it all so as to understand its larger themes or curatorial arc — leave that Sisyphean task to the critics (God help us). The better strategy: cherry-pick wisely. Here, Karen Rosenberg and I offer a few promising possibilities for the festival, which runs from Nov. 1 through 21.  — Claudia La Rocco', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s Performing at Performa', 'kicker': None, 'co