nyt://audio/f64e2860-6555-5ac8-9228-7fdb30c55ab2'}, {'abstract': 'A former economic adviser to Vice President Joe Biden says small businesses don’t really create most new jobs.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/24/a-challenge-to-conventional-wisdom-on-small-business-and-jobs/', 'snippet': 'A former economic adviser to Vice President Joe Biden says small businesses don’t really create most new jobs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jared Bernstein, who was until May Vice President Joe Biden’s top economic adviser, published an article on the Op-Ed page of Monday’s Times that challenges much of the orthodoxy about small business in the United States. He argues that small businesses really don’t employ the majority of Americans, and that they don’t create the majority of new jobs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Challenge to Conventional Wisdom on Small Business and Jobs', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-24T21:06:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By ROBB MANDELBAUM', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MANDELBAUM', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/63889fb5-0c05-5651-8e8f-8e2b38adde28', 'word_count': 253, 'uri': 'nyt://article/63889fb5-0c05-5651-8e8f-8e2b38adde28'}, {'abstract': 'As progress was being made on political reforms, violence began to spike in the country’s largely Kurdish southeast.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/25/world/europe/clashes-with-kurdish-rebels-push-turkey-back-toward-conflict.html', 'snippet': 'As progress was being made on political reforms, violence began to spike in the country’s largel