'A look at the day’s news across India from the country’s press.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Economists and policy makers predict the Reserve Bank of India “may choose to hold back from raising policy rates further” when it meets Tuesday to review monetary policy, given the weakening investment climate (Financial Express). The consensus among analysts is toward a shift in stance by the central bank, with a growing emphasis on the “downside risks to growth” (Business Standard).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Newswallah: In the English-Language Press Tuesday', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-25T04:44:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neha Thirani', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thirani', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a0eecbae-39c9-5a6f-8b4f-0c23f5afdcb5', 'word_count': 265, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a0eecbae-39c9-5a6f-8b4f-0c23f5afdcb5'}, {'abstract': 'Mike Napoli’s two-run double in the eighth broke a 2-2 tie and sent the Rangers to a 4-2 victory over the Cardinals in Game 5.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2011/10/25/sports/25series_ss.html', 'snippet': 'Mike Napoli’s two-run double in the eighth broke a 2-2 tie and sent the Rangers to a 4-2 victory over the Cardinals in Game 5.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mike Napoli’s two-run double in the eighth broke a 2-2 tie and sent the Rangers to a 4-2 victory over the Cardinals in Game 5.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/25/sports/25series_ss-slide-NMH8/25series_ss-slide-NMH8-jumbo.j