ame to my own MTV viewing habits, I was always a minimalist – give me a concert clip, or even a bit of straight-on lip syncing to a good song, like this clip of Stevie Nicks and Tom Petty trading verses on the indelible “Stop Draggin’ My Heart Around.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'MTV Basics: Top Minimalist Videos', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klosterman, Chuck', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nicks, Stevie', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Petty, Tom', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MTV Networks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'YouTube.com', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-25T16:00:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dwight Garner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dwight', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Garner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e4ac735c-82f3-51c7-88f1-24bae0fbdde6', 'word_count': 140, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e4ac735c-82f3-51c7-88f1-24bae0fbdde6'}, {'abstract': 'Presidential candidate Rick Perry sat down with John Harwood of The New York Times and CNBC to discuss his plan for a 20 percent flat rate on individual and corporate income.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/politics/100000001132937/john-harwood-interviews-rick-perry.html', 'snippet': 'Presidential candidate Rick Perry sat down with John Harwood of The New York Times and CNBC to discuss his plan for a 20 percent flat rate on individual and corporate income.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Presidential candidate Rick Perry sat down with John Ha