nardo da Vinci had no extraordinary powers, other than a first-class intellect, unparalleled artistic skills and the ability to make millions of dollars for Dan Brown a few centuries down the road. But to the Starz cable channel Leonardo is enough of a champion to feature in a new series that was announced on Tuesday and which is being created for the channel by a writer with some serious superhero credentials.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hero of New Starz Series Is Leonardo da Vinci, International Man of Mystery', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cable Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'da Vinci, Leonardo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Goyer, David S', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'British Broadcasting Corp', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Starz', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-25T18:14:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ae7f3b2-4fe2-5bd5-98c5-b6a5d6972788', 'word_count': 307, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ae7f3b2-4fe2-5bd5-98c5-b6a5d6972788'}, {'abstract': 'Transcripts and documents depict Saddam Hussein as a leader who harbored grand ambitions for his country but was prone to epic miscalculations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/26/world/middleeast/archive-offers-rare-glimpse-inside-mind-of-saddam-hussein.html', 'snippet': 'Transcripts and documents depict Saddam Hussein as a leader who harbored grand ambitions for his country but was prone to epic miscalculations.', 'lead_paragraph': '\xa0WASHINGTON — On Nov. 15, 1986, Saddam Hussein gathered his most senior aides for an important strategy session.\xa0Two days earlier, President Ronald Reagan had acknowledged in a televised address that his administration had sent weapons and spare parts to Iran. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/26/world/SADDAM/SADDAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/26/world/SADDAM/SADDAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/26/world/SADDAM/SADDAM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/26/world/SADDAM/SADDAM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/26/world/SADDAM/SADDAM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Papers From Iraqi Archive Reveal Conspiratorial Mind-Set of Hussein', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Papers From Iraqi Archive Reveal Conspiratorial Mind-Set of Hussein', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hussein, Saddam', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject'