ruising response to the financial results the company released late Monday, the Internet movie company lost more than $2 billion in value, bringing its total market capitalization to just over $4 billion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Netflix Market Value Shrivels', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hastings, Reed', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Netflix Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-25T20:00:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Wingfield', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wingfield', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2947d017-07c8-5b12-810d-f5c0864f0189', 'word_count': 299, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2947d017-07c8-5b12-810d-f5c0864f0189'}, {'abstract': "New York City police officers are arrested for smuggling guns; European Union finance ministers abruptly cancel their meeting; and the Op-Ed columnist Nicholas D. Kristof on Tunisia's Islamic party.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/multimedia/100000001133491/timescast-october-25-2011.html', 'snippet': "New York City police officers are arrested for smuggling guns; European Union finance ministers abruptly cancel their meeting; and the Op-Ed columnist Nicholas D. Kristof on Tunisia's Islamic party.", 'lead_paragraph': "New York City police officers are arrested for smuggling guns; European Union finance ministers abruptly cancel their meeting; and the Op-Ed columnist Nicholas D. Kristof on Tunisia's Islamic party.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype':