k is proved wrong by the numbers this season in M.L.S.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fox Soccer analyst Warren Barton shared a peculiar thought on air last February shortly after Everton had ousted Chelsea from the F.A. Cup on penalties at Stamford Bridge.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Left-Footed Penalty Takers Showing the Way in M.L.S.', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Major League Soccer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-26T00:13:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian Thomson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thomson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/678d0718-c0ef-54f5-886f-4aa5f078b036', 'word_count': 656, 'uri': 'nyt://article/678d0718-c0ef-54f5-886f-4aa5f078b036'}, {'abstract': 'Sprint wants to have its own say in court regarding an AT&T/T-Mobile merger.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/26/business/sprints-hand-in-antitrust-suit.html', 'snippet': 'Sprint wants to have its own say in court regarding an AT&T/T-Mobile merger.', 'lead_paragraph': '\xa0', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/26/business/Views/Views-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 974, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sprint’s Hand in Antitrust Suit', 'kicker': 'Reuters Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sprint’s Hand In Antitrust Suit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'su