de over the past 100 years. On Thursday, it will rise even higher, because of a king tide.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/26/nyregion/king-tide-to-raise-sea-level-on-atlantic-coast.html', 'snippet': 'The sea level around New York has been rising about an inch per decade over the past 100 years. On Thursday, it will rise even higher, because of a king tide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From his window in Broad Channel, Queens, Dan Mundy sees the tides of Jamaica Bay swing from high to low, the pendulum of a celestial clock. “Right now, 10 after 1 in the afternoon, it is 25 minutes from dead-low tide,” he said on Tuesday. “It’s much lower now than it would usually be. The mud flats are bigger.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/26/nyregion/ABOUT/ABOUT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/26/nyregion/ABOUT/ABOUT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/26/nyregion/ABOUT/ABOUT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/26/nyregion/ABOUT/ABOUT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/26/nyregion/ABOUT/ABOUT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Sky-High Tide, This Time Fleeting, but Perhaps a Glimpse of Torrents to Come', 'kicker': 'About New York', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Sky-High Tide, This Time Fleeting, but Perhaps a Glimpse of Torrents to Come', 