/middleeast/libya-leader-wants-nato-presence-through-2011.html', 'snippet': 'A request for an extension of NATO help suggested Libya’s interim government is concerned that remnants of Colonel Muammar el-Qaddafi’s defeated forces could regroup and cause new trouble.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TRIPOLI, Libya — Libya’s interim leader said Wednesday that he had asked NATO to prolong its air patrols through December and add military advisers on the ground, despite his official declaration on Sunday of the country’s liberation after the killing of Col. Muammar el-Qaddafi.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/world/27LIBYA/27LIBYA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/27/world/27LIBYA/27LIBYA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/world/27LIBYA/27LIBYA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/world/27LIBYA/27LIBYA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/27/world/27LIBYA/27LIBYA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Libya’s Interim Leader Asks NATO to Stay Through the End of 2011', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Libya’s Interim Leader Asks NATO to Stay Through the End of 2011', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jibril, Mahmoud', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and Nor