tory-eludes-chaz-bono-but-not-fame/', 'snippet': 'The Gay and Lesbian Alliance Against Defamation calls him “the world’s most well-known transgender person.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Tuesday night, at about the halfway point in the current season of ABC’s “Dancing With the Stars,” the judges and viewers voted to eliminate Chaz Bono. But not before he had become, as one gay rights media advocacy group put it, “the world’s most well-known transgender person.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Victory Eludes Chaz Bono, but Not Fame', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transgender and Transsexual', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ablow, Keith', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bono, Chaz', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC INC', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Gay and Lesbian Alliance Against Defamation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-26T18:20:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a2e5b7db-e092-5a08-9045-bb9b29fc7708', 'word_count': 202, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a2e5b7db-e092-5a08-9045-bb9b29fc7708'}, {'abstract': 'Someday I’ll wish upon a star and wake up where the slump is far behind me.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/26/nice-try/', 'snippet': 'Someday I’ll wish upon a star and wake up where the slump is far behind me.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mother Nature is trying to turn me into an opti