atchups.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Overview | How do we measure individual and team success in sports? How can we use multiple factors to project future performance? In this lesson, students use statistical analyses and quantitative evaluations to get the edge in fantasy football. By looking at data, measuring matchups and making projections, students put their analytic skills to the test in fantasy sports competitions. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Put Me In, Coach! Getting in the Quantitative Game with Fantasy Football', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-26T19:33:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Honner and Holly Epstein Ojalvo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Honner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Holly', 'middlename': 'Epstein', 'lastname': 'Ojalvo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e2d20b8d-6aec-5c97-b8f5-9f661763f916', 'word_count': 1356, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e2d20b8d-6aec-5c97-b8f5-9f661763f916'}, {'abstract': 'The Rangers, who have  a 3-2 series lead, can clinch the title on Thursday night in St. Louis, with a possible Game 7 set for Friday night there.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/26/game-6-postponed-by-inclement-weather/', 'snippet': 'The Rangers, who have  a 3-2 series lead, can clinch the title on Thursday night in St. Louis, with a possible Game 7 set for Friday night there.', 'lead_paragraph': '6:19 p.m. | Updated ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '