onied feel in the meatpacking district.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/27/fashion/double-seven-a-bar-in-the-meatpacking-district-nyc-review.html', 'snippet': 'The Double Seven is a black-lacquered bar with a soigné, monied feel in the meatpacking district.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IS the stiletto-barbed meatpacking district ready to grow up and evolve from shrill to chill? That’s a premise behind the Double Seven, a reincarnation of the popular bar that sat on West 14th Street from 2005 to 2007. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/fashion/27BOITE/27BOITE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 684, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/fashion/27BOITE/27BOITE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/27/fashion/27BOITE/27BOITE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Double Seven', 'kicker': 'Boîte', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Double Seven: Meatpacking District', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Double Seven', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'NIGHTCLUBS AND CABARETS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-26T22:22:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_i