 former City Ballet principal Lourdes Lopez, is back, with the resident artistic director Luca Veggetti.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The story has been told a few times now, but it bears repeating: Four years ago the choreographer Christopher Wheeldon struck out on his own, leaving the safety net of the New York City Ballet, where he was resident choreographer. With the former City Ballet principal Lourdes Lopez he created Morphoses/The Wheeldon Company, which was intended to be a dynamic home for artistic collaborations. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/arts/morphoses/morphoses-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 614, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/arts/morphoses/morphoses-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/27/arts/morphoses/morphoses-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sketching Out Euripides and Mother-Son Dynamic', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sketching Out Euripides And Mother-Son Dynamic', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Morphoses/The Wheeldon Co', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lopez, Lourdes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Veggetti, Luca', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T00:12:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gia Kourlas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gia', 'middlename': None,