luenced by what I see on the runways,” she said.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27FURNITURE/27CURR4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 791, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27FURNITURE/27CURR4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27FURNITURE/27CURR4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pieces Inspired by the Runway', 'kicker': 'Currents | Furniture', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Inspired by the Runway', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Furniture', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Frey, Tina', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T00:35:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rima Suqi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rima', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Suqi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3157deff-f550-569e-aa89-e13c41612229', 'word_count': 133, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3157deff-f550-569e-aa89-e13c41612229'}, {'abstract': 'Discounts on furniture and accessories, antiques and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/27/garden/sales-at-buck-house-jensen-lewis-and-others-deals.html', 'snippet': 'Discounts on furniture and accessories, antiques and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Buck House is taking 25 percent off all furniture and accessories Thursday, from 5 to 8 p.m. (a 1950s Italian brass and marble occasional table, originally $1,600, is $1,200); 1318 Madison Avenue (93rd Street), (212) 828-3123 or buckhouse.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27DEALS/27CURR5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 902, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27DEALS/27CURR5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27DEALS/27CURR5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sales at Buck House, Jensen-Lewis and Others', 'kicker': 'Currents | Deals', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Recliners, Pottery and More', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T00:35:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rima Suqi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rima', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Suqi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/8076e382-417b-5e62-937c-e8d0a1d64224', 'word_count': 225, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8076e382-417b-5e62-937c-e8d0a1d64224'}, {'abstract': 'Hipcycle.com is aiming to become “the Amazon of upcycled products.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/27/garden/online-big-retail-plans-for-hipcycle.html', 'snippet': 'Hipcycle.com is aiming to become “the Amazon of upcycled products.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andrew Sell, pictured, who recently started Hipcycle.com, said his ambition is for it to become “the Amazon of upcycled products.” If Hipcycle doesn’t yet have the sales or range of products of the online retail giant, its merchandise is at least more novel.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27ONLINE_SPAN/27CURR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27ONLINE_SPAN/27CURR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27ONLINE_SPAN/27CURR1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27ONLINE_SPAN/27ONLINE_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27ONLINE_SPAN/27ONLINE_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hipcycle, a Place for Repurposed Goods', 'kicker': 'Currents | Online', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Place for Repurposed Goods', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Commerce', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sustainable Living', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sell, Andrew', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hipcycle LLC', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T00:35:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By STEVEN&ensp;KURUTZ', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ba6373b6-5b33-5e6e-9cb7-8538700518e6', 'word_count': 217, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ba6373b6-5b33-5e6e-9cb7-8538700518e6'}, {'abstract': 'LanceWoven, a furniture and accessories company, has introduced a line of woven leather pillows, benches, rugs and tote bags.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/27/garden/lancewovens-americana-italian-style.html', 'snippet': 'LanceWoven, a furniture and accessories company, has introduced a line of woven leather pillows, benches, rugs and tote bags.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The idea behind Lance was the merging of two cultures,” said Stefano Bruni, an Italian native who started the furniture and accessories company with his American fiancée, Anne Arnold, earlier this year. “Americans have powerful symbols that Italians love, like a flannel shirt, a Hudson Bay blanket, a pair of jeans. These are age-old American traditions that inspired our line.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27GOODS/27CURR3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 554, 'width': 646, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27GOODS/27CURR3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27GOODS/27CURR3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Americana, Italian Style', 'kicker': 'Currents | Goods', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Americana, Italian Style', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 