t\xa0 “constructions” were a little house, a wagon and some shelves he made with orange crates and a curved-claw hammer. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27CARPENTER2_SPAN/27CARPENTER2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 361, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27CARPENTER2_SPAN/27CARPENTER2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 361}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27CARPENTER2_SPAN/27CARPENTER2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 616, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27CARPENTER2_SPAN/27CARPENTER2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/27/garden/27CARPENTER2_SPAN/27CARPENTER2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Carpenter’s Carpenter', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'His Houses Tell His Story', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Haun, Larry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Building (Construction)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T00:35:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Penelope Green', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Penelope', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Green', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'org