e end of that arm. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/nyregion/BELL/BELL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 689, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/27/nyregion/BELL/BELL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/27/nyregion/BELL/BELL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Detective Tells of Fatal Shots Fired at Car', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Detective Tells Of Fatal Shots Fired at Car', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Isnora, Gescard F', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality and Misconduct', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bell, Sean', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T01:14:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joseph Goldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joseph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2dc4153-f0ba-5232-a37b-65c4225fd278', 'word_count': 742, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2dc4153-f0ba-5232-a37b-65c4225fd278'}, {'abstract': 'Other American financial firms have worried over Europe’s debt, but MF Global, run by Jon Corzine, is showing signs of facing a full pani