ub from Valencia to score another big victory, 3-2 against Real Sociedad.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/27/sports/soccer/little-team-back-on-top-in-spain.html', 'snippet': 'Levante vaulted back into the top spot Wednesday courtesy of a goal by Ruben Suárez in injury time that enabled the small club from Valencia to score another big victory, 3-2 against Real Sociedad.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After spending fewer than 24 hours in second place in the Spanish league following Barcelona’s 1-0 win at Granada on Tuesday, Levante vaulted back into the top spot Wednesday courtesy of a goal by Ruben Suárez in injury time that enabled the small club from Valencia to score another big victory, 3-2 against Real Sociedad. It was Levante’s seventh consecutive win. Real Madrid jumped over Barcelona and into second place on the strength of its 3-0 win against visiting Villarreal. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Little Team Back on Top in Spain', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Soccer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Little Team Back on Top in Spain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Barcelona (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Real Madrid (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T03:05:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Bell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/fb7e6dc4-6bd0-5c0f-b193-d486e2a03697', 'word_count': 195, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb7e6dc4-6bd0-5c0f-b193-d486e2a03697'}, {'abstract': 'In his campaign’s first televisio