://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/27/on-halloween-weekend-exploring-londons-scary-side/', 'snippet': 'A cornucopia of events in London around Halloween celebrate the macabre.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s more to the dark side of the English capital’s history than that of the Tower of London. Around Halloween the city will come alive (so to speak) with the dead, as ghosts, ghouls and witches take to the streets for a weekend of spine-chilling revelries, from Oct. 29 to 31.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On Halloween Weekend, Exploring London’s Scary Side', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ghosts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Halloween', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T10:00:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claudia Barbieri', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Claudia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barbieri', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/652c26f6-0130-5ce7-b4c3-521a1b614743', 'word_count': 275, 'uri': 'nyt://article/652c26f6-0130-5ce7-b4c3-521a1b614743'}, {'abstract': 'The intangibles of football cannot be measured, but they often are reflected in statistics.', 'web_url': 'https://fifthdown.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/27/n-f-l-week-8-game-probabilities-intangibles-are-baked-in/', 'snippet': 'The intangibles of football cannot be measured, but they often are reflected in statistics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Brian Burke, a former Navy pilot who has taken up the less dangerous hobby of N.F.L. statistical analysis,