ce’s decorator du jour, a designer of perfectly imperfect interiors as well as seriously sleek home décor (go to sarahlavoine.com). Her Paris crib, high above the Tuileries, is an art-filled nest feathered for her children, Yasmine, Roman and Milo, and her husband, the French pop star Marc Lavoine. “Andrée Putman and Charlotte Perriand are sources of inspiration,” says the designer, an unmistakable A-list partygoer. “I’m the one in the pavé Balmain mini.” See more …', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Profile in Style | Sarah Lavoine', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perriand, Charlotte', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putnam, Andree', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T16:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Petkanas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Petkanas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2b1c18a-8e75-50cd-8900-086e845a2f2e', 'word_count': 85, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2b1c18a-8e75-50cd-8900-086e845a2f2e'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Heide’s prose and poetry, which included books for girls adjusting to adolescence, mysteries and sports stories, were often enhanced with drawings by famed illustrators.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/28/arts/florence-parry-heide-childrens-writer-and-poet-dies-at-92.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Heide’s prose and poetry, which included books for girls adjusting to adolescence, mysteries and sports stories, were often enhanced with drawings by famed illustrators.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Florence Parry Heide, who wrote dozens of books of prose and poetry for children — often enhanced with drawings by famed illustrators — that enthralled the youngest readers (and those who read to them), has died at her home in Kenosha, Wis. She was 92.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/28/sports/28Heide/28Heide-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 853, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/28/sports/28Heide/28Heide-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/28/sports/28Heide/28Heide-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Florence Parry Heide, Children’s Writer and Poet, Dies at 92', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Florence Parry Heide, Children&#8217;s Writer and Poet, Dies at 92', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poetry and Poets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T16:02:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Weber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/7a286ad7-1ba2-5d62-883b-dca1e7c49646', 'word_count': 653, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7a286ad7-1ba2-5d62-883b-dca1e7c49646'}, {'abstract': 'The automaker sai