ure of what talks with North Korea would accomplish despite more positive public comments from negotiators earlier this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/28/world/asia/panetta-voices-skepticism-on-north-korea-talks.html', 'snippet': 'United States Defense Secretary Leon E. Panetta said that he was unsure of what talks with North Korea would accomplish despite more positive public comments from negotiators earlier this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEOUL, South Korea — Defense Secretary Leon E. Panetta cast doubt on Thursday on talks aimed at persuading North Korea to abandon its nuclear program despite more positive public comments from negotiators for both countries earlier this week.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'North Korea Is Talking, but Panetta Is Skeptical', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'North Korea Is Talking, But Panetta Is Skeptical', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Panetta, Leon E', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bosworth, Stephen W', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Korea', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Korea', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T16:03:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabeth Bumiller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabeth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bumiller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None},