disclosure of a student’s behavioral or criminal infractions.', 'web_url': 'https://thechoice.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/27/infractions/', 'snippet': 'A panel on Thursday at the College Board conference in New York City emphasized the importance of honest and full disclosure of a student’s behavioral or criminal infractions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For those students worried about how disciplinary infractions may affect them in the admissions process, be assured that colleges are not black-and-white in their assessments of behavioral and criminal histories.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Disclose Disciplinary Infractions, Admissions Officials Say', 'kicker': 'The Choice', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T16:35:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rebecca R. Ruiz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rebecca', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Ruiz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/69c44c52-7d90-588c-a75d-3e4fedb66a50', 'word_count': 524, 'uri': 'nyt://article/69c44c52-7d90-588c-a75d-3e4fedb66a50'}, {'abstract': 'Performa 11, the visual art performance biennial, will present its first-ever Malcolm Award, named for the provocative punk-rock figure, to an artist who is 40 or younger and who has “demonstrated the most innovative and thought-provoking performance” in the event.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/27/new-arts-award-named-for-malcolm-mclaren/', 'snippet': 'Performa 11, the visual art performance biennial, will present its first-ever Malcolm Award, named for the provocative punk-rock figure, to an artist who is 40 or younger and who has “demonstrated the most innovative and thought-provoking performa...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Throughout a creative career whose highlights included organizing the seminal punk-rock band Sex Pistols, and which ended with his being buried in a coffin that read, “Too Fast to Live, Too Young to Die,” Malcolm McLaren was not necessarily concerned with how future generations – or current ones, for that matter – might regard him.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Arts Award Named for Malcolm McLaren', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McLaren, Malcolm', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Performa', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sex Pistols', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T16:35:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02f3d9e6-2db7-5569-8ef0-0dad76f40ce7', 'word_count': 428, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02f3d9e6-2db7-5569-8ef0-0dad76f40ce7'}, {'abstract': 'The American economy has finally reached the size it was before the recession began four years ago, according to the latest gross domestic product report from the Bureau of Economic Analysis.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/27/back-to-where-we-began-finally/', 'snippet': 'The American economy has finally reached the size it was before the recession began four years ago, according to the latest gross domestic product report from the Bureau of Economic Analysis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The American economy has finally reached the size it was before the recession began four years ago, according to the latest gross domestic product report from the Bureau of Economic Analysis.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Back to Where We Began. Finally.', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gross Domestic Product', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recession and Depression', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T16:38:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Catherine Rampell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Catherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rampell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0bb09fc3-56cf-5938-892a-cba1e2054093', 'word_count': 238, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0bb09fc3-56cf-5938-892a-cba1e2054093'}, {'abstract': 'With senior employees rushing for the exits, the embattled online media company is eager to sign a deal and calm its ranks.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/10/27/as-yahoo-bleeds-purple-a-push-for-a-deal/', 'snippet': 'With senior employees rushing for the exits, the embattled online media company is eager to sign a deal and calm its ranks.', 'lead_paragraph': '7:55 p.m. | Updated ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'As It Loses Executives, Yahoo Seeks a Deal', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers,