Supreme Court threw out a sex-discrimination case against Wal-Mart, the plaintiffs are trying again by narrowing the class to women in California only.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/28/business/women-file-new-class-action-bias-case-against-wal-mart.html', 'snippet': 'After the Supreme Court threw out a sex-discrimination case against Wal-Mart, the plaintiffs are trying again by narrowing the class to women in California only.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Four months after the Supreme Court tossed out their national class-action lawsuit, lawyers representing women who claimed that Wal-Mart Stores had discriminated against them filed a new lawsuit on Thursday that narrowed their claims to the California stores of the retail chain. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/28/business/Walmart/Walmart-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/28/business/Walmart/Walmart-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/28/business/Walmart/Walmart-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 593, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/28/business/Walmart/Walmart-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/28/business/Walmart/Walmart-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Female Wal-Mart Employees File New Bias Case', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Female Wal-Mart Employees File a New Bias Case', 'name': None, 'seo':