complaints, really) about whether college is worth the money, given how much it costs. If our previous reporting on the lower unemployment rates for college grads hasn’t convinced you, maybe this chart from the Federal Reserve Bank of Cleveland will:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'College Is Worth It', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve Bank of Cleveland', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-27T21:29:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Catherine Rampell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Catherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rampell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee59ccbf-af74-5ad2-99dc-d21f364f5b67', 'word_count': 79, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee59ccbf-af74-5ad2-99dc-d21f364f5b67'}, {'abstract': 'A Web video by a TV actor in support of Herman Cain brings a taste of the spaghetti western to the campaign.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/27/herman-cains-other-viral-vide/', 'snippet': 'A Web video by a TV actor in support of Herman Cain brings a taste of the spaghetti western to the campaign.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The viral video featuring Herman Cain’s chief of staff taking a long drag from a cigarette has prompted the discovery of another YouTube video sitting latent since August.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Discovering a Cain Campaign Sleeper Hit', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10