ctually make him well known to the reading public.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/28/us/peter-orners-new-book-love-and-shame-and-love-is-also-about-divorce-and-politics.html', 'snippet': 'Peter Orner is a star to other Bay Area authors, but his new book, “Love and Shame and Love,” may actually make him well known to the reading public.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Peter Orner is the publishing equivalent of a character actor: many Bay Area readers might recognize his name but not quite be able to place his work. Mr. Orner, a San Francisco resident, has written two books of fiction, with a third due in November, as well as numerous short stories and nonfiction articles, without yet carving out a national presence. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21B', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/28/us/28BCCULTURE/28BCCULTURE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/28/us/28BCCULTURE/28BCCULTURE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/28/us/28BCCULTURE/28BCCULTURE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Author Considers Love, Divorce and Politics', 'kicker': 'The Bay Citizen', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Author Considers Love, Divorce and Politics', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Love (Emotion)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Orner, Peter', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocatio