h suffered humbling losses. Hockey, anyone?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/28/us/the-lost-weekend-college-football-edition.html', 'snippet': 'Notre Dame, Northwestern and Illinois each suffered humbling losses. Hockey, anyone?', 'lead_paragraph': 'All the hoo-hah over the mercurial Bears getting to 4-3 and Theo Epstein’s much anticipated arrival in the Cubs’ front office this week had Chicago too excited to be bothered by some dismal college football. Notre Dame came up alarmingly small in its annual big game with Southern California; Northwestern’s losing streak reached five in a hard spanking by Penn State, and Illinois’s hot start was exposed as fakery in a dispiriting loss at Purdue.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21B', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/28/us/28CNCSPORTS/28CNCSPORTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 762, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Lost Weekend, College Football Edition', 'kicker': 'Chicago News Cooperative', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Lost Weekend, College Football Edition', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Notre Dame', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Southern California', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Northwestern University', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-28T01:00:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dan McGrath', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname'