 trial.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/28/nyregion/michael-carey-testifies-in-bell-shooting-police-trial.html', 'snippet': 'At an administrative trial, Officer Michael Carey echoed his description of the shooting of Sean Bell that he gave at his colleagues’ criminal trial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the last things he heard before the gunfire started was a warning, shouted out by an undercover detective: “He’s got a gun! Gun!”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/28/nyregion/CAREY/CAREY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 717, 'width': 561, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/28/nyregion/CAREY/CAREY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/28/nyregion/CAREY/CAREY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Officer Says He Thought Someone in Sean Bell’s Car Was Returning Fire', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Officer Says He Thought Someone in Sean Bell’s Car Was Returning Fire', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Isnora, Gescard F', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality and Misconduct', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bell, Sean', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carey, Michael', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-28T02:29:38+0000', 'document_typ