ban alternative to the countryside châteaux, gives a view into the life of the Parisian upper crust.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/28/paris-exhibit-shows-how-the-other-half-lived/', 'snippet': 'An exhibition on hôtels particuliers, extravagant stone mansions that were the urban alternative to the countryside châteaux, gives a view into the life of the Parisian upper crust.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The hôtels particuliers of France are unique in Europe, both architecturally and culturally. Town houses of nobles and aristocrats who attended the king’s Paris court, these extravagant stone mansions were the urban alternative to the countryside châteaux. Now, an exhibition at the Cité de l’Architecture in Paris traces their history, from the Middle Ages to World War I.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paris Exhibit Shows How the Other Half Lived', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Design', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-28T10:00:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elvire Camus', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elvire', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Camus', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a6ffd95a-f916-55fd-ab04-0c1e5817f932', 'word_count': 278, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6ffd95a-f916-55fd-ab04-0c1e5817f932'}, {'abstract': 'D.C. United is considering whether to sign Dwayne De Rosario, 33, to a long-term contract as one of the team’s designated players.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/28/decision-time-for-d-c-united-and-de-rosario/', 'snippet': 'D.C. United is considering whether to sign Dwayne De Rosario, 33, to a long-term contract as one of the team’s designated players.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Based exclusively on the 2011 season, D.C. United judged Dwayne De Rosario correctly, while the two teams who traded him — Toronto in April, and the Red Bulls in June — badly underestimated him. De Rosario finished tied for No. 1 in M.L.S. goals with 16, almost leading a D.C. United push that fell short of the playoffs. Thirteen of those goals, along with 7 assists, came in his 17 matches with D.C. United.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Decision Time for D.C. United and De Rosario', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'De Rosario, Dwayne', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DC United', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Major League Soccer', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-28T10:00:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Howard Megdal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Howard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Megdal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b282f698-bb99-5e99-b22e-cfb203a56226', 'word_count': 663, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b282f698-bb99-5e99-b22e-cfb203a56226'}, {'abstract': 'Political news from today’s Times, plus a look at what’s happening in Washington.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/28/the-early-word-methodology/', 