at the debt plan would be a long-term solution.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Stocks in the United States eased back on Friday from their biggest monthly rally in decades, ending relatively flat as the euphoria over Europe’s plan to address its sovereign debt crisis eased.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Shares Settle After Rally Over European Debt Deal', 'kicker': 'Stocks & Bonds', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Shares Settle After Rally Over European Debt Deal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-28T13:43:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Hauser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hauser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/03a8cbfb-5027-50a9-9661-c6ccaae5b47a', 'word_count': 580, 'uri': 'nyt://article/03a8cbfb-5027-50a9-9661-c6ccaae5b47a'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Jackson said he was working with Damien Echols to see him fully exonerated of a 1994 murder conviction. Mr. Echols and two other Arkansas men were recently released from prison following a deal that required them to plead guilty even as they continue to maintain their innocence.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/28/peter-jackson-says-hell-help-west-memphis-three-figure-seek-pardon/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Jackson said he was working with Damien Echols to see him fully exonerated of a 1994 murder conviction. Mr. Echols and two other Arkansas men were recently released from prison following a deal that required them to plead guilty even as they c...', 'lead_paragraph': 'At a news conference on Friday in New Zealand Peter Jackson, the director of the “Lord of the Rings” trilogy and a coming two-part film adaptation of “The Hobbit,” said he was working with one of the recently released Arkansas men known as the West Memphis Three to help get him exonerated of the crimes for which the three spent nearly 20 years in prison. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Peter Jackson Says He’ll Help One of the West Memphis Three Seek a Pardon', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-28T13:51:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50168f71-2c58-51cb-9323-7755915d4a91', 'word_count': 315, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50168f71-2c58-51cb-9323-7755915d4a91'}, {'abstract': 'It is up to Silvio Berlusconi to keep Italy from becoming another Greece and plunging the world into an even more devastating financial crisis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/29/business/the-spotlight-now-shines-on-italy-common-sense.html', 'snippet': 'It is up to Silvio Berlusconi to keep Italy from becoming another Greece and plunging the world into an even more devastating financial crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It finally dawned on me this week that the value of my retirement account might depend on Silvio Berlusconi.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/29/business/Stewart/Stewart-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 737, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'j