 corner of the study, Maus’s spare cabin looks like the lair of a lonely grad student desperately trying to finish a dissertation on the concept of inoperative community. Which, in fact, it is.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '41', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/magazine/mag-30maus-t_CA0/mag-30maus-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/magazine/mag-30maus-t_CA0/mag-30maus-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/30/magazine/mag-30maus-t_CA0/mag-30maus-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Orchestral Maneuvers of John Maus', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Orchestral Maneuver', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maus, John', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-28T14:26:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Wm. Ferguson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Wm', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2f325710-1d83-5159-b610-9910b52c9425', 'word_count': 798, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2f325710-1d83-5159-b610-9910b52c9425'}, {'abstract': 'A preview of "War Horse," directed by Steven Spielberg.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/movies/100000001140930/tr