n establishment. But in the course of it, he talks about what is the Republican establishment and that the establishment believes now that they are co-opting the Tea Party, [who] are really only the kind of radicals who have always come to town with a fiery new idea and then become co-opted. But Bai, in the reporting of this, really shows that there are major differences between former radicals who came to Washington and then got tempered by money and time and victories and defeats, and that [Tea Party members] are in fact a new breed who are . . . almost humorlessly addicted in a sense to the whole idea of antigovernment. . . . A sort of reverse takeover could be going on.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Does Anyone Have a Grip On the G.O.P.?', 'kicker': 'Reply All | Letters', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Does Anyone Have a Grip On the G.O.P.?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tea Party Movement', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-28T14:27:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/7919129f-8ec2-5f07-8a87-e664245888f7', 'word_count': 751, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7919129f-8ec2-5f07-8a87-e664245888f7'}, {'abstract': 'A preview of "The Adventures of Tintin," directed by Steven Spielberg.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/movies/100000001140919/trailer-the-adventures-of-tintin.html', 'snippet': 'A preview of "The Adventures of Tintin," directed by Steven Spielberg.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A preview of "The Adventures of Tintin," directed by Steven Spielberg.', '