ral.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Officials at St. Paul’s Cathedral said Friday that they would go to court to force the removal of hundreds of protesters who have camped outside the cathedral for two weeks, demonstrating against economic inequality and corporate greed.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/29/world/29CATHEDRAL/29CATHEDRAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/29/world/29CATHEDRAL/29CATHEDRAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/29/world/29CATHEDRAL/29CATHEDRAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 636, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/29/world/29CATHEDRAL/29CATHEDRAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/29/world/29CATHEDRAL/29CATHEDRAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Officials at St. Paul’s Cathedral in London Move to Evict Protesters Camped Outside', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Officials at St. Paul’s Cathedral in London Move to Evict Protesters Camped Outside', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Churches (Buildings)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Occupy Wall Street', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-28T22:54:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ravi Somaiya', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ravi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Somaiya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3fa77462-16a1-51ce-adf2-77a8762a0b46', 'word_count': 490, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3fa77462-16a1-51ce-adf2-77a8762a0b46'}, {'abstract': 'William A. Ackman’s hedge fund, Pershing Square Capital Management, disclosed late Friday that it had acquired a 12.2 percent stake in Canadian Pacific.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2011/10/28/ackman-takes-a-ride-on-the-canadian-pacific-railway/', 'snippet': 'William A. Ackman’s hedge fund, Pershing Square Capital Management, disclosed late Friday that it had acquired a 12.2 percent stake in Canadian Pacific.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The billionaire hedge fund manager William A. Ackman has been working on the railroad — in particular, the Canadian Pacific Railway.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ackman Takes a Ride on the Canadian Pacific Railway', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-28T22:57:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dealbook', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dealbook', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/43ae26c4-90c4-5491-9e18-5576c47a4421', 'word_count': 226, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43ae26c4-90c4-5491-9e18-5576c47a4421'}, {'abstract': 'Fox’s new animated show, “Allen Gregory,” features Jonah Hill as the voice of the title character, a somewhat privileged 7-year-old horrified that he has to attend first grade in a public school.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/29/arts/television/allen-gregory-jonah-hills-new-fox-cartoon-review.html', 'snippet': 'Fox’s new animated show, “Allen Gregory,” features Jonah Hill as the voice of the title character, a somewhat privileged 7-year-old horrified that he has to attend first grade in a public school.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A fundamental problem with the new Fox cartoon “Allen Gregory” — though not the biggest one — is that it’s never clear what the show is satirizing. The title character is nominally a privileged 7-year-old horrified at the prospect of attending a public elementary school, but he’s drawn as a boutonniere-wearing dandy and talks like a supremely egotistical talent agent. He’s a little bit Stewie from “Family Guy,” a little bit Ari Gold from “Entourage,” a little bit Frasier and Niles Crane, a little bit Mr. Magoo.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/29/arts/allen/allen-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/29/arts/allen/allen-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/29/arts/allen/allen-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 691, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/29/arts/allen/allen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/29/arts/allen/allen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {