 on income disparity, most of the presidential candidates find themselves on the wealthy side of the divide.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/29/us/politics/most-presidential-candidates-are-not-the-99-percent.html', 'snippet': 'As the Occupy protests turn a spotlight on income disparity, most of the presidential candidates find themselves on the wealthy side of the divide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Occupy Wall Street protesters have touched a nerve with their slogan, “We are the 99 percent.” It has focused attention on the ground gained by the rich even as a brutal economy has pushed the typical American family backward. Economic inequality may or may not become a central issue in the presidential race, but the candidates have at least one reason to hope it does not.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/29/us/WEALTHY/WEALTHY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 295, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/29/us/WEALTHY/WEALTHY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 295}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/29/us/WEALTHY/WEALTHY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 503, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/29/us/WEALTHY/WEALTHY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/29/us/WEALTHY/WEALTHY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Presidential Candidates? Few Are the 99 Percent', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Presidential Candidates? Few Are the 99 Percent', 'name':