 [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vitello', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/a1b2c9a6-8828-5014-b110-599c6db8a238', 'word_count': 861, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1b2c9a6-8828-5014-b110-599c6db8a238'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Wolpe played a key role in passing legislation that imposed economic sanctions on South Africa, despite two vetoes by President Ronald Reagan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/29/us/politics/ex-congressman-howard-wolpe-who-pushed-for-anti-apartheid-act-dies-at-71.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Wolpe played a key role in passing legislation that imposed economic sanctions on South Africa, despite two vetoes by President Ronald Reagan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Howard E. Wolpe, a former congressman who played a crucial role in passing legislation that imposed economic sanctions on South Africa in the 1980s, helping to bring an end to apartheid while overcoming two vetoes by President Ronald Reagan, died Tuesday at his home in Saugatuck, Mich. He was 71.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/29/us/WOLPE-obit/WOLPE-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 915, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/29/us/WOLPE-obit/WOLPE-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/29/us/WOLPE-obit/WOLPE-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Howard Wolpe, Backer of ’86 Anti-Apartheid Act, Dies at 71', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Howard Wolpe, 71, Backer