c turnaround that has taken place since Kenny Dalglish took over.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/29/at-liverpool-the-statistics-sometimes-lie/', 'snippet': 'Liverpool’s place in the standings is only one reflection of the dramatic turnaround that has taken place since Kenny Dalglish took over.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Liverpool fans well recall just how deflated Anfield seemed when a League Two side, Northampton, sent the Reds crashing out of the Carling Cup at the first opportunity last September.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Liverpool, the Statistics Sometimes Lie', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Liverpool (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-29T05:30:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Graham Ruthven', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Graham', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ruthven', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd529363-2a5e-50ab-a2f7-750503846970', 'word_count': 476, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd529363-2a5e-50ab-a2f7-750503846970'}, {'abstract': 'There are plenty of musicals with clever lyrics. Some offer clever books. A handful even manage clever melodies. “City of Angels” has all three.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/30/nyregion/review-city-of-angels-at-goodspeed-opera-house-in-east-haddam.html', 'snippet': 'There are plenty of musicals with clever lyrics. Some offer clever books. A handful even manage clever melodies. “City of Angels” has all three.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are plenty of musicals with clever lyrics. Some offer clever books. A handful even manage clever melodies. But “City of Angels,” which won six Tonys in 1990, is the rarity that has all three. And it demands clever costumes, clever sets and clever staging as well.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/nyregion/30ARTSCT-1_SPAN/30ARTSCT-1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 388, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/30/nyregion/30ARTSCT-1_SPAN/30ARTSCT-1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 388}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/nyregion/30ARTSCT-1_SPAN/30ARTSCT-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/nyregion/30ARTSCT-1_SPAN/30ARTSCT-1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/30/nyregion/30ARTSCT-1_SPAN/30ARTSCT-1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Palm-Studded Outpost of 1940s Hollywood', 'kicker': 'Arts | Connecticut', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Palm-Studded Outpost of 1940s Hollywood', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tresnjak, Darko', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gelbart, Larry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Connecticut', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coleman, Cy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'v