', 'value': 'Power Outages and Blackouts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Snow and Snowstorms', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pennsylvania', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-29T16:27:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Al Baker, Elizabeth A. Harris and Sarah Maslin Nir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Al', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Elizabeth', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Harris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': 'Maslin', 'lastname': 'Nir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62b74ba2-163d-5c62-ab12-8b76883dedaa', 'word_count': 1399, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62b74ba2-163d-5c62-ab12-8b76883dedaa'}, {'abstract': 'The Colts had won at least 10 games for nine consecutive years before quarterback Peyton Manning’s neck injury; this year they are 0-7.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/30/sports/football/without-him-colts-make-manning-seem-underrated.html', 'snippet': 'The Colts had won at least 10 games for nine consecutive years before quarterback Peyton Manning’s neck injury; this year they are 0-7.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has long been a truism in sports: there is perhaps no player more important in any team game than the quarterback.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/sports/colts-si