s-the-burden-of-his-human-connections.html', 'snippet': 'Big Brown won two-thirds of horse racing’s Triple Crown in 2008, but questions about steroids and the financial dealings of his owners have clouded his legacy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LEXINGTON, Ky. — Big Brown is having a good autumn. His first crop of yearlings, a handsome bunch, has been selling crisply. The horsemen here in the bluegrass in advance of this week’s 28th Breeders’ Cup have been buzzing about what they have seen from Big Brown’s babies in the sales ring. The big bay is in Australia, mating with a full book of 130 mares, and being paid nicely to do so: $27,500 a date.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/sports/dog-big-brown-2/dog-big-brown-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/30/sports/dog-big-brown-2/dog-big-brown-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/sports/dog-big-brown-2/dog-big-brown-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/sports/dog-big-brown-2/dog-big-brown-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/30/sports/dog-big-brown-2/dog-big-brown-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Big Brown Carries the Burden of His Owners', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Big Brown Carries the Burden of His Owners', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'na