html', 'snippet': 'The food business has long been important to Paul Bensabat of the Manischewitz Company. He learned his first business lesson selling lollipops at age 6.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I \u2002WAS born in Casablanca when Morocco was still a French protectorate. The humid climate was not good for my asthma, so when I was 7 my parents sent me to a home for children in a French mountain village where the air was healthier. My parents visited when they could and I went home during holidays, but the separation was traumatic for all of us. I lived there for three years and it cured my asthma.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/business/30-BOSS/30-BOSS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 790, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/business/30-BOSS/30-BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/30/business/30-BOSS/30-BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A King of Kosher', 'kicker': 'The Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A King of Kosher', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kosher Foods and Products', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Careers and Professions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Manischewitz Company', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executives and Management (Theory)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-29T20:07:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'NAT', 'section_name': 'Job Market', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Bensabat', 'person': [{'fi