rformances and other events.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/30/us/los-cenzontles-mexican-arts-center.html', 'snippet': 'At Los Cenzontles Mexican Arts Center in San Pablo, Calif., the culture of Mexico is celebrated through classes, performances and other events.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tucked between a laundry and a discount grocery in a strip mall, Los Cenzontles Mexican Arts Center — a nonprofit organization founded in 1994 by the musician Eugene Rodriguez — offers classes in Mexican dance, music and art for children of all ages. The rhythmic beat of stomping feet echoes into the parking lot.  LOUISE RAFKIN', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25B', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/us/30BCINTEL1/30BCINTEL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/us/30BCINTEL1/30BCINTEL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/30/us/30BCINTEL1/30BCINTEL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Los Cenzontles Mexican Arts Center', 'kicker': 'The Bay Citizen | Local Intelligence', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'San Pablo: Los Cenzontles Mexican Arts Center', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mexican-Americans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Cenzontles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-29T20:32:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline':