ools, the new nation of South Sudan has further cemented its pivot from the Arab world of northern Africa.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/30/world/africa/south-sudan-turns-toward-british-heritage.html', 'snippet': 'In moving to join the Commonwealth and deciding to use English in schools, the new nation of South Sudan has further cemented its pivot from the Arab world of northern Africa.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOGADISHU, Somalia — The new nation of South Sudan has expressed a desire to join the Commonwealth, a group composed mainly of former British colonies, and said that it would change the language used in schools from Arabic to English. The two actions further cement its pivot from the Arab world of northern Africa toward the largely Anglophone east.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'South Sudan Turns Toward British Heritage', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'South Sudan Turns Toward British Heritage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Sudan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sudan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Commonwealth of Nations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-29T21:07:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Josh Kron', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Josh', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kron', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/83f0f6e6-88b9-5d88-8767-288c4b571d6c', 'word_count': 313, 'uri': 'nyt://article/83f0f6e6-88b9-5d88-8767-288c4b571d6c'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Beaumont, appalled by the United States’ appetite for oil, sold some 2,000 electric cars, decades before General Motors and Nissan created their own versions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/30/business/bob-beaumont-who-popularized-electric-cars-dies-at-79.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Beaumont, appalled by the United States’ appetite for oil, sold some 2,000 electric cars, decades before General Motors and Nissan created their own versions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bob Beaumont, who thought every home should have an affordable electric vehicle in its driveway and sold more than 2,000 of them, the tiny, trapezoidal creation known as the CitiCar, decades before General Motors and Nissan came up with their own versions, died on Monday at his home in Columbia, Md. He was 79.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/business/dogBEAUMONT2-obit/dogBEAUMONT2-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/10/30/business/dogBEAUMONT2-obit/dogBEAUMONT2-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/business/dogBEAUMONT2-obit/dogBEAUMONT2-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/30/business/dogBEAUMONT2-obit/dogBEAUMONT2-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/30/business/dogBEAUMONT2-obit/dogBEAUMONT2-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bob Beaumont, Who Popularized Electric Cars, Dies at 79', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 