 {'abstract': 'Havre de Grace has won five of her six starts this year, including an impressive victory in the Woodward Stakes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/10/31/sports/havre-de-grace-is-horse-to-beat-in-breeders-cup-classic.html', 'snippet': 'Havre de Grace has won five of her six starts this year, including an impressive victory in the Woodward Stakes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the third year in a row, the Breeders’ Cup Classic’s Big Horse is a she, and this she goes by the name of Havre de Grace. A daughter of Saint Liam, Havre de Grace is the likely morning-line favorite for the 28th running of the Classic, North America’s richest race, on the strength of victories in five of six starts in 2011, including a convincing thumping of the boys in the Woodward Stakes.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/31/sports/YRACING/YRACING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/10/31/sports/YRACING/YRACING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/10/31/sports/YRACING/YRACING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Once Again, Fast Female Is the Horse to Beat in the Breeders’ Cup Classic', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fast Filly At Forefront In Classic', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Larry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Breeders' Cup (Horse Race)", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-31T01:56:29+0000', 'do