a9a8-b24784d84caf'}, {'abstract': 'Praise for a think tank.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/31/epiphenomena/', 'snippet': 'Praise for a think tank.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Steve Pearlstein has a very nice piece about the Economic Policy Institute, which is indeed the small think tank that could, playing a disproportionate role in policy discussion. I still consider Obama’s failure to appoint someone from EPI to a senior position one of his biggest mistakes; he really needed someone who would speak up for workers and a view of economics not tinged by financial-sector connections.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'EPIphenomena', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2011-10-31T14:52:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/99debd29-f2f9-5a59-a9ad-6faf59b47d12', 'word_count': 321, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99debd29-f2f9-5a59-a9ad-6faf59b47d12'}, {'abstract': 'The Supreme Court refused to hear an appeal of a ruling that putting crosses along Utah highways to honor fallen state troopers violated the First Amendment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/11/01/us/justices-decline-case-on-highway-crosses.html', 'snippet': 'The Supreme Court refused to hear an appeal of a ruling that putting crosses along Utah highways to honor fallen state troopers violated the First Amendment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Supreme Court on Monday refused to hear an appeal of a ruling that the placement of crosses on the side of Utah highways to honor fallen state troopers violated the First Amendment’s pr