d Series, Tony La Russa retired with 2,728 victories, third most among managers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/11/01/sports/baseball/cardinals-la-russa-announces-retirement.html', 'snippet': 'Three days after the Cardinals won the World Series, Tony La Russa retired with 2,728 victories, third most among managers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During a meeting with ESPN broadcasters before Game 5 of the World Series, a surprisingly relaxed Tony La Russa asked the former pitcher Orel Hershiser about his talents as a table tennis player and requested that the announcer Dan Shulman put into context the St. Louis Cardinals’ accomplishment in rallying from a 10 ½-game deficit to get to the World Series.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/01/sports/yyylarussa/yyylarussa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/11/01/sports/yyylarussa/yyylarussa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/01/sports/yyylarussa/yyylarussa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 633, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/01/sports/yyylarussa/yyylarussa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/11/01/sports/yyylarussa/yyylarussa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Cardinals’ La Russa Retires on Top', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '3rd Title in Hand, Cardinals’ La Russa Retires', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'key