 record at the Broadhurst Theater, earning more than of $1.2 million last week, a result of the producers’ decision to charge exorbitant prices for tickets.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2011/10/31/unusually-high-prices-jack-up-hugh-jackmans-broadway-haul/', 'snippet': 'Hugh Jackman’s new concert on Broadway set a house record at the Broadhurst Theater, earning more than of $1.2 million last week, a result of the producers’ decision to charge exorbitant prices for tickets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hugh Jackman’s new concert on Broadway set a house record at the Broadhurst Theater, earning more than of $1.2 million last week, a result of the producers’ decision to charge exorbitant prices for tickets to Mr. Jackman’s first return to Broadway as a singer since his Tony Award-winning performance in “The Boy from Oz” eight years ago. The previous record at the Broadhurst was about $1.18 million set by a production of “Merchant of Venice” starring Al Pacino during the week between Christmas and New Year’s Day last season.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hugh Jackman’s Show Earns More Than $1.2 Million', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jackman, Hugh', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Broadway League', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-31T21:25:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a1a2ac7d-03b1-5301-bf15-8875116d8661', 'word_count': 393, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1a2ac7d-03b1-5301-bf15-8875116d8661'}, {'abstract': 'Shantala Shivalingappa, a specialist in the South Indian Kuchipudi classical dance form, and several Indian musicians performed in a World Music Institute presentation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2011/11/01/arts/dance/shantala-shivalingappa-at-skirball-center-at-nyu-review.html', 'snippet': 'Shantala Shivalingappa, a specialist in the South Indian Kuchipudi classical dance form, and several Indian musicians performed in a World Music Institute presentation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over the past decade New Yorkers have caught tantalizing glimpses of the Indian dancer Shantala Shivalingappa at the Fall for Dance Festival and in several works by Pina Bausch. On Sunday, however, the World Music Institute gave us a whole evening of Ms. Shivalingappa, at the Skirball Center for the Performing Arts. One evening was hardly enough.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/01/arts/shantala/shantala-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 814, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Unveiling the Attributes of the Divine', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Unveiling the Attributes of the Divine', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bausch, Pina', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Music Institute', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2011-10-31T21:26:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Seibert', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Seibert', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}